\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/10: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,702 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally above its immediate resistance could attract buying in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) tight consolidation near its local top suggests that traders are waiting for a catalyst to start the next trending move. The consumer price data on April 12 and the producer price index data on April 13 could give insight into the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s future rate hikes and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cpi-to-spark-dollar-massacre-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shake the traders out of their slumber}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The dull price action in Bitcoin has not reduced the interest in it. According to Ahrefs search volume data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tops-donald-trump-guns-in-america-google-trends"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin remains the most Googled term}}}\uc2  in the United States followed by the keywords Donald Trump and Breaking news.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/fc05d6d3-7a85-4a6c-abc0-f9296c2e9d6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another point worth noting is that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-in-circulation-over-50-not-moved-in-2-years-glassnode-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s circulating supply continues to dwindle}}}\uc2 . Citing Glassnode data, investor Anthony Pompliano pointed out that 53% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s circulating supply has not moved in the past two years.\par \par \uc2 If demand increases, there could be a shortage of supply, which could boost prices higher. What are the critical resistance levels to watch for in Bitcoin and altcoins in the near term?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) turned up after a two-day correction on April 6, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/9f1370a2-535e-453f-ab94-b82f6be7061a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (4,035) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory increase the likelihood of a rally to 4,200. Although this level has behaved as a formidable barrier in the past, it is likely to be scaled during the third attempt. If that happens, the index may challenge the 4,300 resistance. This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If this support cracks, the index could retest the vital support at the 200-day simple moving average ($3,944).\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index continues to trade below the 20-day EMA (102.73), indicating that the short-term trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Sellers are likely to defend the 20-day EMA during the current relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0e907a80-6b75-4098-8ef0-7a5717f72780.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the index may drop to the vital support of 100.82. The bulls are expected to guard this level with all their might because a break below it will complete a head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. The index may then start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the 100.82 support and rises above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the index may oscillate between 100.82 and the 200-day SMA (106.47) for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day EMA ($27,692) on April 9, indicating buying at lower levels. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/f0da85f5-ebf1-4ee8-9681-4e061f811645.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $29,200 is the key level to watch for on the upside. If bulls pierce this resistance, the BTC/USDT pair may climb to $30,000. The bears will try to stall the rally at this level but the likelihood of a break above it is high. The pair may then soar to $32,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again turns down from $29,200, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then make one more attempt to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may slump to $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($1,813) on April 9, indicating that the trend remains positive in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/e0240a80-146c-413c-8f62-73c5fdd41259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to overcome the barrier at $1,943 and catapult the price to $2,200. Sellers are likely to fiercely defend the zone between $2,000 and $2,200. If the price turns down from this zone but does not break below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the rally may extend further.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. The ETH/USDT pair could then descend to the strong support zone of $1,743 to $1,680.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($313) for the past few days but the bulls have not allowed the price to slide below the immediate support at $306. This suggests that the selling pressure dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/319fbc20-f998-4986-b3e6-7ae2dd65c293.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will take advantage of the situation and try to drive the price above the overhead resistance of $318. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and soar to $338 and later to $346.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are selling on every minor relief rally. If the $306 level gives way, the pair may slip to the 200-day SMA ($292).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.49 for the past few days, indicating that buyers are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0136d85f-7e20-489a-ab3c-825cb71e46c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position by pushing the price to the overhead zone between $0.56 to $0.58. This remains the key zone to keep an eye on because a break above it could open the doors for a potential rally to $0.65 and thereafter to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.48), it will suggest that short-term traders may be booking profits. That could tug the XRP/USDT pair to the important support at $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($0.37) for the past few days but the bulls are struggling to clear the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. This suggests that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/5b85456a-29af-4903-99c6-0f3876b13977.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight consolidation is followed by a sharp breakout. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive area suggest that the breakout may happen to the upside. A close above the neckline will complete the reversal setup and signal the start of a new uptrend toward the target objective of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then tumble to the 200-day SMA ($0.35). This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pop-or-drop-bitcoin-analysts-decide-if-btc-price-will-beat-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Pop or drop?\u8217\'20\'19 Bitcoin analysts decide if BTC price will beat $30K}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to sink Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) below the support line on April 9 and 10 but the bulls held their ground. This suggests buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/baca8bc2-aee2-4151-9954-3979b01a86f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.11). If they are successful, the MATIC/USDT pair could surge to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. A break and close above the triangle will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That will clear the path for a possible rally to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and plunges below the support line, it will indicate that bears are in control. The pair may then retest the vital support at the 200-day SMA ($0.99).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) successfully held the moving averages on April 8 but the shallow bounce on April 9 suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8b1b9840-ea6f-493a-8089-226a6ebd3da8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The bounce off the current level could face selling at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.09. If the price turns down from this level, the DOGE/USDT pair may oscillate between $0.09 and the moving averages for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break below the moving averages could sink the pair to the strong support of $0.07 while a rise above $0.09 will increase the likelihood of a rally to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The trading range in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has narrowed down further, indicating uncertainty among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ebfc2260-191d-4e81-9be8-2f8f84ee72b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($20.64) and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. Hence, it is better to wait for a breakout to happen before waging large bets.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and pierces the downtrend line, it may attract strong buying by the bulls. The SOL/USDT pair could then start a rally to $27 and subsequently to $39. On the other hand, the selling could intensify if the price collapses below $18.70. The pair may then nosedive to $15.28.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvOTcxYjgzNGMtOTY4My00ZDI3LWEzYzAtZGU1MDgzMmIwZjUxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230410ej4a000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price sets up for an explosive move as  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XLM, AAVE and CFX turn  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,595 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , XLM, AAVE and CFX could rally if Bitcoin overcomes its overhead resistance at $29,200.\par \par \uc2 The long weekend has not produced any fireworks in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price, which continues to trade inside an ever-narrowing range. Bitcoin is on track to form a third consecutive Doji candlestick pattern on the weekly chart. This suggests that the Bitcoin bulls and the bears are not clear about the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 It is not only Bitcoin that is stuck inside a range. On April 7, Jurrien Timmer, director of global macro at asset manager \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , tweeted that the S&P 500 Index had been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-expect-big-move-next-as-btc-price-flatlines-at-28k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stuck inside a range}}}\uc2  for the past nine months and a breakout was due \u8220\'20\'1Csooner or later.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/099d1de2-f5ee-4d47-a49a-0f6e062d65bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to break above the $30,000 level has attracted profit-booking in several altcoins but a few have witnessed shallow pullbacks. This indicates that traders are holding on to their positions expecting a move higher.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of select altcoins that may turn up and start an uptrend if Bitcoin breaks out to the upside. What are the resistance levels above which these five cryptocurrencies turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading inside a tight range for the past two days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Usually, tight ranges are followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1781940c-b54a-4893-8d93-9d090312302b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($27,500) is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has gradually been slipping toward the center. This suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price tumbles below the 20-day EMA, several short-term stop losses may be triggered and the BTC/USDT pair may dive to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. A rally above $29,200 could enhance the prospects of a rally to $30,000 and subsequently to $32,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/629a6c74-39c1-43af-bd27-9138249b5c6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA is flattening out on the four-hour chart and the RSI is just below the midpoint. This does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long, and a directional move could soon start. However, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before establishing directional bets. The important level to watch on the upside is $29,200 and on the downside is $26,500. A breach of either level could start a short-term trending move.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are not allowing Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.37), indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/b3bc353e-f473-411e-9d77-4ee3590582b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive area suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first rise to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. A break and close above this resistance will signal a potential trend change. The pair could then rally toward the pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to quickly yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then drop to the 200-day simple moving average ($0.35) and later to $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a101e7f0-bdd0-4e89-8e6c-b28a5202ab9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bulls have pushed the price above the 20-EMA and will next try to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line. If they do that, it will suggest that the pullback may be over. The pair may then climb to the neckline where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price faces rejection at the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The selling could accelerate below $0.37 and the pair may plunge to the 200-SMA.\par \par \uc2 Stellar price analysis\par \par \uc2 Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.12 and the price is nearing the 20-day EMA ($0.10). The bulls are likely to buy the dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/efec5514-8789-480d-a18b-8ca7ca24f89b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle. If they succeed, the XLM/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rounding bottom pattern. That could signal the start of a new up-move. The pair may first rally to $0.15 and thereafter march toward the pattern target of $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.09). This is a make-or-break level for the bulls because if it cracks, the pair may plummet to $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1ed21053-04f0-42a5-97ea-28f85ae74459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the pair is correcting inside a falling wedge pattern. The price has bounced off the support line and the bulls will next attempt to propel the pair above the wedge. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $0.11 and subsequently to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and plummets below the support line, it will suggest that the selling has intensified. There is a small support at $0.10 but if that cracks, the decline could extend to the 200-SMA.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sushiswap-approval-bug-leads-to-3-3-million-exploit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SushiSwap approval bug leads to $3.3 million exploit}}}\par \par \uc2 Aave price analysis\par \par \uc2 Aave ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the overhead resistance of $82, indicating that the bears are fiercely protecting this level. They have pulled the price below the immediate support at the 20-day EMA ($75).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8de87b37-b31c-4ac5-8d85-0376fba8d7b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AAVE/USDT pair could next slip to the 200-day SMA ($73), which is close to the uptrend line. Buyers are likely to defend this level with vigor. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could reach $82.\par \par \uc2 If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective of $100. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price continues lower and breaks below the uptrend line. The pair may then slide to $68 and later to $64.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c203cef2-1405-401f-afe5-dcf881fefb0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price to the 200-SMA on the four-hour chart. The 20-EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the 200-SMA gives way, the pair could decline further to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will further strengthen the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the 20-EMA will be the first sign that the bulls are making a comeback. The pair may then rise to the overhead resistance at $82.\par \par \uc2 CFX price analysis\par \par \uc2 Conflux (CFX) has been in a corrective phase for the past few days but a minor positive is that the bulls are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.36).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0efb398c-d7b1-4203-a044-5ff8f4bde710.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CFX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the CFX/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. This is an important level for the bears to guard because a break above it could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.44 and then $0.49.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price plunges and sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. That could attract further selling, pulling the price toward the next support at $0.30. The bulls are expected to buy the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ce367610-3dc1-48d3-bbbe-5a5fddf395a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CFX/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The four-hour chart shows that the bears are trying to keep the price below the 20-EMA. That could pull the pair to the 200-SMA, which is likely to act as a major support.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to drive the price to the downtrend line. This is the key level to keep an eye on because a break above it will signal that bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the $0.30 support could attract further selling, sinking the price to $0.25.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvZGE0NTExYzUtMWNmNS00Yzk0LWE0ZmQtNGJjMmVlMTRhMTgwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230410ej4900008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price sets up for an explosive move as  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XLM, AAVE and CFX turn  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,597 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . XLM, AAVE and CFX could rally if Bitcoin overcomes its overhead resistance at $29.200.\par \par \uc2 The long weekend has not produced any fireworks in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price, which continues to trade inside an ever-narrowing range. Bitcoin is on track to form a third consecutive Doji candlestick pattern on the weekly chart. This suggests that the Bitcoin bulls and the bears are not clear about the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 It is not only Bitcoin that is stuck inside a range. On April 7, Jurrien Timmer, director of global macro at asset manager \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , tweeted that the S&P 500 Index had been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-expect-big-move-next-as-btc-price-flatlines-at-28k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stuck inside a range}}}\uc2  for the past nine months and a breakout was due \u8220\'20\'1Csooner or later.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/099d1de2-f5ee-4d47-a49a-0f6e062d65bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to break above the $30,000 level has attracted profit-booking in several altcoins but a few have witnessed shallow pullbacks. This indicates that traders are holding on to their positions expecting a move higher.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of select altcoins that may turn up and start an uptrend if Bitcoin breaks out to the upside. What are the resistance levels above which these five cryptocurrencies turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading inside a tight range for the past two days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Usually, tight ranges are followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1781940c-b54a-4893-8d93-9d090312302b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($27,500) is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has gradually been slipping toward the center. This suggests a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price tumbles below the 20-day EMA, several short-term stop losses may be triggered and the BTC/USDT pair may dive to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. A rally above $29,200 could enhance the prospects of a rally to $30,000 and subsequently to $32,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/629a6c74-39c1-43af-bd27-9138249b5c6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-EMA is flattening out on the 4-hour chart and the RSI is just below the midpoint. This does not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long and a directional move could soon start. However, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before establishing directional bets. The important level to watch on the upside is $29,200 and on the downside is $26,500. A breach of either level could start a short-term trending move.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are not allowing Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.37), indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/b3bc353e-f473-411e-9d77-4ee3590582b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive area suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first rise to the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. A break and close above this resistance will signal a potential trend change. The pair could then rally toward the pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to quickly yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then drop to the 200-day simple moving average ($0.35) and later to $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a101e7f0-bdd0-4e89-8e6c-b28a5202ab9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls have pushed the price above the 20-EMA and will next try to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line. If they do that, it will suggest that the pullback may be over. The pair may then climb to the neckline where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price faces rejection at the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The selling could accelerate below $0.37 and the pair may plunge to the 200-SMA.\par \par \uc2 Stellar price analysis\par \par \uc2 Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.12 and the price is nearing the 20-day EMA ($0.10). The bulls are likely to buy the dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/efec5514-8789-480d-a18b-8ca7ca24f89b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle. If they succeed, the XLM/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rounding bottom pattern. That could signal the start of a new up-move. The pair may first rally to $0.15 and thereafter march toward the pattern target of $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then drop to the 200-day SMA ($0.09). This is a make-or-break level for the bulls because if it cracks, the pair may plummet to $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1ed21053-04f0-42a5-97ea-28f85ae74459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the pair is correcting inside a falling wedge pattern. The price has bounced off the support line and the bulls will next attempt to propel the pair above the wedge. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $0.11 and subsequently to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and plummets below the support line, it will suggest that the selling has intensified. There is a small support at $0.10 but if that cracks, the decline could extend to the 200-SMA.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sushiswap-approval-bug-leads-to-3-3-million-exploit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SushiSwap approval bug leads to $3.3 million exploit}}}\par \par \uc2 Aave price analysis\par \par \uc2 Aave ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AAVE}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the overhead resistance of $82, indicating that the bears are fiercely protecting this level. They have pulled the price below the immediate support at the 20-day EMA ($75).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8de87b37-b31c-4ac5-8d85-0376fba8d7b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AAVE/USDT pair could next slip to the 200-day SMA ($73), which is close to the uptrend line. Buyers are likely to defend this level with vigor. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could reach $82.\par \par \uc2 If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective of $100. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price continues lower and breaks below the uptrend line. The pair may then slide to $68 and later to $64.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c203cef2-1405-401f-afe5-dcf881fefb0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AAVE/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price to the 200-SMA on the 4-hour chart. The 20-EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the 200-SMA gives way, the pair could decline further to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will further strengthen the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the 20-EMA will be the first sign that the bulls are making a comeback. The pair may then rise to the overhead resistance at $82.\par \par \uc2 CFX price analysis\par \par \uc2 Conflux (CFX) has been in a corrective phase for the past few days but a minor positive is that the bulls are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.36).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/0efb398c-d7b1-4203-a044-5ff8f4bde710.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CFX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the CFX/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. This is an important level for the bears to guard because a break above it could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.44 and then $0.49.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price plunges and sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. That could attract further selling, pulling the price toward the next support at $0.30. The bulls are expected to buy the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/ce367610-3dc1-48d3-bbbe-5a5fddf395a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CFX/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears are trying to keep the price below the 20-EMA. That could pull the pair to the 200-SMA, which is likely to act as a major support.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to drive the price to the downtrend line. This is the key level to keep an eye on because a break above it will signal that bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the $0.30 support could attract further selling, sinking the price to $0.25.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvZGE0NTExYzUtMWNmNS00Yzk0LWE0ZmQtNGJjMmVlMTRhMTgwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230409ej49000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
