\par\par \b \uc2 PostFinance Bank To Offer Customers Bitcoin And Ethereum Services\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 664 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 April 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 PostFinance Bank, a financial services firm owned by the Swiss Government, has stated that it would offer its customers various regulated crypto services.\par \par \uc2 These services will be delivered thanks to a partnership with Sygnum Bank.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin And Ethereum Services For Clients\par \par \uc2 According to the announcement by PostFinance Bank, the partnership with digital assets bank Sygnum will allow customers to access, purchase, and store cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin (BTC) and Ethereum (ETH). PostFinance Bank is Switzerland\u8217\'20\'19s fifth-largest financial services company, with an estimated 2.5 million users. Speaking about the partnership, Sygnum Bank\u8217\'20\'19s chief B2B officer Josh Fritz stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis partnership illustrates how digital assets are now an integral part of the financial landscape in Switzerland. In this sense, the PostFinance and Sygnum partnership represents an important and fully regulated step towards increased asset class adoption. Switzerland as an investment ecosystem offers a number of strategic advantages, including regulatory clarity for cryptocurrencies and off-balance sheet segregation of crypto assets, which eliminates credit risks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 PostFinance\u8217\'20\'19s Chief Investment Officer Philip Merkt, releasing a statement about the partnership, stated,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDigital assets have become an integral part of the financial world, and our customers want access to this market at PostFinance, their trusted principal bank. A reputable and established partner like Sygnum Bank with an excellent service offering is more important than ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sygnum Bank also separately announced the news of the partnership on its \uc2 Twitter\uc2  handle.\par \par \uc2 Institutional Grade Staking\par \par \uc2 The partnership between PostFinance and Sygnum also allows the former to provide other revenue-generating services, such as crypto staking. Staking refers to a process in which a user\u8217\'20\'19s assets are locked for a specified duration to secure a blockchain and receive rewards in return. Currently, Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s staking services include Ethereum, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Tezos (XTZ), and Internet Computer (\uc2 ICP\uc2 ). Fritz added,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur continually expanding B2B offering, which currently includes 25 leading cryptocurrencies, including DeFi-focused, 60+ trading pairs, and four leading fiat currencies, is available for deployment by PostFinance on a flexible basis. Additional details about the token and staking offering roadmap will be communicated by PostFinance in the lead-up to launch,\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sygnum also launched custody and trading services for USDC and a number of decentralized finance (DeFi) projects and tokens. These include Aragon (ANT), Aave (AAVE), Maker (MKR), Synthetic (SNX), Curve (CRV), 1inch (1INCH), and Uniswap (UNI).\par \par \uc2 Customers Demand Access To Crypto\par \par \uc2 With cryptocurrencies and non-fungible tokens (NFTs) growing in popularity, customers of various banks have been demanding more exposure to these emerging asset classes. Customers at PostFinance have been no different. According to a spokesperson for PostFinance, the institution\u8217\'20\'19s customers have long been demanding access to the crypto ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur analyses show that our customers want access to the crypto market. The past few months have shown that customers want more security, \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and trust. We can offer this. Our top priority is to offer trading and safekeeping within a secure framework for our customers and to ensure the highest level of regulatory compliance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Crypto Adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  On The Rise Again\par \par \uc2 The pivot towards crypto once again is not just occurring in Switzerland. In fact, countries across Europe are embracing the asset class, with several major developments taking place. Liechtenstein\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 VP Bank\uc2  announced that it is partnering with Metaco as recently as Tuesday. The partnership will allow it to provide tokenization and \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  custody services to customers. \uc2 DekaBank\uc2  and \uc2 DZ Bank\uc2 , two of Germany\u8217\'20\'19s largest banks, have also partnered with Metaco to provide crypto custody services to institutional clients.\par \par \uc2 The Neobank N26 has also expanded its services to provide crypto trading services in countries such as Switzerland, Ireland, Germany, Portugal, and Belgium. Meanwhile, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has jumped by over 70% since the beginning of the year.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230406ej460002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,741 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins continue to trade in a tight range, but a strong directional breakout could be in the making.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) remains pinned below the psychologically crucial level of $30,000 as cryptocurrency investors search for positive triggers. That has not stopped business intelligence firm \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-adds-another-1-045-bitcoin-to-its-growing-crypto-treasury"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adding 1,045 Bitcoin to its kitty}}}\uc2 , which has now swelled to 140,000 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Even after the sharp recovery from November 2022 low, monitoring resource Material Indicators believes the current up-move is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-push-choreographed-btc-price-as-ether-nears-2k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market rally}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Usually, a bear market rally does not turn around until the last bear has thrown in the towel. This suggests that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery may have some more legs before it turns down to shake out the weaker hands.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/28f92aba-6b5c-489d-8651-71cc58473920.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A survey conducted by financial services firm \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\uc2  shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-extremely-interested-in-crypto-etfs-but-buying-has-cooled-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional investors remain interested in the cryptocurrency space}}}\uc2  despite the crypto winter. It found that 74% of institutional investors were \u8220\'20\'1Cextremely/very interested\u8221\'20\'1D in adding exposure to exchange-traded-funds with cryptocurrency related exposure.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin continue its northward march and rise above $30,000? Will that move boost the altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to drive Bitcoin above $29,000 on April 5 but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling by the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/45fd6c5d-b43d-4f88-9066-65622e444e07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($27,273), which is an important level to watch out for. If this support cracks, several short-term bulls may exit their positions. That could open the gates for a retest of the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern at $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls continue to defend this level with all their might. That may enhance the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance at $29,185. If that were to occur, the BTC/USDT pair may climb to $30,000 and later to $32,500,\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($1,778) on April 3 and broke above the overhead resistance at $1,857. This suggests the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/a55f8be8-c65d-490c-b9fa-bff0c7b0ca6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The path is clear for a potential rally to $2,000. This level is likely to act as a strong resistance but if bulls flip the $1,857 level into support during the next decline, it will suggest that buyers are in command. The ETH/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to halt the rally and pull the price below $1,857. If they manage to do that, the aggressive bulls may get trapped. The pair could first drop to the 20-day EMA and subsequently to $1,680\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fall below the $306 support was aggressively purchased by the bulls as seen from the long tail on the April 3 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/4bc34b05-4dad-49fd-bcca-54b4d019a7b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above the overhead resistance of $318. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The BNB/USDT pair could first rise to $330 and subsequently to the strong resistance at $338.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price fails to clear the obstacle at $318, it will suggest that the bears are using every minor rally to sell. That may pull the pair down to the 200-day SMA ($291) which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.49 on April 3 but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/db7a511b-0a93-4d86-b4e0-34974229114e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned up on April 4 and the bulls tried to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $0.56 but the long wick on the April 5 candlestick shows that sellers are offering a formidable challenge to the bulls near $0.53.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower, the bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.47). If this level gives way, the XRP/USDT pair may slide to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers thrust the price above the $0.56 to $0.58 overhead zone, the pair may surge to $0.65 and then to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.37) and the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/6cdd8d42-3271-40b6-a506-40fad643db0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI above 59 indicate that bulls are in command. A break and close above the neckline will complete the reversal pattern. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then start a new uptrend which has a pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to seize control, they will have to pull the price back below the moving averages. If they do that, several short-term bulls may close their positions, resulting in a long liquidation. The pair may then slump to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on April 3 and skyrocketed above the strong resistance at $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/fd92bb6c-72d9-4b93-a482-6f653cb4cd50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the April 3 and 4 candlestick shows that the bears are trying to defend the $0.10 level with vigor. A minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price stays above $0.09, the possibility of a rally to $0.11 increases. This is the last major barrier for the bulls because a break above it could open the doors for a potential rally to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $0.11, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The DOGE/USDT pair may then oscillate inside a large range between $0.11 and $0.07 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) tight consolidation near the 20-day EMA ($1.11) resolved to the upside on April 4 but the bulls are struggling to build upon this advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/47a3a7c9-230d-4e61-9db5-fe8e8dccfa69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to tug the price back below the 20-day EMA and trap the aggressive bulls. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair could decline to $1.05 and thereafter to the vital support at the 200-day SMA ($0.98).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip this level into support. There is a minor resistance at $1.17 but if bulls overcome this barrier, the MATIC/USDT pair could ascend to $1.25 and thereafter to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/latest-bitcoin-price-data-suggests-double-top-above-200k-in-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Latest Bitcoin price data suggests double top above $200K in 2025}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside a tight range. Usually, periods of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  are followed by an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/fe9eef11-3a17-45a4-a3a3-4236021b2959.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could start a new up-move, which could first rise to $27.12. If this level is scaled, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and soar toward $39.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the downtrend line or fails to sustain above it. In that case, the bears will try to sink the price below $18.70 and challenge the critical support near $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has continued to grind higher toward the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.85. This level could see strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/8c768d6c-e621-4e39-884a-00957fd3f6cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($6.22) remains an important level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from $6.85 but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par \uc2 That will increase the possibility of a break above $6.85. The DOT/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. Sellers will have to sink the price below $5.70 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) jumped off the 20-day EMA ($89) on April 1 and rose above the downtrend line. However, the bulls are facing strong resistance from the bears at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the April 3 and April 5 candlesticks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/480738d6-c130-4c83-aadc-5ce218d4f55b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. There is a minor resistance at $96 but if that is crossed, the LTC/USDT pair may climb to the stiff overhead resistance at $106.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to quickly yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to $85. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it will indicate that the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvYmVmZTE2NmUtODI3Ny00OGQ0LWIzMjEtNWE3ZDliNjc1Nzg3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230405ej45000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/3: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, \uc2 SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,686 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 April 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto markets are selling-off but traders appear to buying on each dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price initially dipped, but then recovered on April 3. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  happened after several OPEC+ members {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-double-top-coming-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced plans to cut oil production}}}\uc2 , totaling 1.65 million barrels per day until the end of the year. Some analysts expect this move to tighten supply, resulting in higher prices at the pump. That may, in turn, boost inflation, warranting a continued hawkish stance from central banks.\par \par \uc2 Initially, the United States dollar index (DXY) rose, but it could not sustain the intraday rally. This suggests that the market participants believe the event will not cause any major deviation in the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy. A weaker DXY is generally considered a positive for risky assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/04f70f42-c6de-4f17-ad9b-df467c296d68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies have remained strong in the face of adverse macroeconomic news and regulatory action against crypto firms in the past few days. When the price of an asset does not crack with negative news, it shows that traders are not panicking and selling their holdings.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin overcome the obstacle at $30,000 and start a bull run? Will altcoins also join the party? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) picked up momentum after breaking out of the wedge pattern. Buyers will try to push the price to $4,200 which is likely to act as a strong barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/c3957e21-7f8a-40b7-8a12-a64208bf3411.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $4,200 but rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average ($4,002), it will suggest that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That could increase the possibility of a break above the $4,200-to-$4,325 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the bears will try to protect the overhead resistance zone and pull the index back below the moving averages. If they do that, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. The index may then collapse to the crucial support at $3,764.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index broke below the 20-day EMA ($103) on March 17, indicating that the recovery is fizzling out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/09e74d23-d9c3-42a0-ad23-f27e1dc596a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to drive the price above the 20-day EMA on April 3, but the long wick of the candlestick shows that the bears did not relent. The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the horizontal support at $100.82.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the bulls will try to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the index could rise to the 200-day SMA ($106). The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears could not even pull Bitcoin to the 20-day EMA ($27,105) on April 3, suggesting that the bulls are buying the intraday dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/3f12b816-8d7c-4e21-9ed6-05d6dcf2c7d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that the bulls are in control. Buyers will try to clear the overhead hurdle at $29,185. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair could jump to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 This level could witness a strong defense by the bears, but the possibility of a break above it remains high. The pair may then gradually rally to $32,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to stall the up-move, they will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, several short-term traders may rush to the exit. That could drag the price to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again turned up from the 20-day EMA ($1,753) on April 3, indicating that the sentiment is positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/1e80aebe-ae28-4d54-8bda-4306e433b4bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The vital level to watch on the upside is $1,857. If buyers overcome this obstacle, the ETH/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum. The $2,000 level may act as a strong resistance but it is likely to be crossed. The pair may then attempt a rally to $2,200. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first important support on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If this level cracks, the pair may fall to $1,680. A break and close below this support may tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line, but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/2d119b9d-7000-4cd9-a3ad-e847d9fc11aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($315) is flattish and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This balance will tilt in favor of the bears if the price breaks below $306. The BNB/USDT pair could then dive to the 200-day SMA ($290).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above $318, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair may then jump to the overhead resistance zone between $338 and $346.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to arrest XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) correction near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.49 while the bears are attempting to sink the price below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/66c13900-3a8f-47c1-88bf-ef0d23277a54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 X