telegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade near the 20-day EMA ($20.83), indicating that both the bulls and the bears are not waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-04/77a7a715-1127-4e02-9f0b-b8af8aaecbfc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, periods of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  are followed by an uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to make a decisive move before establishing trading positions.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the downtrend line, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could quickly rise to $27 and then surge to $39. Instead, if the price turns down and plummets below $18.70, the pair may slip to $15.28 and then to $12.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDQvZjE4ZmU1N2ItNDVkMS00MTkwLTkyYjQtODNjM2IzZDk4N2E2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230403ej43000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,660 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins bounced off their immediate support levels, indicating that every minor dip is being bought.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is up about 71% in Q1 2023, which is the first positive quarter after four consecutive quarters of negative returns in 2023, according to data from Coinglass. This shows that the sentiment has turned positive and the bulls are trying to put a bottom in Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 When the undercurrent is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , negative news results in shallow corrections. That is what happened after the \uc2 United States Commodity Futures Trading Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-and-cz-sued-by-cftc-over-us-regulatory-violations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slapped a lawsuit}}}\uc2  against \uc2 Binance\uc2  and its CEO \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2  for trading violations. This news pulled the markets marginally lower but did not start a strong down move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/e658b5cc-9b4a-477c-b2a8-eaa3443628b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another thing that happens in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  environment is that cryptocurrencies move up without any specific catalyst. That happened on March 29 when Bitcoin and several major altcoins turned up sharply.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins start the next leg of the uptrend and where is the rally likely to face resistance? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 In an uptrend, traders typically buy the pullbacks to the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,371). The long tails on the March 27 and 28 candlestick show just that.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/942fe72e-9b77-49c1-bb57-aaa89cb20ae3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 63 indicate that bulls are in control. The buyers will try to cement their dominance further by thrusting the price above $28,868.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to soar to $30,000 and then continue the rally to the critical resistance at $32,500. The bears will try to halt the up-move in this zone because a rally above $32,500 could clear the path for a sharp rally to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. They will have to first pull the price below the 20-day EMA and then retest the breakout level of $25,250. If this level also fails to hold up, the pair may plummet to the 200-day simple moving average ($20,281).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $1,680 support on March 28, signaling that lower levels are attracting buyers. This keeps the price stuck between $1,680 and $1,857.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3c120107-9cd4-4d93-ad56-f542bfd1d444.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1,720) and the RSI near 58 suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. If buyers nudge the price above $1,857, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $2,000 and thereafter make a dash to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if sellers want to prevent this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move, they will have to quickly yank the price below the $1,680 support. If that happens, the pair could skid to $1,600 and subsequently nosedive to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) sank below the 20-day EMA ($316) on March 26 but the bears could not maintain the selling pressure. The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA on March 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/e5628f7e-7a84-4d1b-a617-8026955471c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will next try to overcome the obstacle at the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair may climb to the overhead resistance zone between $338 and $346. The bears are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if it gives way, the pair could soar toward $400.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price reverses direction from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies. The pair may then collapse to the 200-day SMA ($290).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum on March 27 and broke above the immediate resistance zone of $0.49 to $0.51 on March 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f49bfce8-ce5c-45bf-8157-2c9403063731.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying spree on March 29 and sent the XRP/USDT pair flying above the crucial resistance at $0.56. If bulls sustain the price above $0.56, it will indicate the start of a new uptrend. The pair may rally to $0.65 and then to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the March 29 candlestick shows that bears are selling the rally above $0.56. If the price turns down and plunges below $0.49, it will indicate that the current breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair could then fall to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.35) on March 27 but it proved to be a bear trap. The price turned up and soared above the moving averages on March 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3bf363e5-e9ee-4e93-a9da-24dbb5ed844f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have overcome the immediate resistance at $0.39, clearing the path for a potential rally to the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. If bulls sustain the momentum and thrust the price above the neckline, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That may start a new up-move which has a pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below $0.33 will be a warning sign that bears are back in the game. That may sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the vital support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the 200-day SMA ($0.08) and $0.07. This consolidation could act as a launchpad for the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5375bb5f-a9f5-4a8f-adf2-18adedb4b383.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 200-day SMA will be the first sign that the bulls have absorbed the selling. That could attract further buying and catapult the price to the overhead resistance zone between $0.10 and $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 200-day SMA and plunges below the support at $0.07. If that happens, it will suggest that bears have overpowered the bulls. The DOGE/USDT pair could then drop to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $1.05 on March 28, indicating that the bulls are fiercely protecting this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7619c535-2999-4f43-8cc8-18e7288a533a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls extended the recovery on March 29 by shoving the price above the 20-day EMA ($1.12). If buyers sustain the breakout, it will clear the path for a possible rally to the overhead resistance zone between $1.25 and $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the $1.05 support, it will suggest that the bears are selling on relief rallies. The MATIC/USDT pair may then slide to the 200-day SMA ($0.97). This is an important support to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the next stop could be $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/definitely-not-bullish-7-bitcoin-price-gains-fail-to-convince-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 'Definitely not \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 ' \u8212\'20\'14 7% Bitcoin price gains fail to convince traders}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the downtrend line and the horizontal support of $18.70 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/dce77f50-0288-4f86-aa41-688a921ff06b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been buying the dips to $18.70 but they have failed to propel the price above the downtrend line. This indicates that bears are active at higher levels. This state of uncertainty is unlikely to remain for long.\par \par \uc2 If buyers force the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest a potential trend change. The SOL/USDT pair could first rise to $27.12 and later attempt a rally to $39. Contrarily, a break below $18.70 could stretch the fall to $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 200-day SMA ($5.95) on March 27 but the bears could not build upon the advantage and sink the price below $5.70.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/69befc12-9e94-4005-a95b-791eb61239a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased at lower levels and pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA on March 28. Buyers boosted their strength further by kicking the price above the 20-day EMA ($6.11). The DOT/USDT pair could next climb to $6.70. This is an important short-term resistance for the bulls to overcome.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed in doing that, the pair may attempt a rally to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. This positive view will be negated if the price plummets below the $5.70 to $5.15 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($87) on March 28 but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/11c08ab6-8e39-4481-aac3-c53972411be5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their purchases on March 29 and are trying to push the price above the immediate resistance of $96. If they manage to do that, the LTC/USDT pair could surge to the strong overhead resistance at $106. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI near 55 indicate a minor advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to pull the price below the uptrend line. If that happens, the pair could slump to the strong support at $75.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvYjhjNGQxMDYtMTUzNS00MDFhLTkxZDQtY2YzMGRiMzcyNDUxLkpQRw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230329ej3t000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Price\par \b \uc2 Adoption and nerves \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto pumps amid banking crisis\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,390 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A recent study has shown that the U.S. banking system is highly vulnerable, with many banks potentially becoming technically insolvent during a bank run.\par \par \uc2 On March 19, the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20230319a.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  that it had entered a joint program with several major central banks \u8212\'20\'14 including the \uc2 European Central Bank\uc2 , the \uc2 Bank of Canada\uc2 , the \uc2 Bank of England\uc2 , the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  and the \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 to support U.S. dollar cash flow and alleviate strains in global funding markets.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  said swap lines \u8212\'20\'14 agreements between two or more central banks to maintain a crucial liquidity backstop and ease strains in global funding markets \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-central-banks-enhance-swap-lines-to-combat-banking-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will remain active}}}\uc2  until at least the end of April.\par \par \uc2 This could result in the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  slowing its rate hikes, which have been cited as a contributing factor to the ongoing banking crisis.\par \par \uc2 Since the beginning of March 2023, several major financial entities, including \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2 , \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank\uc2  (SVB), Signature Bank and \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 , have collapsed.\par \par \uc2 Despite these developments, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has rallied, reaching a high of $28,500 on March 24, its highest level since the crypto crash of June 2022. After a slump in March, where the flagship cryptocurrency dropped below $20,000, Bitcoin seems to have resumed its 2023 rally.\par \par \uc2 Since January, when Bitcoin traded at around $16,500, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gained an impressive 72.73%. Of the roughly 4,600 days of Bitcoin as a tradable asset, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/holding-bitcoin-a-profitable-affair-88-5-of-the-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors have experienced}}}\uc2  4,065 profitable days, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/banking-crisis-what-does-it-mean-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenging the instability-driven narrative}}}\uc2  surrounding the crypto ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 The banking crisis explained\par \par \uc2 In recent weeks, the global banking industry has been rocked by a slew of events, sending shockwaves through financial markets. In Europe, \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  collapsed and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ubs-group-doubles-offer-and-acquires-credit-suisse-for-2b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had to be \u8220\'20\'1Crescued\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  by rival bank \uc2 UBS\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This development did not surprise those following \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s monetary and legal troubles, which have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-impact-of-the-credit-suisse-bank-crisis-on-the-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 been widely reported}}}\uc2  for months.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  and the \uc2 Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority\uc2  agreed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/swiss-national-bank-says-it-would-support-credit-suisse-if-necessary"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 back up Credit Suisse}}}\uc2  with an emergency loan of 50 billion francs ($54.5 billion) if necessary. \uc2 UBS\uc2  agreed to purchase \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  for $3.25 billion, which is less than half its market value just days before, but much higher than the initial offer of $1 billion, which \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  declined.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the United States faces its own banking crisis across the Atlantic. Several banks, including \uc2 SVB\uc2 , Signature Bank and \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2 , have collapsed recently, prompting the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  and the government to shore up depositors. The banks mentioned above all faced large-scale bank runs. These events typically occur when a bank loses the confidence of its customers, resulting in mass withdrawal requests.\par \par \uc2 Recent: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/justin-sun-vs-sec-do-kwon-arrested-180m-player-game-taps-polygon-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Justin Sun vs. SEC, Do Kwon arrested, 180M player game taps Polygon: Asia Express}}}\par \par \uc2 In response to these developments, the Fed has used the Bank Term Funding Program (BTFP) to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-fed-announces-25b-in-funding-to-backstop-banks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inject additional liquidity into the banking system}}}\uc2  and cover deposits, with politicians reassuring the public that the banking system is secure. While these actions have attempted to restore confidence in the banking system and financial markets, some analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/feds-new-banking-backstop-could-slow-balance-sheet-drawdown-2023-03-15/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warn}}}\uc2  they may only provide a short-term solution.\par \par \uc2 A recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=4387676"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 study}}}\uc2  has shown that the U.S. banking system is highly vulnerable, with many banks potentially becoming technically insolvent during a bank run. Assuming the worst-case scenario of 100% uninsured deposits withdrawn, the study\u8217\'20\'19s authors note that over 1,600 U.S. banks could collapse overnight. What\u8217\'20\'19s even more head-scratching is the researchers suggest that even if just 30% of uninsured deposits were to be withdrawn, 106 banks would collapse.\par \par \uc2 The numbers seem to be in favor of crypto\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been on a roll, gaining more than 13% over the past week and trading at $28,430 at the time of writing. The troubles facing the traditional banking system have raised concerns about trust in traditional assets, with more money seeming to flow into Bitcoin. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/BitcoinOpenInterest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to data from Coinglass, open interest in Bitcoin futures reached $12 billion over the weekend, a yearly high pointing to renewed interest in the flagship cryptocurrency.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/29958782-c724-4d0d-9fb3-1129e1014ed5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin futures open interest. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/BitcoinOpenInterest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinglass}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin open interest refers to the total number of outstanding positions in Bitcoin futures contracts that have not been closed or settled. It is a measure of market activity and interest in Bitcoin futures trading. When open interest is high, it suggests a lot of investor interest in BTC and vice versa.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, most altcoins are also experiencing a pump, with most of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap \u8212\'20\'14 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://v"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 posting gains of 5\u8211\'20\'1320% in the past week.\par \par \uc2 The renewed interest in crypto comes amid growing concerns over inflation, increasing global debt levels, and the unprecedented monetary and fiscal policies adopted by central banks and governments worldwide.\par \par \uc2 What lies ahead for crypto?\par \par \uc2 With the ongoing fiscal momentum surrounding the crypto sector showing no signs of abating, $30,000 has continued to serve as a significant hurdle for Bitcoin. However, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  approached or breached this level, many bulls could rake in short-term profits for themselves, potentially causing the cryptocurrency to dip again.\par \par \uc2 In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.barrons.com/articles/bitcoin-ethereum-price-crypto-market-today-ubs-credit-suisse-2d9cbe8e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  with Barron\u8217\'20\'19s, Alex Thorn, head of research at \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  group Galaxy, said we could be witnessing a seminal moment for Bitcoin. He believes that as the fractionally reserved banking system teeters on the brink, \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s resilience, predictability, and relative safety stands in stark relief.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the Crypto Fear & Greed Index hit its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highest}}}\uc2  index score this year, recording 66 on March 20. These levels have not been seen since Bitcoin posted its all-time high in November 2021. As of March 24, the index is sitting on a rating of 61, placing it firmly in the \u8220\'20\'1CGreed\u8221\'20\'1D territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/4168a8ba-421a-4abc-9825-c7760736ed47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alternative.me}}}\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear and Greed Index aims to numerically present the current \u8220\'20\'1Cemotions and sentiments\u8221\'20\'1D toward Bitcoin and the cryptocurrency market, with the highest score being 100. The last time the index recorded a score above 66 was on Nov. 16, 2021, just days after Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s all-time high of $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Chris Bradbury, CEO of decentralized finance platform Oasis.app and former lead product manager for MakerDAO, told Cointelegraph the latest rally is related to banking collapses and the broader fear in the U.S. and European banking sector, which saw vast amounts of value wiped out of bank stocks. He added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s unlikely we will see a sustained rally directly from this; however, we have started to see activity on-chain picking back up since the start of the year and a little bit more optimism more generally in the markets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Other observers of the crypto space think the recent pump is explained by factors that are less generous to the hypothesis of crypto as a safe haven and alternative to the traditional financial system.\par \par \uc2 Crypto researcher and software engineer \uc2 Molly White\uc2  recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://newsletter.mollywhite.net/p/no-bitcoin-isnt-pumping-because-its"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  that, among other things, Bitcoin is experiencing low liquidity and could also serve as an exit for traders nervous about stablecoins. As USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  )-to-dollar off-ramps were limited early in the banking crisis, many decided to move to different crypto assets like Bitcoin, White argued.\par \par \uc2 Recent: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/to-be-or-not-to-be-ethics-democracy-and-morality-in-the-nascent-metaverse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 To be or not to be: Ethics, democracy and morality in the nascent metaverse}}}\par \par \uc2 She further stated that influential people stand to benefit from an increased Bitcoin price. Ex-\uc2 Coinbase\uc2  chief technology officer \uc2 Balaji Srinivasan{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-coinbase-cto-makes-2m-bet-on-bitcoin-s-performance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made a $2 million bet that Bitcoin will hit $1 million}}}\uc2  in the next 90 days based on a belief that incoming liquidity from the Fed will \u8220\'20\'1Chyperinflate the dollar.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As White posited, \u8220\'20\'1CIf he owns a lot of Bitcoin already, or has OTM [out of the money] long positions, $3 million (counting the two bets plus the $1 million in tweet payments) would be a small price to pay if he can get BTC to tick up a few percentage points.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As we head into a future plagued by growing financial uncertainty, it will be interesting to observe how the crypto market wades through the macroeconomic uncertainty permeating the global economy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZjllM2JhMWQtZjdiOS00NjdjLWJjMTMtMjJlOTgyODAxNmY1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230328ej3s0008m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,780 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders cut risk as Bitcoin and altcoins corrected after media headlines highlighted the CFTC suing \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The news and events related to the banking crisis in the United States and Europe have led to a migration of funds into investments considered less risky. According to the \uc2 Financial Times\uc2 , the U.S. money market funds in March witnessed an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/banking-crisis-pushed-over-286b-to-money-market-funds-in-two-weeks-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflow of $286 billion}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Along with money market funds, a portion of the money may also have seeped into the crypto industry. The increased demand could be one of the reasons for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) strong performance in March.\par \par \uc2 The big question in crypto investors\u8217\'20\'19 minds is whether the recovery will continue or if it is time to book profits in Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3089f432-ace1-4e46-b5a6-d3a39ae25f56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hodlers seem to be confident in the long-term story and are not getting lured into selling their holdings after the recent rally. According to Glassnode data, the percent of Bitcoin supply that has remained dormant since March 2021 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-btc-ditch-the-bear-market-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hit a new all-time high}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If the banking crisis is contained, it may lead to a short-term correction in Bitcoin and altcoins, but any further problems in the legacy banking system may continue to attract investments into Bitcoin. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out the critical support and resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) is trading inside a descending broadening wedge pattern. The bulls tried to push the price above the wedge on March 22 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7a8bd840-2664-4e4e-8135-91c2d4107140.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (3,964) on March 27, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are in no mood to relent. Sellers will try to sink the price below the 200-day simple moving average (3,931). If they succeed, the index could drop to 3,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls defend the moving averages, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up after buyers thrust the price above the resistance line of the wedge. The index could then skyrocket to 4,200.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the U.S. dollar index (DXY) above the 20-day exponential moving average (103) on March 15 but could not build upon the breakout. This shows that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7b7c03db-4cf9-4680-bd45-1b8fd7553325.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index could drop to the strong support at 100.82, where the bulls will try to arrest the decline. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the index may oscillate between the 200-day SMA (106) and 100.82 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 100.82 level will be a huge negative as that will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. The index could then plummet to 95. On the upside, a break above the 200-day SMA could push the price to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of 108.43.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has failed to rise above $29,000 in the past few days, but the bulls continue to hold strong. They have not allowed the price to even dip to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0c4ea9a5-0f23-4e25-90b2-e5b117f754d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($26,062) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $29,000, the BTC/USDT pair may quickly climb to $32,500. This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears, but if buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could soar to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price breaks below $25,250. The emboldened bears will then try to sink the pair to the 200-day SMA ($20,219).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($1,705) on March 25 but the bulls could not challenge the overhead resistance at $1,857. This shows that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0d46c527-9ab1-4d32-a217-14f1e2360503.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and the horizontal support at $1,680. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair may fall to $1,600. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if this support cracks, the pair may tumble to the 200-day SMA ($1,435).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy on minor dips. The pair could then rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $1,857. If this hurdle is crossed, the pair may jump to $2,000 and thereafter to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($317) on March 25, but the bulls could not clear the downtrend line, indicating that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5de74655-58cf-43a0-82ba-68c054eb138b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to sustain the lower levels, the BNB/USDT pair could plummet to the 200-day SMA ($290). This is an important level to watch out for because if it yields, the pair may nosedive to $265.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. That will indicate aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the $338-to-$346 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls flipped the moving averages into support and tried to resume the recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ). However, the higher levels are attracting aggressive selling, as seen from the long wick on the March 27 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/cad2b314-61fc-4694-af1e-f3331a4d057e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again try to pull the XRP/USDT pair to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.41), it will suggest that buyers are accumulating at lower levels. The bulls may then make one more attempt to clear the overhead zone. If that happens, the pair may rally to $0.65 and eventually to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are back in control. The pair could then plunge to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 200-day SMA ($0.36) and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.35) on March 25. The bulls tried a recovery on March 26, but the bounce lacked strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/df4867f3-471c-42d8-a193-98be98db5706.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will indicate that the recent rally above the 200-day SMA may have been a bull trap. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may first slide to $0.32 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above the 200-day SMA, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) shallow bounce off the strong support at $1.05 on March 25 suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. The bears are trying to strengthen their position by yanking the price below $1.05.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f357989b-fcca-4441-9bec-db41fecdf8aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the breakdown, the MATIC/USDT pair may slump to the 200-day SMA ($0.97). This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it gives way, the sentiment will turn negative and the pair could tumble to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($1.13). That will increase the likelihood of a rally to the strong overhead resistance zone between $1.25 and $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between the 200-day SMA ($0.08) and the horizontal support of $0.07 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/54ea8a7c-27ca-4324-84de-e639e3cdead1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This suggests that the DOGE/USDT pair may spend some more time inside the range. The longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 If the price collapses below $0.07, the pair could extend its decline to $0.06 and then to the vital support near $0.05. Instead, if the price breaks above the 200-day SMA, the pair may soar to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($20.93) on March 24. Buyers tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on March 25 and 26, but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b504280e-016f-41cc-9475-e648f105d7ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $20, the SOL/USDT pair could retest the immediate support at $18.70. This level may attract buying, but if bulls fail to propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the prospects of a fall to $15.28 increase.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the downtrend may have ended. The pair could first rise to $27 and later attempt a rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMmMwNGI5MjMtYWIwNy00NzMxLTljYjMtZDgyMTQ2YTYyYWMwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230328ej3r0000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,780 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders cut risk as Bitcoin and altcoins corrected after media headlines highlighted the CFTC suing \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The news and events related to the banking crisis in the United States and Europe have led to a rotation of funds into investments considered less risky. According to the \uc2 Financial Times\uc2 , the U.S. money market funds in March witnessed an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/banking-crisis-pushed-over-286b-to-money-market-funds-in-two-weeks-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflow of $286 billion}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Along with money market funds, a portion of the money may also have seeped into the crypto industry. The increased demand could be one of the reasons for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) strong performance in March.\par \par \uc2 The big question in crypto investors\u8217\'20\'19 minds is whether the recovery will continue or if it is time to book profits in Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3089f432-ace1-4e46-b5a6-d3a39ae25f56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hodlers seem to be confident in the long-term story and are not getting lured into selling their holdings after the recent rally. According to Glassnode data, the percent of Bitcoin supply that has remained dormant since March 2021 has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-btc-ditch-the-bear-market-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hit a new all-time high}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If the banking crisis is contained, it may lead to a short-term correction in Bitcoin and altcoins but any further problems in the legacy banking system may continue to attract investments into Bitcoin. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out the critical support and resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) is trading inside a descending broadening wedge pattern. The bulls tried to push the price above the wedge on March 22 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7a8bd840-2664-4e4e-8135-91c2d4107140.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (3,964) on March 27 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are in no mood to relent. Sellers will try to sink the price below the 200-day simple moving average (3,931). If they succeed, the index could drop to 3,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls defend the moving averages, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up after buyers thrust the price above the resistance line of the wedge. The index could then skyrocket to 4,200.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the U.S. dollar index (DXY) above the 20-day exponential moving average (103) on March 15 but could not build upon the breakout. This shows that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7b7c03db-4cf9-4680-bd45-1b8fd7553325.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index could drop to the strong support at 100.82 where the bulls will try to arrest the decline. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the index may oscillate between the 200-day SMA (106) and 100.82 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 100.82 level will be a huge negative as that will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. The index could then plummet to 95. On the upside, a break above the 200-day SMA could push the price to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of 108.43.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has failed to rise above $29,000 in the past few days but the bulls continue to hold strong. They have not allowed the price to even dip to the breakout level of $25,250.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0c4ea9a5-0f23-4e25-90b2-e5b117f754d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($26,062) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $29,000, the BTC/USDT pair may quickly climb to $32,500. This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears but if buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could soar to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price breaks below $25,250. The emboldened bears will then try to sink the pair to the 200-day SMA ($20,219).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($1,705) on March 25 but the bulls could not challenge the overhead resistance at $1,857. This shows that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0d46c527-9ab1-4d32-a217-14f1e2360503.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and the horizontal support at $1,680. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair may fall to $1,600. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if this support cracks, the pair may tumble to the 200-day SMA ($1,435).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy on minor dips. The pair could then rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $1,857. If this hurdle is crossed, the pair may jump to $2,000 and thereafter to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($317) on March 25 but the bulls could not clear the downtrend line, indicating that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5de74655-58cf-43a0-82ba-68c054eb138b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to sustain the lower levels, the BNB/USDT pair could plummet to the 200-day SMA ($290). This is an important level to watch out for because if it yields, the pair may nosedive to $265.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. That will indicate aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the $338 to $346 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls flipped the moving averages into support and tried to resume the recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ). However, the higher levels are attracting aggressive selling as seen from the long wick on the March 27 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/cad2b314-61fc-4694-af1e-f3331a4d057e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again try to pull the XRP/USDT pair to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.41), it will suggest that buyers are accumulating at lower levels. The bulls may then make one more attempt to clear the overhead zone. If that happens, the pair may rally to $0.65 and eventually to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are back in control. The pair could then plunge to $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 200-day SMA ($0.36) and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.35) on March 25. The bulls tried a recovery on March 26 but the bounce lacked strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/df4867f3-471c-42d8-a193-98be98db5706.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will indicate that the recent rally above the 200-day SMA may have been a bull trap. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may first slide to $0.32 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above the 200-day SMA, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the price to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) shallow bounce off the strong support at $1.05 on March 25 suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. The bears are trying to strengthen their position by yanking the price below $1.05.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f357989b-fcca-4441-9bec-db41fecdf8aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sustain the breakdown, the MATIC/USDT pair may slump to the 200-day SMA ($0.97). This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it gives way, the sentiment will turn negative and the pair could tumble to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($1.13). That will increase the likelihood of a rally to the strong overhead resistance zone between $1.25 and $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between the 200-day SMA ($0.08) and the horizontal support of $0.07 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/54ea8a7c-27ca-4324-84de-e639e3cdead1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This suggests that the DOGE/USDT pair may spend some more time inside the range. The longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 If the price collapses below $0.07, the pair could extend its decline to $0.06 and then to the vital support near $0.05. Instead, if the price breaks above the 200-day SMA, the pair may soar to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($20.93) on March 24. Buyers tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on March 25 and 26 but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b504280e-016f-41cc-9475-e648f105d7ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $20, the SOL/USDT pair could retest the immediate support at $18.70. This level may attract buying but if bulls fail to propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the prospects of a fall to $15.28 increase.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the downtrend may have ended. The pair could first rise to $27 and later attempt a rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMmMwNGI5MjMtYWIwNy00NzMxLTljYjMtZDgyMTQ2YTYyYWMwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230327ej3r000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,793 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and major altcoins may witness a pullback in the near term, which may bring key support levels into play.\par \par \uc2 European stock markets fell on March 24 on renewed fears that the banking crisis could rear its ugly head once again. The latest selling was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/24/deutsche-bank-shares-slide-8percent-after-a-sudden-spike-in-default-insurance-costs.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 triggered}}}\uc2  after \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s credit default swaps, which offer protection to the buyer against specific risks, soared on March 23 without any known catalyst. That pulled down the shares of the German lender by 11%.\par \par \uc2 European Central Bank\uc2  President \uc2 Christine Lagarde\uc2  attempted to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/24/deutsche-bank-europes-leaders-battle-banking-crisis-amid-market-rout.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calm}}}\uc2  the markets, saying that the euro area baking sector was strong due to the regulatory reforms introduced after the global financial crisis. That could be one of the reasons for the solid recovery in the United States equities markets from the intraday lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/efe94cf1-8e19-477d-9053-ad081822b83c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the banking crisis has been positive for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price, the trend may pause if the contagion spreads. During times of panic, traders sell assets to curtail risk. At that time, if Bitcoin does not break below the $25,000\u8211\'20\'13$20,000 support zone, it will suggest that the bear phase is over.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins witness a minor correction? What are the important support levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on March 23, indicating uncertainty among buyers and sellers. The bulls want to extend the up-move, but the bears are in no mood to relent. That has kept the price within a small range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d9c8e53a-359f-42da-ac6c-f73dbeb10892.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near a local high is a sign that traders are not booking profits in a hurry because they anticipate the uptrend to continue. The rising 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($25,595), and the relative strength index, or RSI, near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $26,500 with strength, the bulls will again try to start the next leg of the rally. That could propel the price to $30,000 and then to $32,500.\par \par \uc2 The $25,250 support remains the key level because a break and close below it may indicate a bull trap. The BTC/USDT pair could then collapse toward the 200-day simple moving average, or SMA ($20,095).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance of $1,842 on March 23, but the bulls could not sustain the breakout as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/cdb6c153-db2d-4808-b9e0-161db267758d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to strengthen their position by pulling the price toward the 20-day EMA ($1,693). This remains the key level to watch out for on the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that traders continue to view the dips to the 20-day EMA as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then again try to clear the overhead barrier and catapult the price to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price plunges below the 20-day EMA. That could tug the price to $1,600 and then to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($316) on March 23, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the relief rally. This shows that the bears are pouncing on every minor recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8775cfe8-f863-431c-bb16-7052d55a28f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to tug the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $300 and then to the 200-day SMA ($289). The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the zone between the 200-day SMA and $265.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The pair could pick up momentum above $346, and the next stop on the upside is $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) formed consecutive inside-day candlestick patterns on March 22 and 23, indicating indecision among buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3cffd47d-64ce-43d6-9dc6-0eda71895cc5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that they have successfully defended the 200-day SMA ($0.40) for the past three days. This suggests that the 200-day SMA could now act as the new floor.\par \par \uc2 Sometimes, after a sharp move, the price tends to consolidate for a few days before resuming a trending move. In this case, buyers will have to thrust the price above $0.51 to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. On the downside, a break below the moving averages may result in a retest of $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been sustaining Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages since March 21 but have failed to reach the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern. This suggests selling by the bears near $0.39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b925e268-c3af-411f-aae4-fa1396724134.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.34) is trying to turn up, and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a slight advantage to the bulls. If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to the neckline increases. A break above the H&S pattern indicates the start of a new potential up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are trying a comeback. A break and close below $0.30 may accelerate selling and yank the price to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 200-day SMA ($0.08), but the bears have not let their guard down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/32c3c5f1-1429-45b8-9d7b-0c0d53adbf3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will next try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.07. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain stuck between the $0.07 to the 200-day SMA for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 200-day SMA will be the first indication that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That may start an up-move toward the stiff overhead resistance zone of $0.10 to $0.11. Conversely, if the $0.07 support cracks, the pair may plummet to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($1.14) since March 20. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0026d8b9-c395-4832-b0c3-d65f18ed9258.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the bears have not been able to sink the price below the strong support zone of $1.05 and the 200-day SMA ($0.96). This suggests strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, the MATIC/USDT pair may rise toward the overhead resistance at $1.30. Such a move will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action between $1.05 and $1.30 for some more time. A break above or below this range could start the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-centers-on-28k-as-deutsche-bank-shares-follow-credit-suisse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price centers on $28K as Deutsche Bank shares follow Credit Suisse}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has narrowed down further and is now stuck between the moving averages. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/39a8b12a-7030-4edf-bc96-3e250d455c39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($21.17) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 To gain the upper hand, buyers will have to drive the price above the overhead resistance zone between the downtrend line and $27.12. If they do that, it will signal a potential trend change. The SOL/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to drag the pair to the crucial support zone between $18.70 and $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 200-day SMA ($5.98) for the past few days. The failure of the bulls to achieve a strong rebound off important support indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8364f474-7589-4bcc-a603-05d4a2d26f86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This increases the risk of a break below the 200-day SMA. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could slide to $5.15. This is an important support to keep an eye on because a break below it will open the doors for a probable retest of $4.22.\par \par \uc2 This short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the bulls push and sustain the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.85. If this level is taken out, the pair could reach the neckline of the developing H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is making a strong comeback. The momentum picked up after the bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($85) on March 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3ed62461-d3b9-4437-9681-543af716acdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has climbed into positive territory, and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will try to challenge the overhead resistance at $106 where the bears may mount a strong defense. If bulls clear this hurdle, the LTC/USDT pair may rally to $115 and subsequently to $125.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again turns down from $106, it will suggest that bears are not willing to relent. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support will hint at a possible range formation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvYTJkZmYzMzQtMzU3Zi00NDI3LWEzOWUtODdjN2EyM2Q2MDIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230325ej3o00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,784 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and major altcoins may witness a pullback in the near term, which may bring key support levels into play.\par \par \uc2 The European stock markets fell on March 24 on renewed fears that the banking crisis could rear its ugly head once again. The latest selling was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/24/deutsche-bank-shares-slide-8percent-after-a-sudden-spike-in-default-insurance-costs.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 triggered}}}\uc2  after \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s credit default swaps, which offer protection to the buyer against specific risks, soared on March 23 without any known catalyst. That pulled down the shares of the German lender by 11%.\par \par \uc2 European Central Bank\uc2  President \uc2 Christine Lagarde\uc2  attempted to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/24/deutsche-bank-europes-leaders-battle-banking-crisis-amid-market-rout.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calm}}}\uc2  the markets, saying that the euro area baking sector was strong due to the regulatory reforms introduced after the Global Financial Crisis. That could be one of the reasons for the solid recovery in the United States equities markets from the intraday lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/efe94cf1-8e19-477d-9053-ad081822b83c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the banking crisis has been positive for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price, the trend may pause if the contagion spreads. During times of panic, traders sell assets to curtail risk. At that time, if Bitcoin does not break below the $25,000 to $20,000 support zone, it will suggest that the bear phase is over.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins witness a minor correction? What are the important support levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on March 23, indicating uncertainty among buyers and sellers. The bulls want to extend the up-move but the bears are in no mood to relent. That has kept the price inside a small range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d9c8e53a-359f-42da-ac6c-f73dbeb10892.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near a local high is a sign that traders are not booking profits in a hurry because they anticipate the uptrend to continue. The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($25,595) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $26,500 with strength, the bulls will again try to start the next leg of the rally. That could propel the price to $30,000 and then to $32,500.\par \par \uc2 The $25,250 support remains the key level because a break and close below it may indicate a bull trap. The BTC/USDT pair could then collapse toward the 200-day simple moving average ($20,095).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance of $1,842 on March 23 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/cdb6c153-db2d-4808-b9e0-161db267758d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to strengthen their position by pulling the price toward the 20-day EMA ($1,693). This remains the key level to watch out for on the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that traders continue to view the dips to the 20-day EMA as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then again try to clear the overhead barrier and catapult the price to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price plunges below the 20-day EMA. That could tug the price to $1,600 and then to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($316) on March 23 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the relief rally. This shows that the bears are pouncing on every minor recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8775cfe8-f863-431c-bb16-7052d55a28f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to tug the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $300 and then to the 200-day SMA ($289). The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the zone between the 200-day SMA and $265.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The pair could pick up momentum above $346 and the next stop on the upside is $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) formed consecutive inside-day candlestick patterns on March 22 and 23, indicating indecision among buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3cffd47d-64ce-43d6-9dc6-0eda71895cc5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that they have successfully defended the 200-day SMA ($0.40) for the past three days. This suggests that the 200-day SMA could now act as the new floor.\par \par \uc2 Sometimes, after a sharp move, the price tends to consolidate for a few days before resuming a trending move. In this case, buyers will have to thrust the price above $0.51 to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. On the downside, a break below the moving averages may result in a retest of $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been sustaining Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages since March 21 but have failed to reach the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. This suggests selling by the bears near $0.39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b925e268-c3af-411f-aae4-fa1396724134.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.34) is trying to turn up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a slight advantage to the bulls. If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to the neckline increases. A break above the H&S pattern indicates the start of a new potential up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are trying a comeback. A break and close below $0.30 may accelerate selling and yank the price to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 200-day SMA ($0.08) but the bears have not let their guard down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/32c3c5f1-1429-45b8-9d7b-0c0d53adbf3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will next try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.07. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain stuck between the $0.07 to the 200-day SMA for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 200-day SMA will be the first indication that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That may start an up-move toward the stiff overhead resistance zone of $0.10 to $0.11. Conversely, if the $0.07 support cracks, the pair may plummet to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($1.14) since March 20. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0026d8b9-c395-4832-b0c3-d65f18ed9258.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the bears have not been able to sink the price below the strong support zone of $1.05 and the 200-day SMA ($0.96). This suggests strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, the MATIC/USDT pair may rise toward the overhead resistance at $1.30. Such a move will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action between $1.05 and $1.30 for some more time. A break above or below this range could start the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-centers-on-28k-as-deutsche-bank-shares-follow-credit-suisse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price centers on $28K as Deutsche Bank shares follow Credit Suisse}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has narrowed down further and is now stuck between the moving averages. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2