slt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is making a strong comeback. The momentum picked up after the bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($85) on March 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3ed62461-d3b9-4437-9681-543af716acdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has climbed into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will try to challenge the overhead resistance at $106 where the bears may mount a strong defense. If bulls clear this hurdle, the LTC/USDT pair may rally to $115 and subsequently to $125.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again turns down from $106, it will suggest that bears are not willing to relent. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA. A break below this support will hint at a possible range formation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvYTJkZmYzMzQtMzU3Zi00NDI3LWEzOWUtODdjN2EyM2Q2MDIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230324ej3o000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,794 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Technical analysis shows Bitcoin price charting a path toward $30,000, and even with the occurrence of a lower support retest at $25,000, traders are likely to view each dip as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the $25,000 level for the past few days, increasing the likelihood that the bear market may have ended. Generally, in the initial stages of a new bull phase, several {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-30k-bets-greet-fomc-as-analyst-warns-over-long-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts remain in a state of disbelief}}}\uc2  and expect the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Another group of traders continue to wait for the dip to buy at lower levels but the price does not oblige. Finally, the traders sitting on the fence {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fear-and-greed-index-hits-highest-level-since-bitcoin-s-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 throw in the towel and buy}}}\uc2  and that is when the correction is likely to happen. Such a pullback shakes out the weak hands and transfers the asset into the hands of investors with conviction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a4c2a24f-63ec-4654-8688-27d855fad8a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 When a new trend is getting established, certain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-new-9-month-highs-above-28k-as-markets-flipflop-over-fomc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 events tend to cause a knee-jerk reaction}}}\uc2  but it is unlikely that the trend is reversed. In Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s case too, a drop to trap the aggressive bears is possible but there is a low possibility that the bear market will resume.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to watch out for on the upside and the downside in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After a two-day consolidation, Bitcoin has risen above the $28,500 overhead resistance on March 22. This suggests that the bulls have asserted their dominance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/091e2ed6-5ed3-438f-a5d9-4cbf02875db1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($25,180) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. A break above $28,500 will clear the path for a possible rally to the $30,000 to $32,500 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 In case of a correction, the first support to watch on the downside is $25,250. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the neckline of the head and shoulders (H&S) pattern has flipped into support.\par \par \uc2 The problem will arise if the $25,250 level cracks because that may trigger the stops of several bulls. The BTC/USDT pair could then nosedive to the 200-day simple moving average ($20,020).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce off $1,717 suggests that the bulls are purchasing the minor dips and not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. However, buyers failed to overcome the obstacle at $1,842, indicating that bears are protecting this level with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/85abe5bb-fa0f-4a24-8186-9bae4f6073ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight consolidation near a local top suggests that the bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry as they anticipate another leg higher. The rising 20-day EMA ($1,679) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $1,842, the ETH/USDT pair may jump to $2,000 and later attempt a rally to $2,200. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then fall to $1,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above $346 in the past few days shows that the bears are fiercely guarding the level. That may have resulted in profit-booking by the short-term bulls, which has pulled the price toward the 20-day EMA ($314).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b4cf72f4-4a55-49a3-aefa-be1709796133.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at $346. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could soar toward $400.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction toward the 200-day SMA ($288). The pair may then oscillate between $280 and $346 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the 200-day SMA ($0.40) and the stiff overhead resistance of $0.43 on March 21, indicating a buying stampede.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/dc6a0801-2db7-4bb3-9d2a-7b3ac4214b25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rally, traders seem to be booking profits near $0.50. That has resulted in a pullback to the breakout level of $0.43. If bulls flip this level into support, the XRP/USDT pair may again try to rise above $0.50. If that happens, the pair could soar to $0.56. A break and close above this level will indicate the start of a potential new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below the $0.43 support, it will suggest that traders are rushing to the exit. That could trap the aggressive bulls and sink the pair to the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) surged above the moving averages on March 21, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/87566832-8785-40ce-a9dc-c72269e019f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not yet given up and are trying to halt the recovery at $0.39 as seen from the long wick on the March 21 and 22 candlesticks. The onus is on the bulls to flip the moving averages into support. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the neckline of the developing H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and slips below the moving averages, it will indicate that higher levels continue to attract sellers. The pair could then descend to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.07 and the 200-day SMA ($0.08) for the past few days. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/30daf45c-6b08-49e4-8aeb-ad9ec375046d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 200-day SMA. That could open the doors for a possible rise to $0.09 and later to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to sink the price below the support at $0.07. The DOGE/USDT pair may then slump to $0.06 and subsequently to the crucial support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging above and below the 20-day EMA ($1.15) for the past few days, indicating a lack of direction. The bulls are buying on dips while the bears are selling the rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/10ccd202-1787-4b5e-a151-55548fba6123.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($1.15) and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This suggests that the MATIC/USDT pair may consolidate between $1.05 and $1.30 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The longer the price consolidates in the range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it. If bulls force the price above $1.30, the pair may accelerate to $1.57 and thereafter to $1.75. Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 200-day SMA ($0.96), it will suggest that bears are back in command. The pair could then tumble to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on March 20 but the bears held their ground. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($21.18).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/4d0a76f4-3631-4195-9184-9c5b54e0d401.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is in positive territory, indicating a slight advantage to buyers. If bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line, it will signal a potential trend change. The SOL/USDT pair could first rise to $27.12 where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If buyers overcome this hurdle, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair may then slide to $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 200-day SMA ($6) on March 21, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/db6fc0fd-2326-4f45-a24a-92aeb110a2af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($6.18) and the RSI near the midpoint signal a balance between supply and demand. This balance will tilt in favor of the buyers if they propel the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.85. The DOT/USDT pair could then climb toward the neckline of the developing H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to protect the overhead resistance and sink the price below the 200-day SMA. If they do that, the pair may again slump to $5.15.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the downtrend line of the descending channel pattern and the psychological support at $0.000010.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b6f05404-4801-412c-b603-301108625ca2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long and a breakout looks imminent. The price has been clinging to the downtrend line, which suggests that the SHIB/USDT pair is likely to climb above the channel. There is a minor resistance at $0.000012 but if this level is crossed, the pair may rise toward $0.000016.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the $0.000010 support. That could pull the pair down to $0.000008.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMzNhZTllODUtNDViYi00NzczLWFiMDgtMDZhNTQ0NjBkNWIzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230322ej3m000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Yashu Gola \par \uc2 675 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano whales are behind \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price rally in the last seven days, helped by Fed pivot hopes.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rallied to its best price level in a month as cryptocurrency investors prepared for the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-the-fed-stop-rate-hikes-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 looming interest rate decision}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Fed boosts appetite for cryptocurrencies like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 On March 22, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price surged by as much as 4.58% to $0.388, its highest level since Feb. 24. This bucked the trend as the total crypto market capitalization underperformed the Cardano token, dropping 0.4% on the same day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ad1a777b-5d2c-4a8f-9146-167f9540ef4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD versus crypto market cap daily performance chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 All eyes are on the Fed meeting on March 22 as chairman Jerome Powell tries to balance his anti-inflation campaign with a flurry of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/more-186-us-banks-well-positioned-for-collapse-svb-analysis-reveals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sudden banking collapses}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s intervention to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-starts-stealth-qe-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 safeguard regional banks}}}\uc2  with emergency lending measures and hopes that it would be less hawkish in the future has helped top-ranking crypto assets rally in March, including Cardano.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price is up by a decent 4% month-to-date versus top coin Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) 20% gains in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Cardano network upgrade, whale activity\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s performance in the past seven days, including March 22, mirrors Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s, with both rising by over 16%.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s upside momentum coincides with Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s new network upgrade launch on March 17. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.essentialcardano.io/article/dynamic-p2p-is-available-on-mainnet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Called}}}\uc2  dynamic peer-to-peer (P2P) networking, the new node version reportedly enables bidirectional usage of block-producing nodes and relay nodes, which may defend against failures or malicious behavior.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/084bb3af-9fc6-4781-b57f-1815f95acae5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  s price has rallied 20% since Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s dynamic P2P update. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price gains in March appear to have been supported by Cardano whales, according to on-chain data provided by Santiment.\par \par \uc2 For instance, the percentage of Cardano tokens held by addresses holding 100 million\u8211\'20\'131 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has risen from 6.16% on March 1 to 7.56% on March 22.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply held by the 10 million\u8211\'20\'13100 million holder cohort has dropped from 41.32% to 39.67% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/04be0ca5-3452-4b08-b8d0-037ad4bfdbad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano supply distribution among addresses holding 1,000 to 100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the 10 million\u8211\'20\'13100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders stepped up their buying in March and, as a result, entered the 100 million\u8211\'20\'131 billion cohort. Similarly, addresses holding anywhere between 1,000 to 10 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens increased their supply in March.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s ahead for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price?\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price eyes a pullback as it moves near its multimonth descending trendline resistance, as shown in the daily chart below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/38dcabc9-c3ae-4031-b457-30816931dbd7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In that case, the short-term price target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD appears near its ascending trendline support (currently around $0.34), which has been capping its downside attempts since December 2022.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-impact-of-the-credit-suisse-bank-crisis-on-the-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The impact of the Credit Suisse bank crisis on the crypto market}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a decisive close above the descending trendline resistance could have \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  test its support-turned-resistance area (purple) \u8212\'20\'14 the $0.41\u8211\'20\'130.44 range. This move could also confirm its inverse-head-and-shoulders pattern, as illustrated below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7db40729-f7d2-4340-be72-2bea4110e331.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring inverse-head-and-shoulders pattern. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 An inverse-head-and-shoulders is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/this-classic-trading-pattern-signaled-that-bitcoin-price-had-hit-a-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  reversal pattern}}}\uc2 , resolved when the price breaks above its neckline support level. As a rule of technical analysis, its upside target is measured after adding the distance between its lowest point and neckline level to the breakout point.\par \par \uc2 As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price could rally by almost 100% to $0.741 by June if the pattern plays out.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230322ej3m0008m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Yashu Gola \par \uc2 681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano whales are behind \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price rally in the last seven days, helped by Fed pivot hopes.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rallied to its best price level in a month as cryptocurrency investors prepared for the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's looming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-the-fed-stop-rate-hikes-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interest rate}}}\uc2  decision.\par \par \uc2 Fed boosts appetite for cryptos like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 On March 22, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price surged by as much as 4.58% to $0.388, its highest level since Feb. 24. This bucked the trend as the total crypto market capitalization underperformed the Cardano token, dropping 0.4% on the same day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ad1a777b-5d2c-4a8f-9146-167f9540ef4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD versus crypto market cap daily performance chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 All eyes are on the Fed meeting on March 22 as chairman Jerome Powell tries to balance his anti-inflation campaign versus a flurry of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/more-186-us-banks-well-positioned-for-collapse-svb-analysis-reveals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sudden banking collapses}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The U.S. central bank's intervention to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-starts-stealth-qe-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 safeguard regional banks}}}\uc2  with emergency lending measures and hopes that it would be less hawkish in the future has helped top-ranking crypto assets, including Cardano, rally in March.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price is up by a decent 4% month-to-date (MTD) versus top coin Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) 20% gains in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Cardano network upgrade, whale activity\par \par \uc2 Cardano's performance in the past seven days, including March 22 mirrors Bitcoin's, with both rising by over 16%.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upside momentum coincides with the launch of Cardano's new network upgrade launch on March 17. Dubbed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.essentialcardano.io/article/dynamic-p2p-is-available-on-mainnet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dynamic peer-to-peer (P2P)}}}\uc2  networking, the new node version reportedly enables bidirectional usage of block-producing nodes and relay nodes, which may defend against failures or malicious behavior.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/084bb3af-9fc6-4781-b57f-1815f95acae5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  s price has rallied 20% since the Cardano's Dynamic P2P update. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price gains in March appear to have been supported by Cardano whales, according to on-chain data provided by Santiment.\par \par \uc2 For instance, the percentage of Cardano tokens held by addresses holding 100 million-1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has risen from 6.16% on March 1 to 7.56% on March 22.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply held by the 10 million-100 million holder cohort has dropped from 41.32% to 39.67% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/04be0ca5-3452-4b08-b8d0-037ad4bfdbad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano supply distribution among addresses holding 1K to 100M \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the 10 million-100 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders stepped up their buying in March and, as a result, entered the 100 million-1 billion cohort. Similarly, addresses holding anywhere between 1,000 to 10 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens increased their supply in March.\par \par \uc2 What's ahead for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price?\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price eyes a pullback as it moves near its multi-month descending trendline resistance, as shown in the daily chart below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/38dcabc9-c3ae-4031-b457-30816931dbd7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In that case, the short-term price target for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD appears near its ascending trendline support (currently around $0.34), which has been capping its downside attempts since December 2022.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-impact-of-the-credit-suisse-bank-crisis-on-the-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The impact of the Credit Suisse bank crisis on the crypto market}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a decisive close above the descending trendline resistance could have \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  test its support-turned-resistance area (purple) \u8212\'20\'14 the $0.41-0.44 range. This move could also confirm its inverse-head-and-shoulders (IH&S) pattern, as illustrated below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7db40729-f7d2-4340-be72-2bea4110e331.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart featuring IH&S pattern. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 An IH&S is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/this-classic-trading-pattern-signaled-that-bitcoin-price-had-hit-a-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  reversal pattern}}}\uc2 , resolved when the price breaks above its neckline support level. As a rule of technical analysis, its upside target is measured after adding the distance between its lowest point and neckline level to the breakout point.\par \par \uc2 As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price could rally by almost 100% to $0.741 by June if the IH&S pattern plays out.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230322ej3m0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,733 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins seem to be rising due to the massive amounts of liquidity injected into the economy by the Fed.\par \par \uc2 After a recovery on March 16, the United States equities markets are again down on March 17. Investors remain concerned about the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-25k-as-credit-suisse-bailout-precedes-eu-rate-hike-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vulnerability of banks}}}\uc2  in the U.S. and Europe. A silver lining for cryptocurrency investors is that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has remained decoupled from the equities markets and has risen to its highest level since Jan. 12.\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital founder and CEO Michael Novogratz said in an interview with CNBC that the U.S. and the globe will face a credit crunch as banks lend less to rebuild capital. He said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-credit-crunch-means-it-s-time-to-buy-gold-and-bitcoin-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors should be long on Bitcoin and crypto}}}\uc2  because these are the times for which it was created.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9d9a2890-cdd8-4fa9-93af-2bcedaaf55f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Quantitative tightening seems to be giving way to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 period of quantitative easing}}}\uc2 . The banks have already borrowed $150 billion from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 , which is more than the amount borrowed during the 2008 financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 Analysts pointed out that the Fed has added $300 billion to its balance sheet in a week, second only to the $500 billion pumped after the March 2020 crash. The QE in 2020 triggered a rally in Bitcoin that took it from about $4,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Will history repeat itself? Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls purchased the dip to $24,000 on March 15 and pushed the price above the strong overhead resistance of $25,250 on March 17. This completes an inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3f4fbf71-c5dd-423c-9118-415ec68a6417.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is no major resistance between the current level and $32,000, hence the bulls may find it easy to cover this distance in a short time. The bears may mount a strong defense at $32,000, but if bulls overcome it, the BTC/USDT pair could extend its uptrend to the pattern target of $35,024.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($23,298), and the relative strength index, or RSI, near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to regain control, they will have to quickly reverse direction and sink the pair below the moving averages. Until then, the bulls are likely to view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the moving averages on March 16, indicating that traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8ba05f94-0e6b-4aad-959b-9360d604092e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push and sustain the price above the $1,743\u8211\'20\'13$1,780 resistance zone. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could accelerate toward the psychologically important level of $2,000. This is the final hurdle above which the pair will signal the start of a potential uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to halt the up-move in the overhead zone and pull the pair back below the moving averages. That could trap the aggressive bulls, and the pair may then collapse to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) March 15 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($302). This signals a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/c84eb9de-3980-4a8d-b59d-2f945add9eda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally picked up momentum on March 17 and skyrocketed the price above the overhead resistance at $318.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to strengthen their position further by kicking the price above $338. If they do that, the negative H&S pattern will be invalidated. The BNB/USDT pair could first rally to $360 and later to $400.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the tight range between the 50-day simple moving average, or SMA ($0.38), and the support at $0.36.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2e8059c2-14cf-4283-9e97-2b9e639e706c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, tight-range trading is followed by an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The bulls will try to catapult the price above the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to $0.42. This level may again act as a formidable resistance, but if crossed, the rally could reach $0.51.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below $0.36. The pair could then slump to the strong support zone between $0.32 and $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the 50-day SMA ($0.36) and the strong support at $0.29. The bulls are trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.34).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/1dfba472-4e3c-43d6-ba09-429b9068e4e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to the 50-day SMA. This level may attract sellers who will try to stall the recovery. If the price turns down sharply from this level, the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it may signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.07 level and has reached the downtrend line. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9bd93c38-c335-4f5c-9e24-574d397c0590.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the correction may be over. The 50-day SMA ($0.08) may act as a resistance, but it is likely to be broken. The DOGE/USDT pair could then start its rally to $0.09 and thereafter to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are expected to defend the $0.10\u8211\'20\'13$0.11 zone with all their might because a break above it will open the doors for a possible rally to $0.16. On the downside, a slide below the $0.07 support will tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $1.07 on March 15, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the $1.05 level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b72a664e-88cd-44eb-a907-2e0eb5e43ebd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.16) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If bulls propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.22), the MATIC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $1.30. This level may act as a minor hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed. The next stop may be $1.42.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair may then oscillate between the 50-day SMA and $1.05 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-turmoil-deribit-launches-bitcoin-volatility-futures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Betting on turmoil: Deribit launches Bitcoin \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  futures}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $18.70 on March 16, which shows that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper decline to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a01f1cd9-4488-49ae-9ead-329454530dd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the moving averages, which are likely to offer strong resistance. If the price turns down and breaks below $18.70, it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair may remain range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($22.21) and $15.28 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The pair will indicate a potential trend change after the bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line. That could start a rally to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($6.09) on March 15, but the bears could not maintain the lower levels. Buyers purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on March 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/dffe8cc3-e397-4017-8779-fe2205c0f4bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to build upon their advantage by pushing the price above the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($6.41). If this level is scaled, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $6.85.\par \par \uc2 This level should again act as a strong resistance, but if bulls flip the moving averages into support during the next pullback, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of the pair forming an inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again turns down from the 50-day SMA and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.000010 support on March 16, indicating that the bulls are trying to start a reversal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/1e153c87-6905-40f6-89a2-4c0b3dbe4232.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery is facing resistance in the zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) and the downtrend line of the descending channel. The bears will again attempt to sink the price below the $0.000010 support. If they succeed, the SHIB/USDT pair may slip to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls thrust the price above the channel, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The 50-day SMA ($0.000012) may also offer stiff resistance, but if this level is cleared, the SHIB/USDT pair could climb to $0.000014 and then to $0.000016.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMWM5OTdjOTMtYjA3NS00YjZmLThmMTYtZjNkNTc4MmY1YTlhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230317ej3h000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,722 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins seem to be rising due to the massive amounts of liquidity injected into the economy by the Fed.\par \par \uc2 After a recovery on March 16, the United States equities markets are again down on March 17. Investors remain concerned about the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-25k-as-credit-suisse-bailout-precedes-eu-rate-hike-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vulnerability of the banks}}}\uc2  in the U.S. and Europe. A silver lining for cryptocurrency investors is that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has remained decoupled with the equities markets and has risen to its highest level since Jan. 12.\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital founder and CEO Michael Novogratz said in an interview with CNBC that the US and the globe will face a credit crunch as banks lend less to rebuild capital. He said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-credit-crunch-means-it-s-time-to-buy-gold-and-bitcoin-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors should be long on Bitcoin and crypto}}}\uc2  because these are the times for which it was created.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9d9a2890-cdd8-4fa9-93af-2bcedaaf55f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Quantitative tightening seems to be giving way to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 period of quantitative easing}}}\uc2 . The banks have already borrowed $150 billion from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 , which is more than the amount borrowed during the 2008 financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 Analysts pointed out that the Fed has added $300 billion to its balance sheet in a week, second only to the $500 billion pumped after the March 2020 crash. The QE in 2020 triggered a rally in Bitcoin that took it from about $4,000 to $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Will history repeat itself? Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls purchased the dip to $24,000 on March 15 and pushed the price above the strong overhead resistance of $25,250 on March 17. This completes an inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3f4fbf71-c5dd-423c-9118-415ec68a6417.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is no major resistance between the current level and $32,000, hence the bulls may find it easy to cover this distance in a short time. The bears may mount a strong defense at $32,000 but if bulls overcome it, the BTC/USDT pair could extend its uptrend to the pattern target of $35,024.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($23,298) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to regain control, they will have to quickly reverse direction and sink the pair below the moving averages. Until then, the bulls are likely to view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the moving averages on March 16, indicating that traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8ba05f94-0e6b-4aad-959b-9360d604092e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push and sustain the price above the $1,743 to $1,780 resistance zone. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could accelerate toward the psychologically important level of $2,000. This is the final hurdle above which the pair will signal the start of a potential uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to halt the up-move in the overhead zone and pull the pair back below the moving averages. That could trap the aggressive bulls and the pair may then collapse to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) March 15 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($302). This signals a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/c84eb9de-3980-4a8d-b59d-2f945add9eda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally picked up momentum on March 17 and skyrocketed above the overhead resistance at $318.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to strengthen their position further by kicking the price above $338. If they do that, the negative H&S pattern will be invalidated. The BNB/USDT pair could first rally to $360 and later to $400.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the tight range between the 50-day simple moving average ($0.38) and the support at $0.36.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2e8059c2-14cf-4283-9e97-2b9e639e706c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight-range trading is followed by an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The bulls will try to catapult the price above the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to $0.42. This level may again act as a formidable resistance but if crossed, the rally could reach $0.51.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below $0.36. The pair could then slump to the strong support zone between $0.32 and $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the 50-day SMA ($0.36) and the strong support at $0.29. The bulls are trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.34).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/1dfba472-4e3c-43d6-ba09-429b9068e4e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to the 50-day SMA. This level may attract sellers who will try to stall the recovery. If the price turns down sharply from this level, the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it may signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.07 level and has reached the downtrend line. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9bd93c38-c335-4f5c-9e24-574d397c0590.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the downtrend line will be the first sign that the correction may be over. The 50-day SMA ($0.08) may act as a resistance but it is likely to be broken. The DOGE/USDT pair could then start its rally to $0.09 and thereafter to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are expected to defend the $0.10 to $0.11 zone with all their might because a break above it will open the doors for a possible rally to $0.16. On the downside, a slide below the $0.07 support will tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $1.07 on March 15, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the $1.05 level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b72a664e-88cd-44eb-a907-2e0eb5e43ebd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.16) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If bulls propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($1.22), the MATIC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $1.30. This level may act as a minor hurdle but it is likely to be crossed. The next stop may be $1.42.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair may then oscillate between the 50-day SMA and $1.05 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/betting-on-turmoil-deribit-launches-bitcoin-volatility-futures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Betting on turmoil: Deribit launches Bitcoin \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  futures}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $18.70 on March 16, which shows that the bulls are not waiting for a deeper decline to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a01f1cd9-4488-49ae-9ead-329454530dd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the moving averages, which are likely to offer a strong resistance. If the price turns down and breaks below $18.70, it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair may remain range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($22.21) and $15.28 for some time.\par \par \