\par\par \b \uc2 SingularityNET ($AGIX) Launches $RJV Utility Token, Surges 150%\b0\par\par\uc2 Vince Dioquino \par \uc2 616 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 March 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 In an environment where the majority of the cryptocurrency market is grappling with the ongoing crypto winter and challenges within the banking sector, Rejuve.AI ($RJV), an artificial intelligence token with connections to Cardano, has experienced remarkable traction, all while of course, also experiencing some degree of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, the token's price has skyrocketed by roughly 153% within the past 24 hours, reaching a new all-time high (ATH) of $0.1132, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 The token's recent surge can be traced back to its successful Token Generation Event (TGE), which followed a series of community funding round events. The token's design is linked to both Ethereum (ETH) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), leveraging the capabilities of two leading proof-of-stake (PoS) Layer 1 protocols. Rejuve itself was launched by SingularityNET ($AGIX) as a utility token, with the prospect of accelerating the extension of human health and lifespans. SingularityNET's thrust, in terms of the social impact it aims to achieve, is quite straightforward: to enable individuals to easily "create, share, and monetize" AI services through a globally accessible AI marketplace.\par \par \uc2 The current enthusiasm surrounding the Rejuve.AI protocol and token can be attributed to the crypto market's broader excitement in terms of artificial intelligence ecosystems and projects. With the introduction of \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's ChatGPT and GPT-4 algorithmic models, numerous crypto projects are pivoting towards AI, devising solutions and applications to advance the frontiers of both AI and blockchain technology.\par \par \uc2 The convergence of AI and blockchain technology has garnered support from numerous proponents, and it is this intersection that Rejuve.AI is currently exploring. However, while the integration of artificial intelligence (AI) within the Web3 ecosystem offers numerous benefits that have the potential to revolutionize the way we interact with decentralized networks and applications, there are several factors that we (humans, yes, all too human humans) need to stay wary of.\par \par \uc2 The unethical use of artificial intelligence, especially in the context of Web3 and blockchain development, may lead to unintended consequences and threats. This may also be countered given how recent deployments of \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's GPT-4 model were used to debug smart contract code, opening the possibility of outsourcing or automating code audits to large language models which contain vast libraries and databases of smart contract code, even those which may be too obscure or may be reserved only for those who have been developing smart contracts since its heydays sometime between 2013 and 2014, which was when Ethereum and other derivatives first sprang.\par \par \uc2 In this instance, AI-driven applications may be exploited for malicious purposes, such as manipulating markets, facilitating illegal activities, or creating fraudulent dApps. Moreover, the mass use of AI can amplify existing biases and inequalities, as algorithms may inadvertently reinforce discriminatory patterns present in training data.\par \par \uc2 Another potentially incriminating quandary with the use of AI for Web3 and blockchain development is this: the centralization of AI development and resources can potentially undermine the decentralized nature of Web3, resulting in power imbalances and compromised security. Consequently, it is crucial to approach AI integration in Web3 with caution, ensuring ethical and responsible use to prevent negative outcomes.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice. Opinions stated herein are solely of the author's, and hence do not represent or reflect CryptoDaily's position on the matter. The author has no stakes in any of the digital assets and securities mentioned, and does not have any significant hold of own any cryptocurrency or token discussed.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230317ej3h000gp\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,742 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The banking crisis has driven investors into Bitcoin and select altcoins \u8212\'20\'14 but could they continue their journey higher?\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets tumbled on March 15 after \uc2 Saudi National Bank\uc2 , Swiss bank \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s largest investor, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rejects-at-25k-as-us-ppi-data-meets-credit-suisse-meltdown"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said it would not be able to provide}}}\uc2  any more funding to \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  due to regulatory limitations.\par \par \uc2 Investors are nervous because \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 , which has large U.S. and global operations, warned on March 14 that it had found \u8220\'20\'1Ccertain material weaknesses\u8221\'20\'1D in its financial reporting processes for 2021 and 2022. Shares of \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  plummeted to an all-time low on March 15.\par \par \uc2 After the events of the past few days, the S&P 500 has given back all its gains for the year and is trading flat. In comparison, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is holding on to a large part of its gains and is up nearly 47% in 2023.\par \par \uc2 Trezor Bitcoin analyst Josef T\u283\'01\'1Btek believes the banking crisis could be positive for Bitcoin, as it could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/silvergate-sbv-collapse-definitely-good-for-bitcoin-trezor-exec-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emerge as a safe-haven asset}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7932f249-34fb-48e5-a1b2-eb31987630a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Capriole founder and CEO Charles Edwards said that Bitcoin has formed a \u8220\'20\'1Cbump and run reversal pattern,\u8221\'20\'1D which has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-100k-next-analyst-eyes-textbook-perfect-btc-price-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target objective of $100,000 and higher}}}\uc2 . However, Edwards cautioned traders that the pattern could fail, hence it should not be used for building a trading or investment plan.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins rise above their overhead resistance levels and start the next leg of the up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $25,250 on March 14 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are not ready to surrender without a fight. Strong selling pulled the price back below $25,250.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f4754a04-1af6-4841-ae55-283459cd5cba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($23,012), has started to turn up, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating an advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break and close above $25,250 increases. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern. That will signal a potential trend change. The pair may then sprint toward $32,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to slow down the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance at $1,743 on March 14, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are trying to protect the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d78a955a-81b1-4ade-845d-e5f623e4847f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price consolidates between $1,743 and the 20-day EMA ($1,588), it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a break and close above $1,743. The ETH/USDT pair is then well-positioned for a strong rally toward the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the ETH/USDT pair may consolidate in a large range between $1,743 and $1,352 for some time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the strong resistance near $318. This suggests that the bears are trying to defend the zone between $318 and $338.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5e46481f-b789-4ea6-8558-f2de9486be01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they have not allowed the price to break back below the 50-day simple moving average, or SMA ($306). The shallow pullback shows that every minor dip is being purchased.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make one more attempt to catapult the price above the overhead zone. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair can soar toward $400. Contrarily, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair may slide to the 20-day EMA ($296). A break below this level will signal an advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.38) and formed a Doji candlestick pattern on March 14, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7241b440-0f77-4840-a30b-edf25739ec2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty resolved to the downside on March 15, and the price slipped to the strong support at $0.36. If this level is taken out, the XRP/USDT pair could decline to the support line of the channel near $0.32.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price stays above $0.36, the bulls will again try to overcome the obstacle at the 50-day SMA and $0.40. If they can pull it off, the pair may pick up momentum and climb to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) accelerated on March 14 and reached the 50-day SMA ($0.36), but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ab0e3db7-3ad8-4f9e-9478-0a71aa8c60f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tugged the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on March 15, which has cleared the path for a possible retest of $0.30. Buyers are likely to protect this level with all their might because the next support is way lower at $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds from the current level of $0.30, it will suggest that traders are buying on dips. That may keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair range-bound between the 50-day SMA and $0.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the downtrend line where the bears are mounting a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/58d7d770-288e-4317-b294-d7053706f33a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control. Sellers are trying to yank the price below the immediate support at $0.07. If this support collapses, the DOGE/USDT pair may descend to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The downtrend line remains the key level on the upside because a break above it could start a relief rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The relief rally for Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the 50-day SMA ($1.22), which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.16) on March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5add2ebd-d63d-44e7-9f59-3cdbed62ac94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could plummet to the strong support at $1.05. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair may retest the $0.94 support. A break below this level will open the gates for a potential drop to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the $1.05 support. If that happens, the bulls will again try to drive the price above the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the likelihood of a break above $1.30 increases.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-signs-the-bitcoin-price-rally-could-top-out-at-26k-for-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4 signs the Bitcoin price rally could top out at $26K for now}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the rally in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) at the 50-day SMA ($22.40), but the bulls are trying to keep the price above the immediate support at $19.68.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/59d1e3bf-9ec1-4822-aecb-bdbf1acde972.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls will again try to push the price to the downtrend line. This is a vital resistance to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will signal a potential trend change. There is a minor resistance at $28, but it is likely to be crossed. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may then surge toward $39.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and falls below $19.68, it will suggest that the bears have not yet given up. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to drive Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($6.42) on March 14, but the bears did not relent. This suggests that higher levels are attracting sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5bda81e7-d630-4f14-b710-7c9dbbc10455.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears. If the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($6.07), the DOT/USDT pair may swing between the 50-day SMA and $5 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could pick up momentum and soar toward the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. On the downside, the bears will have to sink the pair below $5 to indicate a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a descending channel pattern. The bulls tried to push the price above the channel, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/904c81d3-f9ed-41bd-ae0f-54878f1063e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to pull the price below the psychological support at $0.000010. If they manage to do that, the SHIB/USDT pair could fall toward the support line of the channel. The bulls are likely to defend the $0.000008\u8211\'20\'13$0.000007 zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate inside the large range between $0.000018 and $0.000007 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 In the near term, a break above the 50-day SMA ($0.000012) will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.000014 and then to $0.000016.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMjcyMGYyNjItNzZiMC00MzUzLWFjYTUtYjk3NTY5MTY5OTUzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230315ej3f000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,730 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The banking crisis has driven investors into Bitcoin and select altcoins, but could they continue their journey higher\par \par \uc2 