price-move"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target objective of $100,000 and higher}}}\uc2 . However, Edwards cautioned traders that the pattern could fail, hence it should not be used for building a trading or investment plan.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the altcoins rise above their overhead resistance levels and start the next leg of the up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Bitcoin above the overhead resistance of $25,250 on March 14 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are not ready to surrender without a fight. Strong selling pulled the price back below $25,250.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f4754a04-1af6-4841-ae55-283459cd5cba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($23,012) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break and close above $25,250 increases. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. That will signal a potential trend change. The pair may then sprint toward $32,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to slow down the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance at $1,743 on March 14 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are trying to protect the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d78a955a-81b1-4ade-845d-e5f623e4847f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price consolidates between $1,743 and the 20-day EMA ($1,588), it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a break and close above $1,743. The ETH/USDT pair is then well-positioned for a strong rally toward the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the ETH/USDT pair may consolidate in a large range between $1,743 and $1,352 for some time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the strong resistance near $318. This suggests that the bears are trying to defend the zone between $318 and $338.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5e46481f-b789-4ea6-8558-f2de9486be01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they have not allowed the price to break back below the 50-day simple moving average ($306). The shallow pullback shows that every minor dip is being purchased.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make one more attempt to catapult the price above the overhead zone. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair can soar toward $400. Contrarily, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair may slide to the 20-day EMA ($296). A break below this level will signal advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.38) and formed a Doji candlestick pattern on March 14, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7241b440-0f77-4840-a30b-edf25739ec2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty resolved to the downside on March 15 and the price has slipped to the strong support at $0.36. If this level is taken out, the XRP/USDT pair could decline to the support line of the channel near $0.32.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price stays above $0.36, the bulls will again try to overcome the obstacle at the 50-day SMA and $0.40. If they can pull it off, the pair may pick up momentum and climb to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) accelerated on March 14 and reached the 50-day SMA ($0.36) but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ab0e3db7-3ad8-4f9e-9478-0a71aa8c60f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have tugged the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on March 15, which has cleared the path for a possible retest of $0.30. Buyers are likely to protect this level with all their might because the next support is way lower at $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds from the current level or $0.30, it will suggest that traders are buying on dips. That may keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair range-bound between the 50-day SMA and $0.50 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the downtrend line where the bears are mounting a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/58d7d770-288e-4317-b294-d7053706f33a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control. Sellers are trying to yank the price below the immediate support at $0.07. If this support collapses, the DOGE/USDT pair may descend to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The downtrend line remains the key level on the upside because a break above it could start a relief rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing stiff resistance at the 50-day SMA ($1.22). That has pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.16) on March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5add2ebd-d63d-44e7-9f59-3cdbed62ac94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could plummet to the strong support at $1.05. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair may retest the $0.94 support. A break below this level will open the gates for a potential drop to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the $1.05 support. If that happens, the bulls will again try to drive the price above the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the likelihood of a break above $1.30 increases.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-signs-the-bitcoin-price-rally-could-top-out-at-26k-for-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4 signs the Bitcoin price rally could top out at $26K for now}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rally at the 50-day SMA ($22.40) but the bulls are trying to keep the price above the immediate support at $19.68.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/59d1e3bf-9ec1-4822-aecb-bdbf1acde972.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls will again try to push the price to the downtrend line. This is a vital resistance to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will signal a potential trend change. There is a minor resistance at $28 but it is likely to be crossed. The SOL/USDT pair may then surge toward $39.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and falls below $19.68, it will suggest that the bears have not yet given up. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $15.28.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to drive Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($6.42) on March 14 but the bears did not relent. This suggests that higher levels are attracting sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5bda81e7-d630-4f14-b710-7c9dbbc10455.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint indicating a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears. If the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($6.07), the DOT/USDT pair may swing between the 50-day SMA and $5 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could pick up momentum and soar toward the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern. On the downside, the bears will have to sink the pair below $5 to indicate a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a descending channel pattern. The bulls tried to push the price above the channel but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/904c81d3-f9ed-41bd-ae0f-54878f1063e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to pull the price below the psychological support at $0.000010. If they manage to do that, the SHIB/USDT pair could fall toward the support line of the channel. The bulls are likely to defend the $0.000008 to $0.000007 zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate inside the large range between $0.000018 and $0.000007 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 In the near term, a break above the 50-day SMA ($0.000012) will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.000014 and then to $0.000016.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMjcyMGYyNjItNzZiMC00MzUzLWFjYTUtYjk3NTY5MTY5OTUzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230315ej3f000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/13: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,661 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has roared back to $24,000, indicating strong demand as traders turn cautious fearing more bank failures.\par \par \uc2 Three banks \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-industry-braces-for-impact-with-silvergate-exit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silvergate Bank}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/silicon-valley-bank-collapse-everything-that-s-happened-until-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-celsius-and-paxos-disclose-funds-in-signature-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Signature Bank}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 collapsed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nobody-left-to-bank-crypto-companies-crypto-twitter-reacts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 within a span of a few days}}}\uc2 , increasing demand for \uc2 United States government\uc2  bonds and sendin the yield on the 2-year Treasury tumbling to 4.06%, a fall of 100 basis points since March 8.\par \par \uc2 This was the largest three-day decline since Oct. 22, 1987, when a stock market crash {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/13/us-treasury-yields-investors-assess-the-state-of-the-economy.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saw}}}\uc2  the yield fall 117 points.\par \par \uc2 Although the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  announced the formation of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-fed-announces-25b-in-funding-to-backstop-banks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $25 billion Bank Term Funding Program}}}\uc2  to support businesses and households, the regional banks are taking it on their chin on March 13. This shows that equities traders remain nervous.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b94dee21-7af3-4e20-9773-74ee3b2ca6a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, among all the mayhem, it is an encouraging sign to see Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) lead the cryptocurrency recovery from the front. Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-bank-bloodbath-bitcoin-hits-23-7k-as-btc-price-analyst-call-svb-dip-bear-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbed back above $24,000}}}\uc2  on March 13, covering a large distance from the $19,549 local low hit on March 10.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the major altcoins sustain their short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 (SPX) index plunged below the 200-day simple moving average, or SMA (3,940), on March 9 and followed that up with another downward move on March 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7858ece3-a8c8-4032-bc87-1fc74ec069e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break below the 200-day SMA is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, but if the price quickly turns up and climbs back above the level, it will suggest that the breakdown on March 9 may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 The index could gain momentum after buyers thrust the price above the 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA (3,986). There is a minor resistance at 4,078, but it is likely to be crossed. The index may then soar to 4,200.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below 3,764 will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit. That next support is at 3,700 and then 3,650.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) stalled just below the 200-day SMA (106). This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The selling pulled the price below the 20-day EMA (104) on March 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/4af45314-afec-4ff0-996b-827b75a72181.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the index range-bound between 101 and the 200-day SMA for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and plummets below the support near 101, the index will complete a head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break above the 200-day SMA will attract buyers who may then push the price to 108 and thereafter to 110.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price rebounded off the 200-day SMA ($19,717) on March 10, and the recovery picked up momentum after the break above $21,480. This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f3ba5d14-0bf3-490a-bc72-1c6a81112157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued the upward march and cleared the hurdle at $22,800 on March 13. This opens the gates for a retest of the stiff overhead resistance at $25,250. If buyers overcome this barrier, the BTC/USDT pair could witness aggressive short covering. That may catapult the price to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may oscillate between the 200-day SMA and $25,250 for a while longer. Such a move will be a positive sign and improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down and plunges below the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support near $1,352, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels. The recovery strengthened after bulls pushed the price back above $1,461.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/696e080b-f67f-410d-8913-72a029ec4ef1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rose back above the 20-day EMA ($1,565) on March 12, indicating that bulls are back in the game. Buyers will next try to stretch the relief rally to the overhead resistance at $1,743.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the momentum favors the bulls. If buyers surmount the resistance at $1,743, the pair could soar to the psychological level at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern on March 9, but the sellers could not build upon this negative setup. Buyers purchased the drop on March 10, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7208d145-8c7f-4b76-92c3-a5fdde26f279.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on March 12, and the bulls pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA. This may have trapped the aggressive bears who rushed to close their short positions.\par \par \uc2 That could be the reason for the sharp up-move on March 13, which propelled the price back to the overhead resistance at $318. If bulls clear this hurdle, the BNB/USDT pair may rise to $338.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the pair may consolidate between $338 and $265 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the strong support of $0.36 for the past few days. Usually, a tight consolidation near the support resolves to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/c91bda5f-8904-4ab2-a979-6b378ae57185.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.37) and the RSI in both in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and closes below $0.36, the XRP/USDT pair may drop to the support line of the descending channel pattern. The buyers are likely to defend the support near $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close above the channel will be the first sign that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair may then ascend to the 200-day SMA ($0.39) and later to $0.43.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.30, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests solid buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/15c69020-15d3-414d-b255-1248e408828a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has pulled back above the 20-day EMA ($0.34). The zone between the moving averages is likely to be defended aggressively by the bears. If the price turns down from the current level, the pair may retest the strong support at $0.30. If this level cracks, the pair could drop to $0.27 and then to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers kick the price above the 200-day SMA ($0.36), it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair may then rally to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ethereum (ETH) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 200-day SMA ($0.95) on March 10 and reached the 20-day EMA ($1.16) on March 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/03d95c85-4456-4f53-98a6-7c6b9f385505.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA on March 13, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying at lower 