elow this crucial support could accelerate selling, and the SOL/USDT pair may tumble to $12.69.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. That could result in a retest of the strong overhead resistance zone between the 200-day SMA ($23) and the downtrend line. A break above this zone could indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMGU2YjVjM2EtYWQ2Yi00OTI0LWE3MzktMzM1ZmM2MzY2MmE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230313ej3d000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/13: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,649 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has roared back to $24,000, indicating strong demand as traders turn cautious fearing more bank failures.\par \par \uc2 Three banks, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-industry-braces-for-impact-with-silvergate-exit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silvergate}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/silicon-valley-bank-collapse-everything-that-s-happened-until-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-celsius-and-paxos-disclose-funds-in-signature-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Signature}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nobody-left-to-bank-crypto-companies-crypto-twitter-reacts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 collapsed within a span of a few days}}}\uc2 . That increased demand for \uc2 United States government\uc2  bonds, which sent the yield on the 2-year Treasury tumbling to 4.06%, a fall of 100 basis points since March 8.\par \par \uc2 This was the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/03/13/us-treasury-yields-investors-assess-the-state-of-the-economy.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largest}}}\uc2  3-day decline since Oct. 22, 1987, following the stock market crash, when the yield fell 117 points.\par \par \uc2 Although the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  announced the formation of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-fed-announces-25b-in-funding-to-backstop-banks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $25 billion Bank Term Funding Program}}}\uc2  to support businesses and households, the regional banks are taking it on their chin on March 13. This shows that equities traders remain nervous.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b94dee21-7af3-4e20-9773-74ee3b2ca6a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, among all the mayhem, it is an encouraging sign to see Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) lead the cryptocurrency recovery from the front. Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-bank-bloodbath-bitcoin-hits-23-7k-as-btc-price-analyst-call-svb-dip-bear-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbed back above $24,000}}}\uc2  on March 13, covering a large distance from the $19,549 local low hit on March 10.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the major altcoins sustain their short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) plunged below the 200-day simple moving average (3,940) on March 9 and followed that up with another downward move on March 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7858ece3-a8c8-4032-bc87-1fc74ec069e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break below the 200-day SMA is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign but if the price quickly turns up and climbs back above the level, it will suggest that the breakdown on March 9 may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 The index could gain momentum after buyers thrust the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (3,986). There is a minor resistance at 4,078 but it is likely to be crossed. The index may then soar to 4,200.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below 3,764 will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit. That next support is at 3,700 and then 3,650.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the U.S. dollar index (DXY) stalled just below the 200-day SMA (106). This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The selling has pulled the price below the 20-day EMA (104) on March 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/4af45314-afec-4ff0-996b-827b75a72181.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. This could keep the index range-bound between 101 and the 200-day SMA for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and plummets below the support near 101, the index will complete a head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break above the 200-day SMA will attract buyers who may then push the price to 108 and thereafter to 110.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price rebounded off the 200-day SMA ($19,717) on March 10 and the recovery picked up momentum after the break above $21,480. This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f3ba5d14-0bf3-490a-bc72-1c6a81112157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued the upward march and cleared the hurdle at $22,800 on March 13. This opens the gates for a retest of the stiff overhead resistance at $25,250. If buyers overcome this barrier, the BTC/USDT pair could witness aggressive short covering. That may catapult the price to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may oscillate between the 200-day SMA and $25,250 for a while longer. Such a move will be a positive sign and improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down and plunges below the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support near $1,352, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels. The recovery strengthened after bulls pushed the price back above $1,461.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/696e080b-f67f-410d-8913-72a029ec4ef1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rose back above the 20-day EMA ($1,565) on March 12, indicating that bulls are back in the game. Buyers will next try to stretch the relief rally to the overhead resistance at $1,743.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the momentum favors the bulls. If buyers surmount the resistance at $1,743, the pair could soar to the psychological level at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern on March 9 but the sellers could not build upon this negative setup. Buyers purchased the drop on March 10 as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7208d145-8c7f-4b76-92c3-a5fdde26f279.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on March 12 and the bulls pushed the price back above the 200-day SMA. This may have trapped the aggressive bears who rushed to close their short positions.\par \par \uc2 That could be the reason for the sharp up-move on March 13, which propelled the price back to the overhead resistance at $318. If bulls clear this hurdle, the BNB/USDT pair may rise to $338.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the pair may consolidate between $338 and $265 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the strong support of $0.36 for the past few days. Usually, a tight consolidation near the support resolves to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/c91bda5f-8904-4ab2-a979-6b378ae57185.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.37) and the RSI in both i