\par\par \b \uc2 Binance\uc2  Launches Prepaid Crypto Card in Colombia\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 335 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 March 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 After launching similar initiatives in Brazil and Argentina, \uc2 Binance\uc2  is widening its reach into LATAM by making its crypto debit card available in Colombia.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency exchange \uc2 Binance\uc2  announced the launch of a prepaid crypto card in Colombia, marking the third country in Latin America (LATAM) in which it has done so. \uc2 Binance\uc2  released the card in Argentina last year and in Brazil this past January. The exchange said:\par \par \uc2 The prepaid crypto card is part of \uc2 Binance\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ongoing effort to bridge the growing crypto ecosystem with traditional financial infrastructure and expand users\u8217\'20\'19 ability to make everyday purchases with digital assets.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  said its new prepaid crypto-linked card would allow users to pay with crypto to all merchants who accept standard debit and credit cards.\par \par \uc2 Binance Partners with Movii\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s new crypto card is the product of a partnership with Movii, a Colombia neo bank. The prepaid crypto card currently supports BNB, BTC, ETH, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , DOT, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , SHIB, XRP, MATIC, LINK, and other stablecoins. Users will be able to configure which currency they want to spend.\par \par \uc2 According to its announcement, users can enjoy a seamless transaction experience where their crypto will be converted to fiat in real-time at the point of purchase. \uc2 Binance\uc2  included a couple of perks with its card, including up to 8% cashback in crypto on eligible purchases and zero fees on ATM withdrawals.\par \par \uc2 Daniel Acosta, \uc2 Binance\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s general manager in Colombia, commented:\par \par \uc2 As one of the world leaders in \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Colombia is an extremely relevant market for \uc2 Binance\uc2 . We believe that the launch of Binance Card will encourage even wider adoption of crypto among Colombians, contributing to the development of the blockchain and crypto ecosystem in the country while making another step to bring cryptocurrency closer to the everyday life of millions of people.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230313ej3d000ji\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,696 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins have broken below their strong support levels, but lower levels are attracting buyers and this is an encouraging sign.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) led a sharp sell-off in the cryptocurrency markets on March 9 as the woes at \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-bank-woes-silicon-valley-bank-stocks-plunge-1-day-after-silvergate-downfall"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank dented \b  \highlight22investor sentiment\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In addition, crypto-specific news of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ny-ag-sues-kucoin-for-selling-securities-and-commodities-without-registration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suit filed by New York Attorney General}}}\uc2  Letitia James against cryptocurrency exchange KuCoin for selling securities and commodities without registration increased uncertainty about the future of crypto sector \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The selling momentum continued on March 10 and pulled Bitcoin below the $20,000 mark. Several other cryptocurrencies have also broken below their important support levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/73047ff6-b541-4433-a2c4-4ae2e0c093f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 But a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that February\u8217\'20\'19s jobs report was a mixed bag. Although nonfarm payrolls rose 311,000 for the month, above estimates of an increase of 225,000, the average earnings rose less than anticipated. That {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-battles-20k-as-trader-calls-bank-chaos-2008-all-over-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced expectations of a 50 basis point}}}\uc2  rate hike in the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s March meeting from 68% on March 9 to 42% on March 10.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels on the upside that will signal a sustained recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sliced through the $21,480 support on March 9 with ease. The selling continued on March 10 and the price broke below the crucial support at $20,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/15389bbc-adf3-4390-ae0e-d35a2c372dda.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The fall of the past few days has sent the relative strength index (RSI) into the oversold zone. This suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the near term and a recovery may be possible.\par \par \uc2 During a sharp fall, markets usually tend to overshoot on the downside. The same may have happened here. The bulls will try to start a rebound off the current levels but may face strong resistance at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to flip the $21,480 level into resistance. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair may turn down and retest the $20,000 support. If this level breaks down, the next stop could be $18,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) witnessed aggressive selling on March 9, which pulled the price below the strong support at $1,461.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9003608b-2db4-443b-9d4b-700992d9ff6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could next drop to $1,352 where the bulls are likely to mount a strong defense. If the price turns up from $1,352, the recovery may hit a brick wall at $1,461. If the price turns down from this level, it will increase the possibility of a fall to $1,200.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above $1,461. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The pair may then reach the 20-day exponential moving average ($1,565).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($294) on March 8 and broke below the solid support of $280. This move completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/abcdd996-bded-4bb1-83f5-909475802d91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Typically, the price returns to retest the breakdown level from the pattern. If the price turns down from $280, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That may send the BNB/USDT pair tumbling toward $245 and thereafter to the pattern target of $222.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls drive the price above $280, the pair could reach the 20-day EMA. This level may again attract strong selling but if bulls absorb the supply and do not allow the pair to slip below $280, it will suggest the start of a recovery.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the descending channel pattern on March 8 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/e5bb7173-ce37-407c-b5b6-1abf6e244df6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back into the channel on March 9, which may have trapped the aggressive longs. The XRP/USDT pair has reached the solid support at $0.36. If this level gives way, the pair may reach the support line of the channel near $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.36, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the pair above the channel. If they succeed, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $0.43.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the $0.32 support on March 8 and the bears thwarted attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level on March 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/14a236cd-9c35-431b-8916-8a4f4b9307a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling resumed on March 10 and bears pulled the price below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.30. This opens up the possibility of a further fall to the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are currently trying to push the price back above $0.32. If they manage to do that, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then rise to the 20-day EMA ($0.34). The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to indicate that they are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) easily broke below the strong support near $0.07 which had not been breached convincingly since October 2022. This shows that bears are in complete control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d224e3ef-309d-4e07-9c81-5c9ac0c0e332.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dipped into the oversold zone, indicating that a minor consolidation or a relief rally is possible. The bulls are expected to defend the zone between $0.06 and $0.05 with all their might because a break below it could result in panic selling.\par \par \uc2 On the way up, buyers will face stiff resistance at $0.07 and again at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this zone, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the vital support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on March 8 and fell to the strong support of $1.05. Ideally, this level should have attracted aggressive buying but that did not happen.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3e787f01-97c8-4967-8bfc-6cde30785373.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This shows that traders sold aggressively. The incessant selling pulled the price below $1.05 on March 9 and the bears continued with their selling on March 10.\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the candlestick suggests solid buying near the support at $0.91. The bulls will try to push the price back above the breakdown level of $1.05. If they can pull it off, the MATIC/USDT pair may rise to the 20-day EMA ($1.17).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears are unwilling to let go of their advantage. That increases the risk of a fall to the crucial support zone between $0.74 and $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-hits-4-month-lows-vs-bitcoin-50-doge-price-rebound-now-in-play"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin hits 4-month lows vs. Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 50% DOGE price rebound now in play}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 After a weak attempt to hold $19.68 on March 7, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support on March 8. This indicates that bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0f41386d-8d17-4870-b346-96585f1e67f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair has a minor support at $15.28 where the bulls are again trying to arrest the decline and form a higher low. Any attempt to recover is likely to face strong selling at $19.68 and again at the resistance line. A break above this level will indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the $15.28 level gives way, the pair may fall to $12.85 and then to the psychologically critical support at $10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong corrective phase. The bears pulled the price below the important support at $5.56 on March 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8372da76-4baa-49c8-8071-fa09cbc2b525.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on March 10 but the long tail on the candlestick indicates strong buying near the 78.6% Fibonacci retracement level of $5. This is a crucial level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may open the gates for a complete 100% retracement to $4.22.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and rises back above $5.56, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The DOT/USDT pair may then climb to the 20-day EMA ($6.14) where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to start a recovery in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) on March 8 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong selling near the 20-day EMA ($0.000012).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7c7665a7-c05a-4bd4-93dc-102c1eec09b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair turned down and fell below the $0.000011 support on March 9. The bulls are currently trying to defend the psychological level of $0.000010. If they succeed, the pair may start a relief rally to the 20-day EMA where the bulls may again face strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That increases the likelihood of a break below $0.000010. If that happens, the pair may descend to $0.000008.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZDZhZjcwMDktOTliYy00ZDQ0LTg3YWUtODc3OWE5ZjIxNDgyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230310ej3a000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,836 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls who will have to push the price above key moving averages to keep Bitcoin and select altcoins out of danger.\par \par \uc2 On March 7, \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  warned that interest rates might remain higher for longer than previously anticipated. This boosted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-clings-to-22k-as-us-dollar-strength-rises-to-december-levels-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expectations of a 50 basis point rate hike}}}\uc2  at the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s March meeting to about 70%, from 30% a week earlier, according to FedWatch Tool data.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar shot up and the S&P 500 plunged after Powell\u8217\'20\'19s comments on March 7 but a minor positive in favor of the cryptocurrency investors is that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stayed relatively calm. The next trigger that could influence the markets is the February Jobs report to be released on March 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/970deb31-435a-44ba-b8f9-6cc780d87f04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although the macroeconomic environment is not favorable for risky assets, Bitcoin has shown relative resilience. This suggests that Bitcoin investors are not panicking and dumping their positions due to short-term uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and the major altcoins continue lower or is a rebound around the corner? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Bitcoin back above the breakdown level of $22,800. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying at current levels. That could pull the price down to the crucial support of $21,480. This is the make-or-break level in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2b97d642-28c1-4db4-b771-0baeb3d24a8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $21,480, the bears will fancy their chances. They will then try to yank the price to the psychologically important level of $20,000. Buyers are expected to defend the zone between $21,480 and $20,000 with all their might because a break below it may witness aggressive selling.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the sharp decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the moving averages. That could signal a possible range-bound action between $21,480 and $25,250.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to protect the $1,550 level on Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) but a minor negative is that they have failed to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests that the bears are selling on every small recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/ab26a175-dcc0-4bf2-8d5f-22e77da14c57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($1,599) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the $1,550 support cracks, the ETH/USDT pair may drop to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $1,461 and $1,743 for some time. Contrarily, a break below $1,461 will open the doors for a possible drop to $1,352. This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $280 support on March 6 and March 7 but the bears pounced at higher levels. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and every minor recovery is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b11b7995-b14d-4fe3-b397-48a41330b371.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the $280 gives way, the BNB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. This negative setup may start a downward move to $245 where buyers will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the bulls sustain the current rebound. Such a move will indicate that the buyers are fiercely defending the $280 support. That may start a recovery to the 20-day EMA ($299).\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to sell the rally to the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may again slide to $280. On the contrary, a break above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that suggests the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.36 support with strength and soared above the resistance line of the descending channel on March 8, a sign that the bulls are buying with full force.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/9a85d732-63b1-4dc0-9581-6bfd5968f2dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($0.39), it will suggest a potential trend change in the near term. The XRP/USDT pair may then start its march toward $0.43 where the bears are again likely to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this level, the pai