://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a7011efa-dfde-4d51-89ef-64777b12fbec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $1.05 where the bulls will try to protect the level. If the price rebounds off this support, the pair could pullback to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it may suggest that the correction may be over. The pair may not start a new up-move in a hurry but remain range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the price below $1.05. If they succeed, the pair may slip to $0.90.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brace-for-btc-price-volatility-bitcoin-coin-days-destroyed-metric-jumps-to-2-month-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Brace for BTC price \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 ? Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18coin days destroyed\u8217\'20\'19 metric jumps to 2-month highs}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) remains in a firm bear grip. The failure to start a rebound off the crucial support at $19.68 shows that buyers may not be jumping in to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/308ce815-8ac3-491b-9c09-81a28de6d61c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have yanked the price below $19.68 on March 8. This indicates the start of the next leg of the correction. The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the SOL/USDT pair toward the next major support near $15.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this collapse, they will have to quickly push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($21.80). That may start a relief rally to the resistance line, where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the support at $5.73 on March 8. This indicates that the bears are trying to solidify their position further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8319499e-c256-44f8-a53a-6ea67e39d26f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is a strong support at $5.56 but if this level cracks, the DOT/USDT pair may enter a downward spiral. The next support is much lower at $4.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $5.56, the pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($6.30). During downtrends, the bears try to sell on rallies to the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this level, the likelihood of a break below $5.56 increases.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make their presence felt, they will have to drive the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the immediate support of $85 on March 7. This indicates the resumption of the correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7e4b0081-9657-475b-bd8f-9544be6dbfae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair could first fall to the $81 support. The bounce off this level may face selling near the 20-day EMA ($92). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the vital support at $75. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The farther the price moves away from the local top of $106, the longer it will take for the pair to resume its uptrend. The recovery is likely to pick up momentum after the price sustains above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvYTczZTQ1MmEtN2Q2MS00ZTJhLWFhY2ItMTg0MDViOGU2ODVlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230308ej38000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/6: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,687 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Upcoming statements from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  and continued fallout from \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2  have crypto traders anticipating an uptick in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets are trying to extend their recovery at the start of the new week. One of the reasons that could be boosting investor confidence is that the yield on the benchmark 10-year note has slipped further to 3.924%.\par \par \uc2 However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment of the equities markets has not rubbed off on the cryptocurrency markets which continue to underperform. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading since March 4 suggests that there is uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/f9d34e54-3dcd-4842-ba48-e2e0b465b960.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Generally, periods of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  are followed by a pick-up in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The congressional testimony of Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  on March 7 and March 8 will be watched for the outlook on inflation and rate hikes. Later, on March 10, the release of February's job report could add to the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could the strength in the U.S. equities markets and the weakness in the U.S. dollar index(DXY) attract buying in the beaten-down cryptocurrency sector? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) turned up sharply from 3,928 on March 2, indicating that buyers have not given up and are accumulating at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2e30de14-63a6-42e7-af22-870b4c588cc0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (4,030) on March 3 and followed it up with another move higher on March 6. The rise back above the uptrend line could have trapped the aggressive bears who may be rushing to the exit. The index will try to rise to 4,200 and then to 4,300.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are back in the game. A break and close below 3,928 could open the gates for a possible drop to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the U.S. dollar index (DXY) is facing selling near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 105.52 but a minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA (104.10).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/17482d0c-6e82-4b2c-8339-a823ba63914a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to drive the index above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the index could rally to the 50% retracement level of 106.98 and then to the 61.8% retracement level of 108.43.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop may be the 50-day SMA (103.36). Such a move will suggest that the index may consolidate between 101.29 and 105.52 for some time.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is struggling to climb back above $22,800, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative zone, signaling advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/c3ef44f8-6c20-43f8-8742-572591158bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the BTC/USDT pair may drop to the critical support at $21,480. This level may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the bears come out on top, the pair may extend its decline to the psychologically important level of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off $21,480, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $22,800. If they manage to do that, the pair may start its up-move toward $25,250.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range following the sharp fall on March 3. This indicates indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/bf1add13-2879-4bbc-bd22-081da621d700.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $1,544, the advantage could tilt in their favor and the ETH/USDT pair may slump toward the strong support at $1,461. This level is again likely to behave as a strong support. If the price springs back from this level, the pair may remain stuck between $1,461 and $1,743 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages to signal a comeback. The pair may then attempt to climb above the $1,680 to $1,743 resistance zone. If that happens, the pair may start its journey toward $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) shallow pullback from the current level shows a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($301) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/56b0c986-ef55-45ac-af1b-e87afab10f0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $280, the BNB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. That could start a downward move toward the first target at $245 and thereafter $222.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downturn, they will have to fiercely defend the $280 support and quickly push the price above the 20-day EMA. That could increase the possibility of a rise to the overhead resistance at $318.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $0.36 support on March 3 met with strong selling near the 20-day EMA ($0.38). This suggests that the sentiment is negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7f30d6b7-b405-413e-911c-31ec2ea276d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price tumbles below $0.36, the XRP/USDT pair could reach the support line of the descending channel pattern. Buyers may buy this dip to keep the pair inside the channel but could find it difficult to overcome the obstacle at $0.36.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the resistance line of the channel. That could attract further buying and the pair may attempt a rally to $0.43 where they are likely to encounter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.32 support on March 3 but the bulls could not propel the price above the overhead resistance at $0.34. This shows that the rallies are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/61f30dd0-bb31-4784-bae9-6f3e10a97391.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to sink the price below the $0.32 support. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could witness aggressive selling. There is no major support until the pair reaches $0.26.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the near term if the price rebounds off $0.32 and breaks above the moving averages. That could increase the possibility of the formation of the right shoulder of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-eye-19k-btc-price-bottom-warn-of-hot-february-cpi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders eye $19K BTC price bottom, warn of 'hot' February CPI}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on March 5, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8dbc6c63-3240-4487-9f1d-b6d62e28a992.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1.23) and the RSI below 41 suggest advantage to the bears. The MATIC/USDT pair could drop to the solid support at $1.05. Buyers are expected to defend this level aggressively because a break and close below it may sink the pair to $0.90 and thereafter to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $1.05 with strength, it will indicate demand at lower levels. That may start a relief rally to the 20-day EMA where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on March 5 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick indicates selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/5fa8bc6e-8b35-440c-9c4e-f19932cf5a20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.08) and the RSI near the oversold zone show that bears are in command. The sellers will try to strengthen their position further by yanking the price below the crucial support near $0.07. If this level breaks down, the pair could reach the pattern target of $0.06.\par \par \uc2 On the way up, the first resistance to watch out for is $0.08. If this level is scaled, the DOGE/USDT pair may start a recovery toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to start a recovery in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) on March 5 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows selling near the 20-day EMA ($22.32).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2469ffb4-843a-41af-a40d-e3dd7e2b7a1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below the strong support near $19.68. If they succeed, the selling may intensify and the SOL/USDT pair could plummet toward the strong support near $15.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $19.68, it will suggest accumulation on dips. The bulls will then again try to push the price above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could rise to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 The zone between the resistance line and $27.12 remains the key area to watch out for because a break above it could catapult the pair toward $39.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvNGM3NGE2MWYtOWU5Ny00YjQ3LTk5NTQtNDEwYTc1OGZlZmU5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230306ej36000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,684 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoin prices took a hit this week, but technical analysis suggests the downturn could be short-lived.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is leading the cryptocurrency markets lower, and the matter is being exacerbated by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Silvergate Banks\u8217\'20\'19 ongoing issues}}}\uc2 . This week, the cryptocurrency-focused bank said it needed additional time to file its annual 10-K report and warned that it might not make it another 12 months. Reacting to this news, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-tether-adds-to-firms-distancing-from-silvergate-as-stock-dives-57"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several cryptocurrency companies}}}\uc2  announced they would reduce or cancel their partnerships with \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty regarding the future of the bank and its overall impact on the cryptocurrency sector may have caused a knee-jerk reaction. However, if the contagion does not spread, the downside may be limited.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0d6acfdd-30dd-4b56-b649-a9e55b8f84d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive for the cryptocurrency markets is that the United States equities markets are attempting to start a recovery. This suggests that traders continue to add risk to their portfolios at lower levels. This risk-on sentiment may limit the downside in Bitcoin and select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels on the downside that may act as a support and start a recovery in Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above the $24,000 level may have tempted traders to book profits. The selling accelerated on March 3, and the bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $22,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/2d172788-6a06-4131-b67f-5aa297b4da27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($23,332), is still flat, but the relative strength index (RSI) has plunged below 44, indicating that the short-term momentum has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The next crucial support to watch on the downside is $21,480.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break and close below it could open the doors for a retest of the psychologically important level of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $21,480, the bulls will try to clear the overhead hurdle at $22,800. If they do that, it will indicate that the BTC/USDT pair may remain stuck between $21,480 and $25,250 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the overhead resistance of $1,680 on March 2, indicating that bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/8fba9128-d209-4f46-a6b0-55c18d2f3716.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The traders seem to have sold aggressively on March 3, which broke the support at the 50-day SMA ($1,607). The ETH/USDT pair may next drop to the critical support at $1,461 where the buyers may try to arrest the pullback.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $1,461 with strength, it will suggest that the pair may stay inside a range for a few days. The bulls will be back in the game if they push and sustain the price above $1,680. On the contrary, if the price slips below $1,461, the correction could deepen to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The symmetrical triangle pattern in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) resolved to the downside on March 3, indicating that the be