e expected to guard this level aggressively. If the price turns up from this level, the rebound could reach $0.08. This is where the bulls and the bears are likely to have a tough battle for supremacy.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.08, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That may increase the possibility of a drop to the pattern target of $0.06. On the other hand, if buyers thrust the price above $0.08, the pair may rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) jumped from the 50-day SMA ($1.18) on March 1 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($1.27).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/67b43d26-e914-4330-a736-a2543444990c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum on March 3 and the bears sent the price tumbling below the 50-day SMA. If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the MATIC/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price recovers ground and closes above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, it will signal solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to overcome the barrier at $1.30 and gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-settles-at-22-4k-as-daily-rsi-retraces-2023-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price settles at $22.4K as daily RSI retraces 2023 bull run}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls once again failed to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($22.77) on March 1. That attracted further selling and pulled the price near $19.68.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/94f51b97-85e0-4cf9-aab3-0ebbee7c2356.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped near 43, indicating that bears have a slight edge. The SOL/USDT pair could reach the important support at $19.68, which may attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $19.68 with strength, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA and challenge the resistance line. Conversely, if the $19.68 support cracks, the pair may witness aggressive selling which could sink the price to $15.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back above the 50-day SMA ($6.47) on March 1 but they could not surmount the 20-day EMA ($6.60). This indicates that bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/d1d8e40f-1d43-464c-aa2d-54ee5c9577a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on March 2 and once again broke below the 50-day SMA. That may have caught the aggressive bulls off guard. The selling picked up momentum on March 3 and the bears are trying to sink the DOT/USDT pair to the strong support at $5.50. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key resistance to watch out for on the upside. A break above it will be the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($93) on Feb. 28 and soared above the 20-day EMA ($94) on March 1. However, the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/7cd74baa-ab89-41a6-9474-59aaf4a19dfa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from $98 on March 2 and broke below the moving averages on March 3. This may have triggered stops of several short-term buyers, pulling the LTC/USDT pair down toward the first support near $85. If this level fails to hold, the pair may dive to $81 and thereafter to $75.\par \par \uc2 The important resistance levels to watch on the upside are the moving averages and then $98. Buyers will have to demolish both these barriers if they want to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvODk4YWJmYWYtNDczOS00MDUxLThiOTctNmE3NTI1NjViYWI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230303ej33000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 BTC\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price slides 5% in 60 minutes amid \uc2 Silvergate\uc2  uncertainty\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By    Brayden Lindrea \par \uc2 391 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The price of BTC fell over 5% in an hour on March 3, coinciding with recent uncertainty around \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2  after its delayed 10-K filing.\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell more than 5% from $23,500 to $22,240 in just over 60 minutes on March 3, amid a wave of uncertainty concerning crypto-friendly bank \uc2 Silvergate Capital\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  wiped $22 billion from Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s total market capitalization, which is now at $430.9 billion, according to Cointelegraph Markets Pro.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and other non-Bitcoin cryptocurrencies also suffered a similar sharp decline.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin just dropped $1200 in less than 30 minutes.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Wolf Of All Streets (@scottmelker) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottmelker/status/1631470640765992962?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 3, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Markus Thielen, the head of research at \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform Matrixport, told Cointelegraph that he believes the price fall is linked to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/silvergate-stock-plunges-31-after-delayed-filing-raises-doubts-over-future"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent Silvergate Bank controversy}}}\uc2  with its delayed annual 10-K financial report filing, in addition to an increased effort by United States regulators attempting to restrict ties between banks and crypto firms:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe drop is due to the continuous fallout from \uc2 Silvergate Bank\uc2 , as there is now more uncertainty about fiat on-and-off ramp. In addition, there are now wider industry concerns that U.S. regulators are trying to cut off further banking relationships between crypto firms and \uc2 FDIC\uc2 -insured banks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNevertheless, this is playing into the hands of Hong Kong and China, which are becoming more crypto-friendly.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have seen an increase in stablecoin activity as a sign that crypto firms are using crypto rails to move money around,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 Several technical analysts on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  claimed to have predicted the fall from the $23,000 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a3a7a4c5-7772-46c9-995d-1ac458d74e50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price chart. Source: Cointelegraph Markets Pro.\par \par \uc2 The last time BTC was priced at $22,250 was Feb. 15.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall comes despite a solid start to 2023, with BTC still up 34.8% for the year. It was changing hands at $16,550 on Jan. 1.\par \par \uc2 Ether has also fallen 4.74% from $1,644 to $1,566, causing a $9 billion wipeout from its market cap over the first hour.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/182964d8-6e94-4394-96d5-d303176e415f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether price chart. Source: Cointelegraph Markets Pro.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvNjVhMzZhNGQtN2NjYi00Y2QzLTk1NWEtYjNkMWFlYzZhMWQ3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230303ej3300007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to make runs toward the $25,000 level, while several altcoins begin to flash a range of encouraging signals.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) was marginally positive in February even though the S&P 500 index (SPX) fell by 2.61%. On March 1, Bitcoin started on a positive note while the United States equities markets struggled. This shows that Bitcoin is trying to decouple from the U.S. equities markets.\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that retail traders seem to have made the most of the crypto bear market. Instead of panicking and selling their holdings, traders have purchased at lower levels. Glassnode data shows that wallets holding at least 1 BTC have consistently risen and are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-millionaires-increased-140-as-btc-price-crossed-20k-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearing the 1 million mark}}}\uc2  for the first time ever.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3bb32c2e-3cca-4063-9c15-b302b63addb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Historically, March has been a mediocre month for Bitcoin. Coinglass data shows that Bitcoin has closed the month of March with double-digit gains {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-least-volatile-month-ever-btc-price-ends-february-up-0-03"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only twice in the past 10 years}}}\uc2 , in 2013 and 2021. Therefore, the possibility of continued consolidation in March remains high.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels that may act as major roadblocks to the recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) $22,800 level has been acting as a solid support in the past few days, which is a positive sign. This indicates that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/be653961-7f7e-487d-aec0-92eb856fc34e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have cleared the first hurdle at the 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($23,435), and will next try to push the price toward the crucial resistance at $25,250. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it may attract huge buying. The pair could then skyrocket to $31,000, as there are no major resistances in between.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $25,250, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. A consolidation near the local highs is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it shows that buyers are not rushing to the exit. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $22,800 to dent the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. That may start a correction toward $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts, the bears have failed to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day simple moving average, or SMA ($1,600). This indicates that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/addc1b0e-e846-4080-9b9a-76a97923003c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to strengthen their position by catapulting the price above the overhead resistance zone between $1,680 and $1,743. If they do so, the ETH/USDT pair may start a rally to $2,000. The bears may pose a strong challenge at $1,800, but this level is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the short-term bulls may be tempted to book profits. The pair could then drop to the support near $1,500.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). This indicates indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/932a8b8e-d8de-448d-8b9e-0919ea4ee543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the support line on March 1, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are fiercely guarding the moving averages. If the price breaks below the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair may slump to $280.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers push the price above the moving averages, the pair may reach the resistance line of the triangle. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break above it may start an up-move to $340 and thereafter to the pattern target of $371.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts, the bears could not pull XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to the strong support at $0.36. This suggests that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/dd35dd0c-edc5-46f5-b7ea-cecbb23baa63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to drive the price above the resistance line of the descending channel. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair may rise to the overhead resistance at $0.43. Buyers will have to pierce this resistance to clear the path for a possible rally to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will again try to stall the recovery at the resistance line of the channel. If the price turns down from it, the possibility of a break below $0.36 increases. The pair may then slide to $0.33.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting a bounce off the strong support near $0.34. The recovery could face resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.37), as the bears will try to switch this level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/be4f9355-4cb5-45b2-b735-a1b4779e6685.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to tug the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the $0.34 support. If they do that, the pair may start a deeper correction to $0.32 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, it will suggest aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the neckline of the developing inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the support near $0.08 for the past few days, but they have failed to achieve a strong rebound in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0926dfcc-fc6f-4b6f-894f-3e921d765e9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below the support near $0.08. This negative setup has a target objective at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That may result in short-covering by the aggressive bears. The DOGE/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The sharp correction in Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is finding support at the 50-day SMA ($1.17). The bulls are trying to start a recovery, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are selling the rallies to the 20-day EMA ($1.28).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/e2dca687-cf01-4455-8cea-28200e0b7b4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower, the bears will make one more attempt to yank the MATIC/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could tumble to the vital support at $1.05. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break above $1.30 could embolden the bulls. They will then try to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $1.57. The rally could also face roadblocks at $1.42 and again at $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-resistance-at-1-750-could-reflect-traders-anxiety-over-the-shanghai-upgrade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price resistance at $1,750 could reflect traders\u8217\'20\'19 anxiety over the Shanghai upgrade}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($23.02) on Feb. 27, indicating that bears are trying to turn this level into a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b084fe79-a403-4774-b88c-62aeac89e076.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have not given up and are again trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA. The repeated retest of a resistance within a short period tends to weaken it. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could reach the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break and close above it will signal a potential trend change. If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to sink the pair below the support at $19.68.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($6.43) on Feb. 28, but the bears failed to build upon this advantage. This suggests that buyers are trying to trap the aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a62ec084-da1a-495f-b275-c4d92d432d4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($6.68) is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term. If buyers thrust the price above this level, it will suggest that the short-term corrective phase may be over. The bulls will then try to propel the price toward the neckline of the developing inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the DOT/USDT pair once again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) pullback found strong support at the 50-day SMA ($92). This suggests that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/69676f69-dd65-4f11-a5a1-22ed4d22c9b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($95) on March 1, opening the gates for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $106. This level may act as a solid barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the LTC/USDT pair may rise to $115 and thereafter to $130.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the area between the 50-day SMA and $88. If this zone cracks, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may slide to $81 and then to $75.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMjQxOWQyNjEtM2IzMi00MDQzLWE4ZWEtNWUwYzYxNDZlNDA4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230302ej310000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,720 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 March 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to make runs toward the $25,000 level, meanwhile, several altcoins are beginning to flash a range of encouraging signals.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) was marginally positive in February even though the S&P 500 index (SPX) fell by 2.61%. On the first day of March, Bitcoin has started on a positive note while the United States equities markets are struggling. This shows that Bitcoin is trying to decouple from the U.S. equities markets.\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that retail traders seem to have made the most of the crypto bear market. Instead of panicking and selling their holdings, traders have purchased at lower levels. Glassnode data shows that wallets holding at least one Bitcoin have consistently risen and are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-millionaires-increased-140-as-btc-price-crossed-20k-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearing the 1 million mark}}}\uc2  for the first time ever.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/3bb32c2e-3cca-4063-9c15-b302b63addb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Historically, March has been a mediocre month for Bitcoin. Coinglass data shows that Bitcoin closed the month of March with double digit gains {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-least-volatile-month-ever-btc-price-ends-february-up-0-03"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only twice in the past ten years}}}\uc2 , in 2013 and in 2021. Therefore, the possibility of continued consolidation in March remains high.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels that may act as major roadblocks for the recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s $22,800 level has been acting as a solid support in the past few days, which is a positive sign. This indicates that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/be653961-7f7e-487d-aec0-92eb856fc34e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have cleared the first hurdle at the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,435) and will next try to push the price toward the crucial resistance at $25,250. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it may attract huge buying. The pair could then skyrocket to $31,000 as there are no major resistances in between.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $25,250, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few days. A consolidation near the local highs is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it shows that buyers are not rushing to the exit. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $22,800 to dent the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. That may start a correction toward $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts, the bears have failed to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($1,600). This indicates that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/addc1b0e-e846-4080-9b9a-76a97923003c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to strengthen their position by catapulting the price above the overhead resistance zone between $1,680 and $1,743. If they did that, the ETH/USDT pair may start a rally to $2,000. The bears may pose a strong challenge at $1,800 but this level is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the short-term bulls may be tempted to book profits. The pair could then drop to the support near $1,500.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). This indicates indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/932a8b8e-d8de-448d-8b9e-0919ea4ee543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the support line on March 1 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are fiercely guarding the moving averages. If the price breaks below the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair may slump to $280.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers push the price above the moving averages, the pair may reach the resistance line of the triangle. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break above it may start an up-move to $340 and thereafter to the pattern target of $371.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts, the bears could not pull XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to the strong support at $0.36. This suggests that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/dd35dd0c-edc5-46f5-b7ea-cecbb23baa63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to drive the price above the resistance line of the descending channel. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair may rise to the overhead resistance at $0.43. Buyers will have to pierce this resistance to clear the path for a possible rally to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will again try to stall the recovery at the resistance line of the channel. If the price turns down from it, the possibility of a break below $0.36 increases. The pair may then slide to $0.33.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting a bounce off the strong support near $0.34. The recovery could face resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.37) as the bears will try to switch this level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/be4f9355-4cb5-45b2-b735-a1b4779e6685.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to tug the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the $0.34 support. If they do that, the pair may start a deeper correction to $0.32 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, it will suggest aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the neckline of the developing inverse head and shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the support near $0.08 for the past few days but they have failed to achieve a strong rebound in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/0926dfcc-fc6f-4b6f-894f-3e921d765e9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below the support near $0.08. This negative setup has a target objective at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That may result in short covering by the aggressive bears. The DOGE/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The sharp correction in Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is finding support at the 50-day SMA ($1.17). The bulls are trying to start a recovery but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are selling the rallies to the 20-day EMA ($1.28).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/e2dca687-cf01-4455-8cea-28200e0b7b4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower, the bears will make one more attempt to yank the MATIC/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could tumble to the vital support at $1.05. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break above $1.30 could embolden the bulls. They will then try to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $1.57. The rally could also face roadblocks at $1.42 and again at $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-resistance-at-1-750-could-reflect-traders-anxiety-over-the-shanghai-upgrade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price resistance at $1,750 could reflect traders\u8217\'20\'19 anxiety over the Shanghai upgrade}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($23.02) on Feb. 27, indicating that bears are trying to turn this level into a resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/b084fe79-a403-4774-b88c-62aeac89e076.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have not given up and are again trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA. The repeated retest of a resistance within a short period tends to weaken it. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could reach the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break and close above it will signal a potential trend change. If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to sink the pair below the support at $19.68.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($6.43) on Feb. 28 but the bears failed to build upon this advantage. This suggests that buyers are trying to trap the aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/a62ec084-da1a-495f-b275-c4d92d432d4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($6.68) is the important level to keep an eye on in the near term. If buyers thrust the price above this level, it will suggest that the short-term corrective phase may be over. The bulls will then try to propel the price toward the neckline of the developing inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the DOT/USDT pair once again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) pullback found strong support at the 50-day SMA ($92). This suggests that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/69676f69-dd65-4f11-a5a1-22ed4d22c9b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($95) on March 1, opening the gates for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $106. This level may act as a solid barrier but if bulls overcome it, the LTC/USDT pair may rise to $115 and thereafter to $130.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the area between the 50-day SMA and $88. If this zone cracks, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may slide to $81 and then to $75.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvMjQxOWQyNjEtM2IzMi00MDQzLWE4ZWEtNWUwYzYxNDZlNDA4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230301ej31000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 The top five performing cryptocurrencies in February were driven by market narratives related to artificial intelligence\par \b \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s why STX, CFX, SSV, AGIX and \uc2 GRT\uc2  are the top performing assets in February\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nivesh Rustgi \par \uc2 1,332 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s muted monthly performance, STX, SSV, CFX, AGIX and \uc2 GRT\uc2  surged higher, likely because of popular market narratives.\par \par \uc2 The month of February was filled with investors\u8217\'20\'19 hope that an earlier-than-expected \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  policy pivot would occur, but this sentiment faded as the inflation and employment data came in hotter than expected. While the start of the month was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the crypto market, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) retraced 60% of the move from February\u8217\'20\'19s low at around $21,500 to the peak of $25,250.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, some narrative-driven rallies still caused significant price growth in some altcoins. The leading narratives were Bitcoin NFTs, liquidity staking derivatives (LSDs) on Ethereum and Artificial Intelligence (AI) projects.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s review the top performing coins of the month.\par \par \uc2 Stacks (STX)\par \par \uc2 Stacks gained much attention as the hype over Ordinals kicked off at the start of the month. Gamma, a Stacks-based project, enabled the creation of Bitcoin Ordinals. However, full functionality in trading and public minting of Ordinals on Stacks is still in development.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Stacks faces competition from other blockchains like Ethereum, where developers are working toward enabling Bitcoin NFT trading on Ethereum. Yuga Labs, the leading NFT firm, announced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-yuga-labs-jumps-on-ordinals-hype-dookey-dash-key-sells-for-1-000-eth-and-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 300-piece generative collection}}}\uc2  on Bitcoin on Feb. 27. The auction (or minting) will likely be held on Ethereum due to the lack of infrastructure on Bitcoin. Thus, as Stacks delays its development of making Ordinals accessible, more liquid chains are taking advantage of other solutions.\par \par \uc2 The fundamentals of the Stacks blockchain do not corroborate with the price surge, which suggests that it could be purely speculative given the potential for Stack's growth. In the short term, STX risks a pullback from the top of its trading range in both STX/USD and STX/BTC pairs. Nevertheless, if buyers can conquer resistance at $1.02, there's a probability of STX taking a shot at all-time highs of $3.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/1e84dc92-bced-4034-93aa-a886a52aa3ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 STX/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Conflux (CFX)\par \par \uc2 Conflux Network received a significant boost on Feb. 15 as the blockchain team {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/china-s-only-public-blockchain-conflux-sees-cfx-price-skyrocket-1300-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced a partnership}}}\uc2  with the second largest Telecom service in China, \uc2 China Telecom\uc2 . The telecom giant will provide blockchain-enabled mobile SIM cards to over 200 million users. The SIM card will store a public and private key, storing transferable user data in encrypted form.\par \par \uc2 Over the years, Conflux has earned the reputation of a Chinese enterprise blockchain with partners in Oreo China, McDonald's China and Chinese \uc2 Instagram\uc2  equivalent Little Red Book. The blockchain also hosts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/shanghai-man-rmb-stablecoin-in-shanghai-evergrande-fud-and-ftx-gains-ground/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an RMB-pegged stablecoin}}}\uc2  in approval with the Chinese government, which is highly encouraging given the strict influence of the authorities over state policies.\par \par \uc2 The Conflux Network deploys both proof-of-work and proof-of-stake mechanisms to increase scalability and decentralization. The network processes between 3,000 to 6,000 transactions per second, which is considerably faster than Ethereum's speed of 15 tps.\par \par \uc2 While Conflux has established partnerships with leading Chinese brands, the activity on the blockchain has yet to justify the 500% increase in CFX's price in February. Data shows that the number of new Conflux addresses and NFTs minted on the platform has stayed at par with previous months with no evident spike.\par \par \uc2 This raises concerns about the sustainability of the hype building around the blockchain. Extensive partnerships in the blockchain space have often failed due to a lack of real-world integrations.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a4725607-1726-4cb6-9a0a-f45efa2d5fe9.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Number of NFTs minted on Conflux every month. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.confluxscan.io/nft-charts/assets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conflux Scan}}}\par \par \uc2 The CFX/USD pair\u8217\'20\'19s vertical rally met with resistance at the October 2021 high of $0.34. The psychological levels of $0.20 and $0.10 will act as support in case of a pullback.\par \par \uc2 SSV Network (SSV)\par \par \uc2 SSV Network benefited from the craze around the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-shanghai-upgrade-could-supercharge-liquid-staking-derivatives-here-s-how"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum Shanghai upgrade}}}\uc2 , which has fueled the rise of LSD tokens. SSV Network is an infrastructure provider that will likely provide backend support for LSD platforms to help decentralize the Ethereum network.\par \par \uc2 The project is working on the idea of Distributed Validator Technology (DVT), first proposed by Ethereum founder, \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2 , in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vitalik-buterin-outlines-endgame-roadmap-for-eth-2-0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum 2.0 design}}}\uc2 . It enhances the security and decentralization of the Ethereum PoS network by allowing smaller stakers and validators to use the SSV Network and run Ethereum validating nodes.\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 19, the team announced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ssv-launches-50m-ecosystem-fund-to-support-eth-staking-tech"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $50 million ecosystem fund}}}\uc2  to support the development of the technology. The fund is backed by leading crypto venture capitalists including \uc2 Digital Currency Group\uc2 , Coinbase Ventures, HashKey, NGC, Everstake, GSR and SevenX.\par \par \uc2 The project gained a lot of attention as the official sponsor of the ETH Denver Hackathon 2023, where the project gave grants to teams developing on DVT technology. SSV Network shows significant potential for adoption by LSD protocols as the amount of staked Ether increases after the Shanghai upgrade.\par \par \uc2 Still, a significant portion of the 160% gains in February could be due to a rotation from the crowded LSD tokens toward other protocols that stand to benefit after the Shanghai upgrade.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/be44bed7-d809-4466-b71d-e3c05cb705ff.PNG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Technically, SSV token is in a price discovery mode, making new all-time highs. Thus, it\u8217\'20\'19s likely that the token continues to surge higher, especially if leading LSD platforms like Lido or Rocket Pool announce SSV Network integration.\par \par \uc2 However, the token tagged the $50 psychological level on Feb. 27, which could see some profit booking from investors. On the downside, the token will likely find support near 2022 highs of $21.\par \par \uc2 SingularityNET (AGIX)\par \par \uc2 SingularityNET benefited from the continued hype in AI-related projects. The protocol\u8217\'20\'19s marketplace invites users to purchase AI services in its native cryptocurrency, AGIX. The token\u8217\'20\'19s price has jumped nearly 12 since the start of 2023, from $0.045 to a peak of $0.58.\par \par \uc2 The latest surge in SingularityNET can be attributed to its partnership with Cardano. The protocol currently resides on Ethereum for hosting rudimentary AI bots for image processing, language translations and statistical analysis. The migration to Cardano provided a huge boost to the protocol as it started offering \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staking service and facilitating a decentralized bridge between Ethereum and Cardano.\par \par \uc2 AGIX token reversed from its all-time high levels at $0.63, which could continue to provide resistance for bulls. As the AI hype subsides, a correction toward $0.33 and $0.15 support cannot be ruled out. Nevertheless, if buyers are successful in pushing the price above the $0.63 resistance level, AGIX can run significantly higher.\par \par \uc2 Graph Protocol (GRT)\par \par \uc2 Similar to SingularityNET, The Graph protocol has also benefited from an increase in the AI narrative. The indexing protocol on Ethereum and IFPS is slowly transitioning to an independent layer-1 network. It works through coordination between subgraph developers, who create and store an easily accessible database of blockchains, and decentralized application developers, who use this database to create products.\par \par \uc2 According to a recent report by Messari, The Graph\u8217\'20\'19s revenue increased 66% in Q4 2022 compared to the previous quarter. The number of subgraphs on the network has increased consistently, with a 12% quarter-on-quarter increase in revenue for network participants.\par \par \uc2 GRT\uc2  token has significant upside potential if the growth of the network sustains. Technically, the July 2022 breakdown levels at $0.33 and 2022 highs of $0.51 will be the likely targets for bulls, with support at the psychological level of $0.1 and the 2023 yearly opening price of $0.056.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvMDdhMDk0YmUtYjAwOC00MmE4LTkyMjktMjg5OTI3YTI5ZTkyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230228ej2s000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,813 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are struggling to sustain the recovery in BTC and altcoins, but technical analysis points to some encouraging signals.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the United States equities markets are trying to start the week on a positive note, but some analysts are skeptical about the short-term prospects of the markets. According to Bloomberg Intelligence senior macro strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-only-need-4-weeks-to-hit-30k-as-key-monthly-close-looms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin will face significant resistance at $25,000}}}\uc2 . McGlone believes that it \u8220\'20\'1Cmay be a while before buy-and-hold types gain the upper hand.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It also looks like Bitcoin whales, unique entities owning 1,000 BTC or more, are also not convinced of the recovery in the crypto markets. According to Glassnode, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-whale-population-shrinks-to-early-2020-levels-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale numbers have fallen to 1,663}}}\uc2 , which is well below the peak of 2,161 in February 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/e06a4557-10f8-4e77-ae3d-6408ddbe6d23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to catch the bottom in any market. Hence, traders should try to build a portfolio when they believe that the downtrend has ended and a basing pattern has begun.\par \par \uc2 Instead of buying the entire quantity at one go, they could gradually build a portfolio and aim to finish the purchases before the asset picks up momentum and shoots higher.\par \par \uc2 Could the strength in the equities markets pull Bitcoin and altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 (SPX) index plunged below the 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA (4,046), on Feb. 17, which intensified selling and pulled the price to the uptrend line. Although the bears pulled the price below the uptrend line on Feb. 24, the lower levels attracted buying as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. That helped the index close near the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/e5410ec0-2e9c-421a-a116-56d7b51df46c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls may face an uphill task, as the bears are likely to sell on any relief rallies near the 20-day EMA, as seen from the long wick on the Feb. 27 candlestick. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment is negative and traders are selling on minor rallies. A close below the uptrend line may open the doors for a possible drop to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to salvage the situation, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will indicate that the break below the uptrend line may have been a bear trap. The index could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of 4,200.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the retest of the breakout level from the wedge pattern on Feb. 20, which started a stronger relief rally in the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ca398686-ee8b-4215-940f-fefb1d5bbe53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index has reached the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 105.52. This level may see an attempt by the bears to stall the recovery. If sellers want to maintain their hold, they will have to sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls want to strengthen their position, they will have to push the price above 105.52. If they manage to do that, the index could extend its recovery to the 50% retracement level of 106.98 and then to the 61.8% retracement level of 108.43.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $22,800 support on Feb. 25 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($23,417) on Feb. 26. This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/3fa169ff-1f63-490b-8dd9-fa5c7c821ef3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears may not give up easily. They will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and challenge the 50-day simple moving average, or SMA ($22,433). If this level gives way, the BTC/USDT pair may plummet to the next major support at $21,480.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again bounces off $22,800, it will signal that buyers are fiercely defending this level. That may indicate a range-bound action between $22,800 and $25,250 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($1,587) on Feb. 25, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending this level. The 20-day EMA ($1,626) has flattened out, and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/6031c739-b731-40fa-9a6a-5c0821bc0afe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if they thrust and close the price above $1,680. The ETH/USDT pair will then attempt to rise above the $1,800 resistance and start its journey toward the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance, it will indicate that bears are not willing to give up. That may increase the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA. The pair could then drop to $1,460 and later to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 50-day SMA ($307) on Feb. 24, but the bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($309) on Feb. 26. This level is attracting selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c1841566-d3f0-40bf-8444-1cd91388fec0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $295, it will indicate that sellers have flipped the 20-day EMA into resistance. The BNB/USDT pair could then tumble toward the critical support at $280. This is an important level to watch out for because a bounce off it may point to a range formation between $280 and $318 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move in the short term could begin if buyers drive the price above $318 or bears sink the price below $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price has been swinging inside a large range between $0.30 and $0.43 for the past several weeks. The price broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.39) on Feb. 23 and has been gradually falling toward the solid support at $0.36.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/80aad38d-48a0-4b67-946a-06a6b9f3f0fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.38) has started to turn down, and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have a slight edge in the near term. If the price breaks below $0.36, the XRP/USDT pair may slide to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the channel. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.42 where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.35 on Feb. 25, but the recovery is facing selling at the 50-day SMA ($0.37). This indicates that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/b8c88921-3d11-4c3c-a392-f905fd569f1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, with the 20-day EMA ($0.38) dropping below the 50-day SMA. Such a move will suggest that the bears have the edge in the near term. A break and close below the strong support zone between $0.34 and $0.32 could start a decline to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downtrend, they will have to propel the price back above the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then climb to the $0.42\u8211\'20\'13$0.44 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-eyes-24k-retest-as-us-dollar-dives-into-monthly-close"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price eyes $24K retest as US dollar dives into monthly close}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($1.30) on Feb. 24, and the bears successfully held its retest on Feb. 26. This indicates that the 20-day EMA is acting as the new roof.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/105f916b-5b69-4c5d-bdc4-c003f1ac7048.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will next attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1.16). If they succeed in this endeavor, the selling could intensify, and the MATIC/USDT pair may tumble to the next strong support at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to regain the upper hand, they will have to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA. That will indicate solid buying on dips. The pair may first climb to $1.42 and thereafter rally to the $1.50 to $1.57 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support near $0.08 on Feb. 25, but the recovery is facing selling pressure from the bears on Feb. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/f1af0106-ccb3-438b-8b69-bafcd2b6792c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below the $0.08 support will complete a head-and-shoulders pattern in the near term. The DOGE/USDT pair could then plummet to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $0.08, it will indicate that lower levels are being viewed as a buying opportunity. The relief rally may face selling near the downtrend line, but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 50-day SMA ($22.75). This indicates that bulls are attempting to protect the level, while the bears are trying to break it and come out on top.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/bd2a7818-8c6d-45eb-a006-68168fd7a339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $21.41, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the important support at $19.68. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a close below it may increase the selling pressure and sink the pair to $15.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA ($23.23), the bulls will push the pair to the resistance line. The bears are likely to defend this level with all their might, but if buyers overcome this obstacle, an up-move to $39 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvMjRmMDNlNzgtMWVlNS00YWQyLTgwZjQtNDE3ZjIzMTNiYmRjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230227ej2r000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,804 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are struggling to sustain the recovery in BTC and altcoins, but technical analysis points to some encouraging signals.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the United States equities markets are trying to start the week on a positive note but some analysts are skeptical about the short-term prospects of the markets. According to Bloomberg Intelligence senior macro strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-only-need-4-weeks-to-hit-30k-as-key-monthly-close-looms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin will face significant resistance at $25,000}}}\uc2 . McGlone believes that it \u8220\'20\'1Cmay be a while before buy-and-hold types gain the upper hand.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It also looks like Bitcoin whales, unique entities owning 1,000 Bitcoin or more, are also not convinced of the recovery in the crypto markets. According to Glassnode, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-whale-population-shrinks-to-early-2020-levels-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale numbers have fallen to 1,663}}}\uc2 , which is well below the peak of 2,161 hit in February 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/e06a4557-10f8-4e77-ae3d-6408ddbe6d23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to catch the bottom in any market. Hence, traders should try to build a portfolio when they believe that the downtrend has ended and a basing pattern has begun.\par \par \uc2 Instead of buying the entire quantity at one go, they could gradually build a portfolio and aim to finish the purchases before the asset picks up momentum and shoots higher.\par \par \uc2 Could the strength in the equities markets pull Bitcoin and altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) plunged below the 20-day exponential moving average (4,046) on Feb. 17, which intensified selling and pulled the price to the uptrend line. Although the bears pulled the price below the uptrend line on Feb. 24, the lower levels attracted buying as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. That helped the index close near the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/e5410ec0-2e9c-421a-a116-56d7b51df46c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls may face an uphill task as the bears are likely to sell on any relief rallies near the 20-day EMA, as seen from the long wick on the Feb. 27 candlestick. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment is negative and traders are selling on minor rallies. A close below the uptrend line may open the doors for a possible drop to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to salvage the situation, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will indicate that the break below the uptrend line may have been a bear trap. The index could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of 4,200.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the retest of the breakout level from the wedge pattern on Feb. 20, which started a stronger relief rally in the U.S. dollar index (DXY).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ca398686-ee8b-4215-940f-fefb1d5bbe53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index has reached the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 105.52. This level may see an attempt by the bears to stall the recovery. If sellers want to maintain their hold, they will have to sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls want to strengthen their position, they will have to push the price above 105.52. If they manage to do that, the index could extend its recovery to the 50% retracement level of 106.98 and then to the 61.8% retracement level of 108.43.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the $22,800 support on Feb. 25 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($23,417) on Feb. 26. This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/3fa169ff-1f63-490b-8dd9-fa5c7c821ef3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears may not give up easily. They will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and challenge the 50-day simple moving average ($22,433). If this level gives way, the BTC/USDT pair may plummet to the next major support at $21,480.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again bounces off $22,800, it will signal that buyers are fiercely defending this level. That may indicate a range-bound action between $22,800 and $25,250 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($1,587) on Feb. 25, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending this level. The 20-day EMA ($1,626) has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/6031c739-b731-40fa-9a6a-5c0821bc0afe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if they thrust and close the price above $1,680. The ETH/USDT pair will then attempt to rise above the $1,800 resistance and start its journey toward the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance, it will indicate that bears are not willing to give up. That may increase the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA. The pair could then drop to $1,460 and later to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 50-day SMA ($307) on Feb. 24 but the bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($309) on Feb. 26. This level is attracting selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c1841566-d3f0-40bf-8444-1cd91388fec0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $295, it will indicate that sellers have flipped the 20-day EMA into resistance. The BNB/USDT pair could then tumble toward the critical support at $280. This is an important level to watch out for because a bounce off it may point to a range formation between $280 and $318 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move in the short term could begin if buyers drive the price above $318 or bears sink the price below $280.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price has been swinging inside a large range between $0.30 and $0.43 for the past several weeks. The price broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.39) on Feb. 23 and has been gradually falling toward the solid support at $0.36.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/80aad38d-48a0-4b67-946a-06a6b9f3f0fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.38) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have a slight edge in the near term. If the price breaks below $0.36, the XRP/USDT pair may slide to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the channel. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.42 where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.35 on Feb. 25 but the recovery is facing selling at the 50-day SMA ($0.37). This indicates that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/b8c88921-3d11-4c3c-a392-f905fd569f1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, with the 20-day EMA ($0.38) dropping below the 50-day SMA. Such a move will suggest that the bears have the edge in the near term. A break and close below the strong support zone between $0.34 and $0.32 could start a decline to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downtrend, they will have to propel the price back above the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then climb to the $0.42 to $0.44 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-eyes-24k-retest-as-us-dollar-dives-into-monthly-close"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price eyes $24K retest as US dollar dives into monthly close}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($1.30) on Feb. 24 and the bears successfully held its retest on Feb. 26. This indicates that the 20-day EMA is acting as the new roof.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/105f916b-5b69-4c5d-bdc4-c003f1ac7048.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will next attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($1.16). If they succeed in this endeavor, the selling could intensify and the MATIC/USDT pair may tumble to the next strong support at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to regain the upper hand, they will have to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA. That will indicate solid buying on dips. The pair may first climb to $1.42 and thereafter rally to the $1.50 to $1.57 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support near $0.08 on Feb. 25 but the recovery is facing selling pressure from the bears on Feb. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/f1af0106-ccb3-438b-8b69-bafcd2b6792c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below the $0.08 support will complete a head and shoulders pattern in the near term. The DOGE/USDT pair could then plummet to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $0.08, it will indicate that lower levels are being viewed as a buying opportunity. The relief rally may face selling near the downtrend line but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 50-day SMA ($22.75). This indicates that bulls are attempting to protect the level while the bears are trying to break it and come out on top.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/bd2a7818-8c6d-45eb-a006-68168fd7a339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $21.41, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the important support at $19.68. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a close below it may increase the selling pressure and sink the pair to $15.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA ($23.23), the bulls will push the pair to the resistance line. The bears are likely to defend this level with all their might but if buyers overcome this obstacle, an up-move to $39 is possible.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvMjRmMDNlNzgtMWVlNS00YWQyLTgwZjQtNDE3ZjIzMTNiYmRjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230227ej2r000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,717 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bears pressed the sell button on Bitcoin and select altcoins after U.S. inflation data came in hotter than expected.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is struggling to stay above $23,000 as the weekend approaches. The selling pressure increased after the personal consumption expenditures excluding food and energy rose 0.6% in January and 4.7% over the year, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-stays-24k-as-pce-data-helps-us-dollar-near-7-week-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 above market expectations}}}\uc2  of an increase of 0.5% and 4.4% respectively.\par \par \uc2 This could trigger fears that the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  may have to continue its rate hikes to bring inflation under control. Expectations of a rate hike could strengthen the U.S. Dollar Index further, which is already near a seven-week high, and that may put pressure on the cryptocurrency markets in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/45bc59bf-8a1c-4d96-9d13-5755fe8fe672.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A drop in the cryptocurrency markets may start a discussion that the rally in January may have been a bull trap. However, the price action in Bitcoin and several altcoins shows that a bottoming formation may have begun. The next dip may form a higher low before attempting a move higher.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) buyers successfully held the 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($23,440), for the past two days, but the failure to sustain the rebound attracted strong selling on Feb. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/fdc97845-3f51-427a-9e4f-19a7ba0c2a6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. The BTC/USDT pair has reached immediate support at $22,800.\par \par \uc2 A break below this level could retest the crucial support zone between the 50-day simple moving average ($22,052) and $21,480.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to sustain below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls are buying the dips, as they anticipate a move higher. A break and close above $25,250 may start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($1,624) on Feb. 22, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls tried to build upon the advantage on Feb. 23 and drive the price above $1,680, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/71e91b49-896a-47a1-b754-5cb3413a02ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling intensified on Feb. 24, and the price dropped to the 50-day SMA ($1,565). This is an important support for the bulls to guard because if it cracks, the ETH/USDT pair could plummet to $1,461.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA with strength, it will indicate that bulls are buying the dips. The buyers will then attempt to kick the price above the $1,680\u8211\'20\'13$1,743 resistance zone and resume the up-move.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the overhead resistance of $318 and the 50-day SMA ($304) resolved to the downside on Feb. 24. This indicates that bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ce50f554-3da2-4972-9f9f-3c0a53a0d8ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the 20-day EMA ($310) is flat, the RSI has dipped below 46, suggesting that the momentum is shifting in favor of the bears. The BNB/USDT pair could slump to the $280 level. This is an important level to watch out for because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to avoid the sharp decline, they will have to quickly propel the price back above $318. That could clear the path for a rise to the neckline of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) traded near the resistance line of the descending channel pattern for the past few days, but the bulls could not enforce a breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/19124318-962c-4e24-97d7-a5823a78a3d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have attracted selling from the short-term bears who yanked the price below the moving averages. The XRP/USDT pair could now drop to the solid support at $0.36. If this level also fails to hold up, the decline may extend to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.36, the bulls will make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at the resistance line. If they can pull it off, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $0.43.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the immediate support of $0.38 for the past two days, but they failed to sustain the rebound above the 20-day EMA ($0.39). This suggests that bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a1db5e24-65c3-4386-b371-15a2d42f1961.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price dropped to the 50-day SMA ($0.37) on Feb. 24. If this support gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the strong support zone between $0.34 and $0.32. Buyers are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the selling may intensify and a drop toward $0.27 could not be ruled out.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and retest the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 After staying above the 50-day SMA ($0.08) for several days, Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the level on Feb. 23. This indicates a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/bcbf19c6-8a8b-4eca-a630-81b12fe4a198.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the strong support near $0.08. Buyers are li