ort-term-rally-to-25k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to fall, but derivatives data hints at a short-term rally to $25K}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) failed to rebound off the 20-day EMA ($23.32) in the past two days, indicating a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. That may have encouraged the bears who pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($22.19).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c48b6a28-0511-4f3f-b450-7fb7f5132af2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint indicate that the buying pressure is reducing. If the 50-day SMA gives way, the SOL/USDT pair may tumble to the next support at $18.73. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it may start a deeper correction to $15.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up from the moving averages and surges above $28. The pair may then quickly run up to $39.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) jumped from the 20-day EMA ($6.79) on Feb. 22 and rose above the $7.25 resistance on Feb. 23 but the bulls could not sustain the rebound. This indicates that the bears are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a1410ec7-fdc7-437c-b56b-5ea90ed758e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on Feb. 24 and the bears have pulled the price below the 20-day EMA. The immediate support is at the 50-day SMA ($6.25) but if it cracks, the selling could accelerate and the DOT/USDT pair may dive to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, they will have to successfully defend the moving averages and push the price above $7.39. That will indicate strong demand at lower levels. The pair may then rise to $8 and thereafter to $9.50.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) Feb. 23 candlestick shows that bears are selling on rallies close to the overhead resistance at $0.000014.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/2873ef50-b4b2-4ec4-863c-2f93ad20364d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The advantage could tilt in favor of the bears if the price breaks and sustains below the triangle. That may start a slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.000012) and eventually to $0.000011.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above $0.000014, it will suggest that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The SHIB/USDT pair could then climb to $0.000016.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvNjhjMWYwOGItNDJhMS00MDc0LTllYzYtMTMxZmM3ZTZjMTIyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230224ej2o000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,772 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto and stock markets sold-off today, possibly in anticipation of today's Fed minutes.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets saw their worst performance of 2023 as concerned investors dumped stocks on Feb. 21, fearing continued rate hikes by the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although the cryptocurrency markets also gave back some of the gains, the fall was comparatively muted. UTXO Management senior analyst Dylan LeClair said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) correlation to the S&P 500 index has fallen to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-bitcoin-price-hold-24k-as-stocks-correlation-hits-lowest-since-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the lowest since late 2021}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After the sharp recovery from the lows, Glassnode data showed that only 21% of the coins sent by Long-Term Holders to exchanges at the start of this week {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-active-addresses-concern-analyst-despite-50-btc-price-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moved at a loss}}}\uc2 . That is a huge improvement from mid-January when 56% of LTH coins sent to exchanges were moved at a loss.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/820cceb0-4aa6-412d-b233-4336a6b9d096.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The decoupling of the crypto and the U.S. equities markets is a positive sign but traders must remain cautious. If stocks turn sharply lower and a risk-off sentiment develops, then the crypto rally may find it difficult to continue its gains.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels that could arrest the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faced yet another rejection at $25,211 on Feb. 21, which may have tempted the short-term bulls to give up and book profits. That could pull the price to the first major support at the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,364).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/d467edfc-c792-4720-931c-9e9c93f5e573.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In an uptrend, buyers try to protect the 20-day EMA and then the 50-day simple moving average ($21,772). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. That may enhance the prospects of a rally above $25,250.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are rushing to the exit. That could result in a fall to the 50-day SMA. The BTC/USDT pair may again attempt a rebound off it but on the way up, the 20-day EMA may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 The short-term trend could tilt in favor of the bears if the price closes below the crucial support at $21,480.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) stayed above the $1,680 level since Feb. 17, the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at $1,743. That may have attracted selling from short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/13810b36-2554-4e63-a196-be3763046675.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Feb. 21 and dipped back below the breakout level of $1,680. Sellers will now try to build upon this advantage and yank the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,550).\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could plunge to the immediate support at $1,461. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor because if this support gives way, the pair may slide to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will stand a chance if they quickly push the price back above $1,680. Such a move will indicate aggressive buying on minor dips. A break above $1,743 could start the next leg of the up-move to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Even after repeated attempts, the bulls could not propel BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $318 in the past few days. This indicates that the bears are fiercely defending the $318 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/45cf354c-3e9d-471a-86e8-418e824305e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to increase their advantage by sinking the price below the 50-day SMA ($306). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could dump toward the next major support at $280. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may oscillate between $318 and $280 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also indicate a range-bound action in the near term. The bulls will have to thrust the price above $318 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern. The bears thwarted efforts by the bulls to push the price above the resistance line on Feb. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c0e2dfda-d0e5-4565-99e7-41a4897f543f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.39) has flattened out and the RSI is near the center, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If the price breaks below the moving averages, the bears will try to tug the price to the crucial support at $0.36.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the channel, it will suggest advantage to the bulls. The XRP/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $0.43 where the bears are likely to mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern and the immediate support at $0.38.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/f11e539a-01a7-4e5f-ae78-873494334bc0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.39) has flattened out and the RSI is near 50, indicating a status of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears. If the price turns up from the current level or the 50-day SMA ($0.36), the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may rally to $0.52 and then to $0.60. Conversely, a break below the 50-day SMA could pull the price to the strong support zone between $0.32 and $0.34.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The price action in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been sluggish for the past few days. This shows that both the bulls and the bears are cautious and are not waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c3781631-fcd8-4482-af1b-3d8e1d36038f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint do not indicate an advantage to either party. This suggests that the DOGE/USDT pair may oscillate between $0.10 and $0.08 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above $0.10 could put the $0.11 resistance at risk of breaking down. If that occurs, the pair may pick up momentum and soar toward $0.15. Conversely, a break below $0.08 could clear the path for a retest of the solid support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Feb. 20 candlestick shows that bulls purchased the dip in the hopes that Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) will resume its uptrend but that did not happen. The bears sold the recovery above $1.50 on Feb. 21, which started a pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/1616df79-90ac-41e5-bba9-35a3246fd319.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to guard the $1.30 level if they want to keep the uptrend intact. If the price rebounds off the current level, the MATIC/USDT pair may again attempt to rise toward the overhead resistance at $1.57. The buyers will have to overcome this obstacle to start the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders may be booking profits. That could open the gates for a decline toward the 50-day SMA ($1.11).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-trade-bull-and-bear-flag-patterns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to trade bull and bear flag patterns?}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the resistance line on Feb. 20 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that bears continue to defend the resistance line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c8778679-5339-4d91-9e07-166d3b8eabf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, the bears will try to solidify their position by dragging the SOL/USDT pair below the important support at $19.68. If they can pull it off, the pair may tumble to $15.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the moving averages, the bulls will take another shot at clearing the resistance line. If the price closes above $28, the bears may give up and the pair could then accelerate toward $39.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) closed above the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern on Feb. 19 but the bulls could not build upon this momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c1681489-283d-4ed9-a678-25545b2459fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sold the breakout and pulled the price back below the neckline on Feb. 22. If the price fails to quickly rise back above the neckline, the bulls may bail out of their positions. That could start a deeper correction toward the $5.50 to $5.87 zone.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and rises above the neckline, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum after buyers overcome the barrier at $8. The pair may then soar to $9.50.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $0.000007 and $0.000018 for the past several months. The bulls tried to push the price to the resistance of the range but the bears had other plans. They stopped the rally near $0.000016.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/f64d52e4-2de4-4040-963c-cd77b6f9981c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls repeatedly purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.000013) but they could not kick the price above $0.000014. This indicates that traders lightened their positions on rallies. The price has once again slipped below the 20-day EMA and the bears will try to sink the SHIB/USDT pair to $0.000011.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. If buyers want to take control, they will have to quickly push the price above $0.000014. If they do that, the pair may rally to $0.000016 and then to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvOWJlN2M4ZjMtOTE2Mi00YmU2LTg2NTQtN2E2MzRiY2E3YzVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230222ej2m000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/20: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOGE, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins could continue to the upside even as equities markets hint at a pullback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose more than 11% last week and is trading near the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-regains-25k-amid-hope-record-china-easing-will-boost-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pivotal resistance at $25,000}}}\uc2 . Monitoring resource Material Indicators highlighted in its latest update that large-volume traders were \u8220\'20\'1Cthinning\u8221\'20\'1D overhead resistance, which could spark a rally. As prices rise, retail traders may get sucked in, and whales could use this opportunity to sell their positions that were accumulated at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Every uptrend witnesses several pullbacks, and Bitcoin is no exception. However, the price action of the past several months shows a large basing pattern, which may be about to break out to the upside. If that happens, Bitcoin will signal a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ba197384-f5db-476f-a657-a13d66280cdc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 There are very few occasions when all indicators turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If traders keep waiting for that to happen, they may miss a large portion of the rally. Therefore, it is better to watch the price action closely and trade according to one\u8217\'20\'19s money management principles. Usually, successful strategies are simple and easy to follow.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins continue to outperform the United States equities markets in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 (SPX) index bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at 4,080 on Feb. 10, but the bulls could not push the price to the overhead resistance at 4,200. This emboldened the bears, who pulled the price below the 20-day EMA on Feb. 17. A minor positive for the bulls is that lower levels attracted strong buying, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c0fa1892-ac68-4e10-9812-d06f1edcf840.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting a few days of consolidation. The index could swing between the uptrend line and 4,200 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Trading inside a range is generally volatile and random. If bulls thrust the price above 4,200, the index could resume its up-move. There is resistance at 4,300, but if bulls do not allow the price to dip back below 4,200 during the next correction, the index may rally to 4,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below the uptrend line, the index may tumble to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) broke and closed above the wedge pattern on Feb. 16. The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the RSI is near 57, indicating that bulls are trying to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/af19aa1f-7254-4dec-8113-8f1298f8cfd6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to pull the price back below the moving averages and trap the aggressive bulls. If they do that, the index could first slip to 102.58 and thereafter to 101.29.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls do not allow the price to break below the moving averages, it will suggest that dips are being purchased. The index may then start a relief rally to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 105.52 and thereafter to the 50% retracement level of 106.98.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the strong overhead resistance at $25,211 for the past four days. Although the bears have defended the level successfully, the bulls have not given up. They again jumped on the opportunity on Feb. 20 and purchased at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a1727092-6922-4c62-a432-140f005f03a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a consolidation near a strong overhead resistance breaks out to the upside. The rising moving averages and the RSI above 65 also indicate that bulls are in control. If the price breaks and sustains above $25,250, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum. There is no major resistance until $31,000; hence, this journey could be covered in a short time.\par \par \uc2 The first support is at the 20-day EMA ($23,218) and then at $22,800. Sellers will have to quickly drag the price below this support to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair could then tumble to $21,480.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $1,680 on Feb. 17 and thwarted attempts by the bears to pull the price back below the breakout level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/d9e94df6-0e35-4654-92fd-d5a665b2a3f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. The ETH/USDT pair could first rise to $1,800 and then continue its journey toward the next resistance at $2,000. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $2,000 and $2,200.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $1.460. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to defend the $318 resistance, but the bulls have not allowed BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) price to sustain below the moving averages. This suggests that l