 the 20-day EMA, it will give an opportunity to the bears to make a comeback. The pair could then slide to the strong support at $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-deflation-accelerates-as-shanghai-upgrade-looms-can-eth-price-avoid-a-30-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum's deflation accelerates as Shanghai upgrade looms \u8212\'20\'14 Can ETH price avoid a 30% drop?}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bears tried to stall the up-move near $1.57 but the shallow pullback suggests that bulls are not rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/76b7759f-f874-43a6-b139-44ad089e0575.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above $1.57, the uptrend may resume. The MATIC/USDT pair could then rally to $1.70. This level is likely to act as a major obstacle but if bulls kick the price above it, the pair could continue its northward march and reach $2.10.\par \par \uc2 The first major support on the downside is the 20-day EMA. Sellers will have to tug the price below this support to slow down the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair could then start a deeper correction to $1.13.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are witnessing a tough battle near the moving averages. A minor positive is that buyers have not allowed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to sustain below the 50-day SMA ($0.08), indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a8097348-37c7-4ed6-8ba2-e2aeb484275b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.09) has started to turn up gradually and the RSI is just above the midpoint, signaling that bulls have a slight edge. If buyers drive and sustain the price above $0.09, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.10 and thereafter to $0.11. This level may act as a significant resistance but if crossed, the next stop could be $0.15.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the $0.08 level is acting as a strong support. Any breach of this level could result in a retest of the crucial support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The resistance line in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) acted as a major obstacle on three previous occasions, hence a break and close above it will be the first indication that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/2497941a-4381-4fdc-b966-d6e6bccc7270.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the resistance line, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $39 where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If bulls flip the resistance line into support during the next pullback, the likelihood of the pair hitting $50 increases.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to regain the advantage, they will have to quickly stall the up-move and yank the price back below the support at $19.50. If they do that, the pair may plummet to $15.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvYzcyOTllMDEtOGZiZC00Mzc5LThjOTktMDkzMTc2MjFhMTAzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230220ej2k000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, SOL, DOT, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,765 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders aggressively purchased the dip in Bitcoin and altcoins, a possible sign that traders are viewing price dips and buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is leading the cryptocurrency markets on the path to recovery. Although the United States Consumer Price Index (CPI) print for January was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-returns-to-22k-despite-least-volatile-us-cpi-reaction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 marginally higher than expectations}}}\uc2 , it did not dent the enthusiasm of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto traders.\par \par \uc2 A positive response to seemingly negative data is a sign that the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are looking for buying opportunities.\par \par \uc2 However, some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-eyes-23k-despite-us-dollar-strength-hitting-6-week-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts are cautious}}}\uc2  due to the strengthening of the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY). They believe that a sustained rally in the DXY could limit the upside in cryptocurrencies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/aa25056c-7858-4753-8cb1-20ce3f779839.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, long-term downtrends are followed by a base formation. During this phase, several analysts remain skeptical about a rally, but the price action continues to surprise them. Although data is important, short-term traders should focus more on price action and devise a suitable strategy.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $21,480 level on Feb. 14 and reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($22,235). This shows that buyers are trying to arrest the correction near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $21,228. A shallow pullback is an indication that traders are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/1367c3fc-e5fd-4b79-aa23-d0047c75f645.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position, they will have to aggressively defend the $22,800 level and sink the price below $21,228. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair may extend the correction to the 50% retracement level at $20,294. The deeper the correction, the longer it is likely to take for the next leg of the up-move to begin.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive and sustain the price above $22,800, the pair could rally to $23,500 and then to $24,255. The bears are expected to fiercely guard this zone. If the price turns down from it, the pair may remain range-bound between $21,228 and $24,255 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the moving averages. The strong rebound off the 50-day simple moving average ($1,483) on Feb. 14 displays demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/8a7f6d9f-f6d3-4c8b-bbbd-11039cd6309a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($1,569) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. A break above the 20-day EMA will tilt the advantage in favor of the buyers. The ETH/USDT pair could then retest the solid overhead resistance at $1,680.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA), it will signal an advantage to bears. That may start a deeper correction to the next strong support at $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 50-day SMA ($293) on Feb. 13, but the bears could not build upon this advantage. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying near $280.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/a3ae1ae4-9cd2-4de9-83f0-57f811923c8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have a slight edge. The next drop to $280 increases the risk of a breakdown. Below this support, the BNB/USDT pair could extend its decline to $260.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate solid demand at lower levels. That could enhance the prospects of a rally to the neckline of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) jumped up from the strong support at $0.36 on Feb. 14 and reached the 50-day SMA ($0.38). The bears are likely to sell the relief rally to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/0d1c163b-4b90-400f-a6fb-1129ea7e52e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That may result in a retest of the support at $0.36. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the XRP/USDT pair will form a head-and-shoulders pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above the moving averages, it will indicate that the pair may oscillate between $0.42 and $0.36 for a while longer.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) attracted solid buying at the 50-day SMA ($0.34), as seen from the long tail on the Feb. 13 candlestick. The bulls followed it up with another strong up-move on Feb. 14 that rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.38).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/3eaf04e0-c47d-4e8b-a929-b1b64c794923.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. If they succeed, the pair could pick up momentum and soar above the immediate resistance at $0.44. The next major hurdle is $0.52, and if this is crossed, the rally may extend to the pattern target of $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are trying a comeback. They will have to sink the price below $0.34 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Repeated attempts by the bears to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($0.08) have failed in the past few days. This shows strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/4dcb8bdc-7ad1-4c40-a768-618d55acb053.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.08). If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone between $0.10 and $0.11. The bears are expected to defend this zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance. The pair could then fall to the 50-day SMA and eventually to the strong support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($1.19) on Feb. 13 and Feb. 14, but they could not sustain the lower levels. This shows that the bulls are not willing to give up their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/3299b3ec-8a35-4928-a9e6-2a613f9a204f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line, the MATIC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $1.35. Such a move will enhance the prospects of the continuation of the up-move. If $1.35 is scaled, the rally may extend to $1.75.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are selling on every minor rally. The next dip below the 20-day EMA may open the gates for a possible slide to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-binance-s-bnb-token-risks-sliding-further-by-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Binance\u8217\'20\'19s BNB token risks sliding further by March}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the moving averages since Feb. 9, which suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/fd74ba9c-725a-4e61-a804-b38407c8da27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($22.21) and the RSI at the midpoint also do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. This indicates that the SOL/USDT pair may swing between the downtrend line and the 50-day SMA for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the selling may intensify, and the pair is likely to slump to $15. Conversely, if bulls kick the price above the downtrend line, the pair could complete a 100% retracement and rise to $39.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($5.76) on Feb. 13 and Feb. 14, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ba1b892c-3947-4d61-a59b-84590cc9526f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to build upon this advantage and thrust the price above the 20-day EMA ($6.32). If they can pull it off, the DOT/USDT pair could start its journey toward the overhead resistance at $7.25. This will form an inverse H&S pattern, which will complete on a break above $7.25. This reversal setup has a pattern target of $10.28.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears have flipped the 20-day EMA into resistance. That could start a deeper correction to $4.35.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) Feb. 13 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($86). Buyers continued their purchase on Feb. 14 and cleared the 20-day EMA ($93) hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ba99ed2e-3f2e-4699-9428-64e690d57ac5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between $102.53 on the upside and $88 on the downside. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI above 57 point to a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 A consolidation near the local highs is a positive sign, as it suggests that stronger hands continue to hold on to their position as they anticipate the up-move to resume. A break above $102.53 could clear the path for a possible rise to $115.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be negated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below $88. The pair may then tumble to $81 and later to $75.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvODZhZjg3MTMtZDI5MS00OTM4LWFkOTYtMmIyZWU2MTgzNGU3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230215ej2f000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/13: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,744 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to erode in the face of strong macro headwinds \u8212\'20\'14 and this week\u8217\'20\'19s CPI print and enforcement from the SEC could further impact the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins are threatening to deepen their correction after reports emerged that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-issuer-paxos-to-face-sec-lawsuit-over-binance-usd-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued a Wells Notice to Paxos}}}\uc2 , alleging that the dollar-pegged Binance USD ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-usd-busd-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BUSD}}}\uc2  ) stablecoin is an unregistered security. Separately, Paxos has been ordered by the \uc2 New York Department of Financial Services\uc2  (NYDFS) to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paxos-ordered-to-stop-issuing-binance-usd-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halt the issuance of BUSD}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After the crackdown on Kraken last week and now Paxos, the regulator\u8217\'20\'19s actions may increase nervousness among crypto investors. FOX Business journalist {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stablecoin-issuer-paxos-to-face-sec-lawsuit-over-binance-usd-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Eleanor Terrett tweeted}}}\uc2  on Feb. 12 that \u8220\'20\'1Cmore Wells notices going out in the coming 2-3 weeks, I\u8217\'20\'19m told.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/0f9f0b37-51ea-4614-8eb1-b36ec6015c8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  may remain high in the near term as market observers await the consumer price index data to be released on Feb. 14. Interestingly, Bitcoin has made a golden cross on the daily chart and a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-weekly-death-cross-ever-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 death cross on the weekly time frame}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the medium-term trend remains negative but the short-term trend could be signaling a turnaround. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out the critical support and resistance levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) turned down from 4,200 on Feb. 2 and reached the 20-day exponential moving average (4,057) on Feb. 10. This is an important level for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the recovery intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/25bcff43-b1bc-4fbf-b725-a726ba17d530.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up gradually and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to buyers. The bulls will try to push the price to the overhead resistance at 4,200.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if bulls pierce this resistance, the index may rally to 4,300 and thereafter to 4,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to have the upper hand, they will have to pull the index below the 20-day EMA. That could sink the index to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) turned down from the resistance line on Feb. 7 but the bears could not sink the price below the 20-day EMA (103). This suggests a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/ffd0aac5-6f78-46c0-8fcf-be18eeaa941a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has turned up and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, suggesting that bulls are making a comeback. If the price breaks and sustains above the resistance line, the short-term trend may turn positive. The index could then start its northward march to 106 and later to 108.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level and 