\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: EU Stablecoin, Binance Card, And More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 549 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market appears to be recovering, and the gradual upward movement has increased investors' hopes. Let\u8217\'20\'19s find out more.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 In a recent SEC filing, the electric vehicle manufacturing company reported a loss of $140 million on its net Bitcoin holdings.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin-based payments network and financial application Strike has announced that it is expanding its Bitcoin Lightning Network-powered money transfer services to the Philippines.\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin looked to be running out of puff after a 44% pump since the first of January, many investors may have been taking profits in BTC.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Layer-2 scaling solution Optimism has announced plans to issue a major upgrade to enhance network performance, which is scheduled for March.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum's scheduled Shanghai hard fork is going forward, and details for a public testnet dubbed Zhejiang have been released.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins\par \par \uc2 The Cardano-based Djed stablecoin (DJED) has attracted over 27 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens as reserves less than a day after its launch.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s BUSD stablecoin has seen a sharp fall in market capitalization, as its circulating supply dropped to $15.4 billion on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Technology\par \par \uc2 Helsinki-based fintech company Membrane Finance launched Europe\u8217\'20\'19s first fully-reserved, EU-regulated stablecoin, and payments network, EUROe.\par \par \uc2 The Kin Foundation announced the launch of Kinetic, its flagship middleware (integration ramp/tool) built off of the Solana ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Business\par \par \uc2 The bankrupt cryptocurrency lender BlockFi has obtained approval to sell its crypto mining equipment as it tries to repay its creditors.\par \par \uc2 The prepaid Binance Card is currently in beta testing and is being launched in Brazil by a Binance-Mastercard partnership.\par \par \uc2 Regulation\par \par \uc2 Federal Reserve Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  announced the possibility of another couple of rate rises before pausing for the rest of 2023.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Department of Justice\uc2  has launched a probe into \uc2 Silvergate Capital Corp\uc2 . and its dealings with bankrupt crypto firm \uc2 FTX\uc2  and its sister concern \uc2 Alameda Research\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A lawsuit against \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and its CEO, \uc2 Brian Armstrong\uc2 , was dismissed on Wednesday as the judge exposed a flaw in the plaintiffs\u8217\'20\'19 claim.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Independent Community Bankers of America (ICBA) \uc2 are calling for lawmakers and regulators to rein in the cryptocurrency industry.\par \par \uc2 Hong Kong remains steadfast in its pursuit of becoming Asia\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 digital-asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  hub despite the catastrophic fallout from the collapsed crypto exchange \uc2 FTX\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The judge presiding over the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s case against the decentralized publishing platform LBRY has ruled that the secondary sales of LBC do not qualify as the sale of securities.\par \par \uc2 The United Kingdom has opened a consultation on new rules for regulating the crypto sector, similar to traditional finance (TradFi).\par \par \uc2 India\u8217\'20\'19s annual Economic Survey has been published, and crypto concerns have been extensively discussed.\par \par \uc2 NFT\par \par \uc2 YouTuber Logan Paul has been named in a class-action lawsuit against his project CryptoZoo, which has been accused of fraudulently stealing millions from investors.\par \par \uc2 Mastercard\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s former NFT product lead alleged workplace mistreatment and sold his resignation letter as an NFT.\par \par \uc2 Despite the market downturn, the Premier League has finalized a deal with French fantasy sports platform Sorare to launch NFT collections.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230205ej2500001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,758 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 February 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins could continue their up-move since trading sentiment remains positive.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally in 2023 has been boosted by expectations that the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  will slow down the pace of its rate hikes as inflation has started cooling down. Some even anticipate a rate cut by the end of the year. That assumption received a jolt on Feb.3 when the U.S. employment data for January beat expectations and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/20k-bitcoin-may-return-says-analyst-as-us-unemployment-hits-54-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unemployment hit its lowest level since May 1969}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If markets do not react negatively to news perceived as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it\u8217\'20\'19s a sign that the sentiment has turned positive. Traders may then shift their focus to the next important economic data release. Trading firm QCP Capital said in its latest market update that the Consumer Price Index print on Feb. 14 could move markets. They believe the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-did-bitcoin-price-go-down-today-btc-traders-brace-for-23k-retest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risks to the data are to the upside}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/afbfc803-1229-41de-bb50-35784bf90fb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The current crypto bear market seems to have driven the institutional investors to the sidelines. According to a new survey conducted by \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 , 72% of institutional traders said they do not plan to \u8220\'20\'1Ctrade crypto/digital coins\u8221\'20\'1D in 2023. Only {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/72-of-institutional-traders-are-crypto-skeptical-this-year-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 14% of the respondents showed an inclination}}}\uc2  to trade this year.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins witness profit booking in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the $22,800 support on Feb. 1, indicating that bulls are buying the dips to this level. The bulls pushed the price above $24,000 on Feb. 2 but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/d6bb4de9-56db-40b7-9aee-98a5f6faaea6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the relative strength (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price turns up from the current level or $22,800, the BTC/USDT pair could surge to $25,000. This level is likely to act as a formidable barrier.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day exponential moving average ($22,279). That could trigger the stops of several short-term traders and the pair could then fall to $21,480.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers propelled Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $1,680 on Feb. 2 but they could not sustain the breakout. The price gave up all the gains on the day and closed below $1,680.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/f0bb1667-df0b-42da-b9e6-73818dda2dd3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1,571) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. They may again attempt to overcome the overhead barrier at $1,680 and start the journey to $2,000. The $1,800 level may provide some resistance but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to sell aggressively and yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair may decline to $1,500 and if this support cracks, the pullback could eventually reach $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tight-range trading between the 20-day EMA ($306) and the overhead resistance at $318 resolved to the upside on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/2adb2c65-8e50-4bbf-b59c-13edf1bfd345.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although bears sold the rally on Feb. 2, a positive sign is that the buyers did not allow the price to slide back below the breakout level of $318. This suggests that the bulls are trying to flip the $318 level into support. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could skyrocket to $360 as there is no major barrier in between.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to halt the up-move, they will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($276).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the $0.42 resistance on Feb. 2, indicating that bears are trying to protect this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/2e8ddccf-b2e1-43ae-87dd-2d2e8ae51004.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.40) and $0.42. This suggests a breakout may be around the corner. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. This increases the possibility of a break above $0.42. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could soar to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Attempts by the bears to sink Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.37) failed on Feb. 1. The bulls fiercely defended the level as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/e7d1a9aa-b708-44b9-886e-4bdd10fec6dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the RSI points to weakening momentum but the upsloping 20-day EMA suggests that buyers have the edge. If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to catapult the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair toward the overhead resistance at $0.44.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that traders may be booking profits. That could open the doors for a potential drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.31).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Feb. 1 candlestick shows that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.08). However, buyers failed to build upon this strength and overcome the barrier at $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/0ffbf104-eb5d-4233-a2c5-7e293d5d7b2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.10. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that buyers have a slight edge. If the price once again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to overcome the resistance at $0.10. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.08). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could retest $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the breakout level of $1.05 on Feb.1 and reached above $1.25 on Feb. 2. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that short-term traders may have booked profits at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/1e16281a-a8c9-489b-8e46-477da0b6c576.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that the bulls did not cede ground to the bears and are attempting to push the price to the target objective at $1.30. This level may again act as a strong barrier but if buyers bulldoze their way through, the MATIC/USDT pair could reach $1.70.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the MATIC/USDT pair could drop to $1.05. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a bounce off it could keep the pair range-bound between $1.05 and $1.30 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-big-month-did-us-institutions-prevail-over-asian-retail-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s big month: Did US institutions prevail over Asian retail traders?}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) continued its northward march and skyrocketed above the psychological level of $100 on Feb. 1. This rise may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/c5a82d54-e005-45ec-80aa-d482142fb1be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair could enter a minor correction but the bulls are likely to buy the dip to the 20-day EMA ($90). If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to extend the up-move to $107.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will indicate that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. The pair could then slump to $81 and later to $75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($6.21) on Feb. 1 and broke above the overhead resistance of $6.84 on Feb. 2. The bulls could not maintain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the Feb. 2 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/3211b5d0-3841-43fe-805e-0a047d75fa1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to break back below the resistance line. This indicates that traders are trying to flip this level into support. Buyers will have to sustain the price above $7 to gain control. The DOT/USDT pair could then surge to $8 where it may face strong resistance from the sellers.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to regain control, they will have to quickly sink the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then enter a corrective phase and plummet to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance at $22 on Feb. 2 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-02/785602df-4b6f-4b12-9fe5-d448f38e2be9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages suggest that bulls are in command but the negative divergence on the RSI indicates that the momentum may be weakening. If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the likelihood of a break above $22 increases. The AVAX/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slips below $20.50, the pair could reach the resistance line. The bears will have to sink the pair below this support to tilt the advantage in their favor.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDIvMWM4MzFiMzEtMWEwMC00MTQ5LWE4YTMtN2RhMWU4NjNlMDI1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230203ej23000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,685 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the S&P 500 are witnessing profit-booking as short-term traders lighten up positions before the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s policy meeting on Feb. 1, but that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t mean that the wider \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto trend has lost momentum.\par \par \uc2 Traders tend to lighten up positions before important events because they hate uncertainty. The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s next policy decision is on Feb. 1, when the central bank is expected to hike rates by 25 basis points.\par \par \uc2 Market observers will keenly watch for any hints about how high the rates could go. That could be one of the reasons for the profit-booking in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins on Jan. 30.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery in January could also be signaling the start of a new bull market, according to certain on-chain metrics. The Profit and Loss Index from on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant has given its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/best-january-since-2013-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first buy signal since 2019}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/6278d6a4-a338-44ea-8f98-baadbda7e84f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Blockware Solutions head analyst Joe Burnett believes that Bitcoin will not break above its all-time high of $69,000 until the next Bitcoin halving, which is scheduled to occur in March 2024. Burnett anticipates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-stays-out-of-fear-for-11-straight-days-as-price-tips-near-24k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s next bull market top}}}\uc2  will be between $150,000 to $350,000, which is a massive increase from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 After several failed attempts, the S&P 500 closed above the downtrend line on Jan. 26. However, the bears are not willing to surrender without a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5b00fd82-d500-48c1-87b3-1b9d5c3ddc06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers are trying to halt the recovery at 4,101, but the up-sloping 20-day exponential moving average (3,972) and the relative strength index (RSI) in positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers thrust the price above 4,101, the index could start its journey toward 4,325.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears yank the price below the moving averages, several aggressive bulls may get trapped and the index could then tumble to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) is falling inside a descending broadening wedge pattern but the bulls are trying to protect the support at 101.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d94d9424-359c-47a6-ac38-feff1ff7bee6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce could face selling at the 20-day EMA (102.63) because bears defended this level during downtrends. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a break below 101.29 increases. That could tug the index to the psychologically crucial level of 100.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the index rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand from the bulls. The index could then rise toward the resistance line of the wedge. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that the short-term downtrend may have ended.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the resistance at $23,816 on Jan. 29 but the bulls could not build upon the momentum on Jan. 30. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits and the price has dropped down toward $22,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/aa11d463-320d-4de7-a2ca-a41e461caaa0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $22,800, it will suggest that bulls have flipped the level into support. That could increase the likelihood of a rally to $25,211. Sellers are likely to guard this level with all their might because if $25,211 is conquered, the BTC/USDT pair could dash toward the $30,000 to $32,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears pull the price below $22,800, the correction could deepen to the 20-day EMA ($21,716) and then to the psychological support at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again reached near the overhead resistance at $1,680 but the bulls could not overcome this obstacle. That means the price remains stuck between the 20-day EMA ($1,540) and $1,680.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/b28e5e95-52e8-4a5d-bf0c-bad47a680d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to thrust the price above $1,680. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally toward $2,000 with a brief stop near $1,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it could attract profit-booking by the short-term bulls. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($1,365), which may act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) touched the strong resistance of $318 on Jan. 29 but the bulls could not overcome this barrier. This indicates that bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/3e1abaa0-6d75-4c0a-96db-ca8d75c34238.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($298). Although the upsloping 20-day EMA suggests advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI indicates that the positive momentum could be weakening. The selling could accelerate on a break below the 20-day EMA and the BNB/USDT pair could slide to $280.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the pair above $318. If they manage to do that, the pair could soar to $360.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the overhead resistance at $0.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f65a648d-b347-4bb9-9478-8915649b838a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight consolidation near the overhead resistance gives an edge to the buyers but when the bulls fail to surpass the hurdle even after repeated attempts, some traders may book profits.\par \par \uc2 That could start a deeper correction and in this case, a break below the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their dominance, they will have to quickly kick the XRP/USDT pair above the $0.42 to $0.44 resistance zone. That could start a rally to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are not allowing Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to sustain above $0.09 and the bulls are not letting it dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/8814beb1-2baf-4e1a-8213-3f76156e8c46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to force the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.09. If they can pull it off, the pair could soar to $0.11, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.08). This level could act as a minor support but if bears sink the price below it, the pair could collapse to the critical support near $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-pares-weekend-gains-as-another-cme-gap-lurks-below-20k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price pares weekend gains as another CME \u8216\'20\'18gap\u8217\'20\'19 lurks below $20K}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading above the $0.38 resistance for three days, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped below the breakout level on Jan. 30. This indicates that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/75150a46-9a30-4661-9460-ed2940722f99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.36) indicates advantage to buyers but the negative divergence on the RSI warns that the bulls may be losing their grip. The bears will try to yank the price to the 20-day EMA, which is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below the 20-day EMA, the selling could increase and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may fall to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers want to maintain their dominance, they will have to quickly thrust the price above $0.40. The pair could then travel to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) up-move met with heavy selling near $1.20 on Jan. 29. The price could retest the breakout level of $1.05, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/57da810a-c715-42e8-9856-c72616b97103.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price springs back from $1.05, it will signal that bulls have flipped the level into support. The buyers will then try to propel the price above $1.20 and challenge the strong resistance near $1.30.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price dives below the 20-day EMA ($1.02), it will suggest that the breakout above $1.05 may have been a bull trap. The MATIC/USDT pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to sustain above the resistance line for the past few days, indicating that bears are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/eeccb3ef-4fd3-446c-9b42-bf26b629b664.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA ($6). If they manage to do that, it could tilt the near-term advantage in favor of the bears. The DOT/USDT pair could then decline to $5.50 and later to the 50-day SMA ($5.20).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to clear the overhead zone between the resistance line and $6.84. If that happens, the pair could rally toward $8. There is a minor support at $7.42 but that is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvYzdmNjBmNTgtZTY2NS00OWM2LTgyMjgtOTIyYmIzZTFmNWI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230131ej1u0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,683 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the S&P 500 are witnessing profit-booking as short-term traders lighten up positions before the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s FOMC on Feb. 1, but that doesn\u8217\'20\'19t mean that the wider \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto trend has lost momentum.\par \par \uc2 Traders tend to lighten up positions before important events because they hate uncertainty. The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy decision is on Feb. 1, where the central bank is expected to hike rates by 25 basis points.\par \par \uc2 Market observers will keenly watch for any hints about how high the rates could go. That could be one of the reasons for the profit-booking in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins on Jan. 30.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery in January could also be signaling the start of a new bull market, according to certain on-chain metrics. The Profit and Loss Index from on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant has given its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/best-january-since-2013-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first buy signal since 2019}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/6278d6a4-a338-44ea-8f98-baadbda7e84f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Blockware Solutions head analyst Joe Burnett believes that Bitcoin will not break above its all-time high of $69,000 until the next Bitcoin halving which is scheduled to occur in March 2024. Burnett anticipates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-stays-out-of-fear-for-11-straight-days-as-price-tips-near-24k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s next bull market top}}}\uc2  to be between $150,000 to $350,000, which isa massive increase from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 After several failed attempts, the S&P 500 closed above the downtrend line on Jan. 26. However, the bears are not willing to surrender without a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5b00fd82-d500-48c1-87b3-1b9d5c3ddc06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers are trying to halt the recovery at 4,101, but the up-sloping 20-day exponential moving average (3,972) and the relative strength index (RSI) in positive territory indicates that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers thrust the price above 4,101, the index could start its journey toward 4,325.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bears yank the price below the moving averages, several aggressive bulls may get trapped and the index could then tumble to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) is falling inside a descending broadening wedge pattern but the bulls are trying to protect the support at 101.29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d94d9424-359c-47a6-ac38-feff1ff7bee6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce could face selling at the 20-day EMA (102.63) because bears defended this level during downtrends. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a break below 101.29 increases. That could tug the index to the psychologically crucial level of 100.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the index rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand from the bulls. The index could then rise toward the resistance line of the wedge. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that the short-term downtrend may have ended.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the resistance at $23,816 on Jan. 29 but the bulls could not build upon the momentum on Jan. 30. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits and the price has dropped down toward $22,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/aa11d463-320d-4de7-a2ca-a41e461caaa0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $22,800, it will suggest that bulls have flipped the level into support. That could increase the likelihood of a rally to $25,211. Sellers are likely to guard this level with all their might because if $25,211 is conquered, the BTC/USDT pair could dash toward the $30,000 to $32,000 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears pull the price below $22,800, the correction could deepen to the 20-day EMA ($21,716) and then to the psychological support at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again reached near the overhead resistance at $1,680 but the bulls could not overcome this obstacle. That means the price remains stuck between the 20-day EMA ($1,540) and $1,680.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/b28e5e95-52e8-4a5d-bf0c-bad47a680d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to thrust the price above $1,680. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally toward $2,000 with a brief stop near $1,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it could attract profit-booking by the short-term bulls. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($1,365), which may act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) touched the strong resistance of $318 on Jan. 29 but the bulls could not overcome this barrier. This indicates that bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/3e1abaa0-6d75-4c0a-96db-ca8d75c34238.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($298). Although the upsloping 20-day EMA suggests advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI indicates that the positive momentum could be weakening. The selling could accelerate on a break below the 20-day EMA and the BNB/USDT pair could slide to $280.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the pair above $318. If they manage to do that, the pair could soar to $360.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the overhead resistance at $0.42.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f65a648d-b347-4bb9-9478-8915649b838a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, a tight consolidation near the overhead resistance gives an edge to the buyers but when the bulls fail to surpass the hurdle even after repeated attempts, some traders may book profits.\par \par \uc2 That could start a deeper correction and in this case, a break below the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their dominance, they will have to quickly kick the XRP/USDT pair above the $0.42 to $0.44 resistance zone. That could start a rally to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are not allowing Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) to sustain above $0.09 and the bulls are not letting it dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/8814beb1-2baf-4e1a-8213-3f76156e8c46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to force the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.09. If they can pull it off, the pair could soar to $0.11 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.08). This level could act as a minor support but if bears sink the price below it, the pair could collapse to the critical support near $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-pares-weekend-gains-as-another-cme-gap-lurks-below-20k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price pares weekend gains as another CME \u8216\'20\'18gap\u8217\'20\'19 lurks below $20K}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading above the $0.38 resistance for three days, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped below the breakout level on Jan. 30. This indicates that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/75150a46-9a30-4661-9460-ed2940722f99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.36) indicates advantage to buyers but the negative divergence on the RSI warns that the bulls may be losing their grip. The bears will try to yank the price to the 20-day EMA, which is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below the 20-day EMA, the selling could increase and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may fall to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers want to maintain their dominance, they will have to quickly thrust the price above $0.40. The pair could then travel to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) up-move met with heavy selling near $1.20 on Jan. 29. The price could retest the breakout level of $1.05, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/57da810a-c715-42e8-9856-c72616b97103.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price springs back from $1.05, it will signal that bulls have flipped the level into support. The buyers will then try to propel the price above $1.20 and challenge the strong resistance near $1.30.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price dives below the 20-day EMA ($1.02), it will suggest that the breakout above $1.05 may have been a bull trap. The MATIC/USDT pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to sustain above the resistance line for the past few days, which indicates that bears are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/eeccb3ef-4fd3-446c-9b42-bf26b629b664.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA ($6). If they manage to do that, it could tilt the near-term advantage in favor of the bears. The DOT/USDT pair could then decline to $5.50 and later to the 50-day SMA ($5.20).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to clear the overhead zone between the resistance line and $6.84. If that happens, the pair could rally toward $8. There is a minor support at $7.42 but that is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvYzdmNjBmNTgtZTY2NS00OWM2LTgyMjgtOTIyYmIzZTFmNWI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230130ej1u000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset \highlight\uc2  investment products see highest inflows since July 2022: Report\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Judith BannermanQuist \par \uc2 350 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market saw significant growth last week, with investment products experiencing record inflows and improved volumes.\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 30, European cryptocurrency investment firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  published its \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Report,\u8221\'20\'1D which revealed that \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investments experienced a surge in inflows last week, reaching $117 million, the highest since July 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4bd01cc8-7a13-4369-abe6-f0d6d2051ae6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reported that the sector\u8217\'20\'19s total assets under management rose to $28 billion, a 43% increase from its November 2022 lows. The improvement in investment product volumes was evident, with $1.3 billion traded during the week, a 17% increase compared to the year-to-date average. Meanwhile, weekly volumes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market have risen by an average of 11%.\par \par \uc2 Germany saw the highest inflows last week, accounting for 40% of the total ($46 million), followed by Canada, the United States and Switzerland, which received $30 million, $26 million and $23 million, respectively. Most of the inflows were directed toward Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) products, with $116 million, while minor inflows were seen into short-Bitcoin products at $4.4 million, indicating a polarized opinion.\par \par \uc2 The report also revealed that multi-asset investment products continued to see outflows for the ninth consecutive week, totaling $6.4 million. According to James Butterfill, head of research at \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 , this suggests that investors are opting for more selective investments. This trend was evident in altcoins, such as Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) saw inflows, while Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) and Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) experienced minor outflows.\par \par \uc2 Investors also showed interest in blockchain equities, with inflows totaling $2.4 million. However, a closer examination reveals that sentiment remains divided across providers.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-pares-weekend-gains-as-another-cme-gap-lurks-below-20k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price pares weekend gains as another CME \u8216\'20\'18gap\u8217\'20\'19 lurks below $20K}}}\par \par \uc2 Overall, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market saw significant growth last week, with investment products experiencing record inflows and improved volumes. The overall trend suggests that investors are becoming more selective in their investments, with a divided sentiment toward blockchain equities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvMmNkZWFiODktYzc5NC00OWUwLWE4NzQtYTgyMTIyOGFkOGUxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230130ej1u000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,802 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The range-bound action in Bitcoin and select altcoins looks set to remain in the favor of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders.\par \par \uc2 After two weeks of a stupendous rally, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has largely been flat this week. This is a positive sign, as it shows that market participants are not growing nervous before a slew of central bank meetings takes place next week. The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 , European Central Bank and Bank of England are scheduled to announce their policy decisions next week.\par \par \uc2 The confidence of the bulls received another boost after the U.S. core personal consumption expenditures (PCE) data for December {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/01/27/pce-inflation-december-2022-.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed}}}\uc2  the slowest annual rate of increase since October 2021. The core PCE rose 4.4% from a year ago, meeting analyst expectations.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/12069266-5dec-49a0-8ef0-459d22b9e58c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to a report by Markus Thielen, the head of research and strategy at Matrixport, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-institutions-account-for-85-of-bitcoin-buying-in-very-positive-sign-matrixport"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. institutions have not abandoned the cryptocurrency markets}}}\uc2 . The financial services firm arrived at this conclusion by assuming that if the gains happened during U.S. trading hours, it was because institutions were buying. Using this metric, the firm said that 85% of the rally in January was due to institutional buying.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins shrug off their range-bound action and resume the uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) soared to $23,816 on Jan. 25, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/fbe08186-375f-4b0b-a413-bedd439b075c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the BTC/USDT pair to maintain above $23,000 may tempt short-term traders to book profits. The immediate support is at $22,292. If this level gives way, the pullback could reach the 20-day exponential moving average, or EMA ($21,172).\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because a sharp rebound off it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then again try to resume its up-move and reach the critical overhead resistance at $25,211.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that bulls may be rushing to the exit. The bears may gain back control below $20,400.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not build upon Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) solid rebound off the 20-day EMA ($1,520) on Jan. 25, which suggests that bears are selling on recoveries near the overhead resistance of $1,680.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/e6c236bd-f0af-4682-8562-aa615ed42a32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below the horizontal support near $1,500 to tilt the short-term advantage in their favor. The ETH/USDT pair could then start its decline toward the strong support at $1,352.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to avoid this near-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, they will have to quickly drive the price above the overhead resistance at $1,680. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its journey to $2,000, with a brief stop-over at $1,800.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been sandwiched between the 20-day EMA ($293) and the overhead resistance of $318 for the past few days. This shows that bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA and bears are selling on rallies near $318.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a868a68c-f597-436a-89f9-4bd98eaf2d81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate buyers have a slight edge. To build upon this advantage, the bulls will have to propel and sustain the price above $318. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and surge to $360.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to fiercely protect the $318 level and tug the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair could drop to $281. This level may act as a minor support, but if cracks, the pair could touch the 50-day simple moving average, or SMA ($270).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) jumped from the 20-day EMA ($0.39) on Jan. 25 and rose above the $0.42 overhead resistance, but the buyers could not sustain the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a7ccf13a-c566-4194-8dfb-2f4cf72eec04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure to clear the overhead hurdle may tempt the short-term bulls to book profits. That could drag the price below the 20-day EMA and open the doors for a possible drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns up from the 20-day EMA and ascends the $0.42\u8211\'20\'13$0.44 zone. The XRP/USDT pair could then start a strong rally that could touch $0.51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.38 overhead resistance on Jan. 26, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. Still, it is pertinent to note that if a resistance gets pierced frequently, it tends to weaken.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/15b9ca66-bd17-4603-86a8-825281f82576.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will once again try to thrust the price above the overhead resistance. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could spurt to $0.44. This level may again act as a formidable barrier, but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the pair could continue its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA indicates an advantage to buyers, but the negative divergence on the RSI cautions that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA to start a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($0.30).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Jan. 25, but the bulls could not continue the recovery on Jan. 26. The price turned down and slipped to the 20-day EMA on Jan. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5ffbc6ef-95c5-409a-a292-4be5a62167fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair is stuck between $0.09 and the 20-day EMA for the past few days. If the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.09, the likelihood of a rally to the next resistance at $0.11 increases.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair could then dive to the strong support at $0.07. Such a move could point to a possible range-bound action between $0.07 and $0.09 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.97) on Jan. 25 and skyrocketed above the crucial resistance of $1.05 on Jan. 26. The break above this level indicates that the uncertainty of the range resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/070871b2-cf17-486c-8664-cdbc0350345e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers continued to build upon the momentum, and the MATIC/USDT pair crossed the minor resistance at $1.16 on Jan. 27. This clears the path for a possible rally to $1.30 where the bears may again mount a strong defense. If bulls surmount this obstacle, the rally could extend to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below $1.05, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair could then slide to $0.91.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-head-fake-rally-ltc-price-technicals-hint-at-65-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin 'head fake' rally? LTC price technicals hint at 65% crash}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating between the 20-day EMA ($85) and the overhead resistance at $92 for the past few days. This suggests uncertainty among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d0ed2480-dcde-45e3-9cef-58747d7a174e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to the bulls, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the buying pressure is decreasing. The bears will gain the upper hand if they succeed in pulling the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 That could trigger the stops of short-term traders, and the LTC/USDT pair could then tumble to $81 and later to $75.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to assert their dominance, they will have to kick and sustain the price above $92. That could signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could then travel to $100 and subsequently to $107.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the resistance line for the past few days. Usually, a tight consolidation near a strong overhead resistance shows that buyers are holding on to their positions as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a6fec89e-0b67-43bf-9243-a52c1aeccb08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers catapult the price above the resistance line, the DOT/USDT pair could signal a potential trend change. The pair could then start its journey toward $8.05, with a short stop-over at $7.42.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to maintain above the resistance line, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That could attract profit-booking by short-term traders. The pair could first drop to the 20-day EMA ($5.88), and if this level collapses, the decline could reach $5.50.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s AVAX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line on Jan. 26, but the bears thwarted their attempt. The bulls did not cede ground to the bears and are again trying to overcome the barrier on Jan. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a59393b7-e10c-486f-bee6-1fe52d49beb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price breaks above the resistance line, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $22 and thereafter to $24.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the 20-day EMA ($16.31) will be the first indication that the buying pressure is reducing. That could open the doors for a possible drop to $14.65 and thereafter to the 50-day SMA ($13.69).\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvMzU4ZGEyMjItZWQ4Mi00YTY5LTgwNTgtMmYxMjYzMmViNjMzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230127ej1r000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,696 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Concerns over the state of the U.S. economy and next week\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting are translating to a mild pullback in Bitcoin and altcoin prices.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near $23,000 for the past few days. The next big question troubling investors is whether the rally is over or if Bitcoin resume its recovery.\par \par \uc2 The strong year-to-date rally in Bitcoin has turned several analysts \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term. They anticipate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-due-shake-up-vs-gold-stocks-as-btc-price-dips-under-22-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to extend its up-move}}}\uc2  and reach $25,000 and even $30,000.\par \par \uc2 However, for the slightly longer term, analysts seem to be divided. In comments to Cointelegraph, economist Lyn Alden said Bitcoin could face \u8220\'20\'1Cconsiderable danger\u8221\'20\'1D in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-faces-considerable-danger-from-fed-in-2023-lyn-alden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second half of 2023 as liquidity risks rise}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/c149453e-760a-4b65-8283-045f48b85199.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, ARK Invest CEO and chief investment officer \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2  said in a company video blog on Jan. 23 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ark-invest-ceo-eyes-crypto-turnaround-amid-whiffs-of-a-fed-pivot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto assets could witness a huge turnaround}}}\uc2  in 2023 as the Fed pivots due to falling inflation.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical support and resistance levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been witnessing a see-saw battle near $22,800. The bears want to stall the up-move at this level but the bulls are not willing to surrender.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/22a98fc6-7b34-4aa4-af6c-956717c82794.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($20,700) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will have to kick the price above $23,371 to start the next leg of the rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $22,292, it could trigger the stops of several short-term traders. That could intensify selling and the BTC/USDT pair could dive to $21,480.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to resume the up-move. The short-term trend may turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  below $20,400.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After forming Doji candlestick patterns on Jan. 22 and 23, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on Jan. 24, indicating that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a3ad5873-bd1b-4ecb-bf69-5892ce2765df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair corrected to the 20-day EMA ($1,496) on Jan. 25, which is a crucial support to keep an eye on. If the price bounces off this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying near support.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then retest the resistance at $1,680. A break above this level could signal the start of the next leg of the up-move. The pair could first rise to $1,800 and thereafter dash toward $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be negated in the short term if the price plunges below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then fall to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead barrier at $318 on Jan. 24 but the bulls could not maintain the breakout as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d3e4cbcc-13a5-4eaa-bc35-2edb11f94f76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($290) on Jan. 25 as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. This suggests that the BNB/USDT pair could swing between the 20-day EMA and $318 as the bulls and the bears try to assert their supremacy.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above $318, it will indicate that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could catapult the pair to $360. Conversely, a collapse below the 20-day EMA could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair could then plunge to the 50-day SMA ($270).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $0.42 overhead resistance on Jan. 23 but that proved to be a bull trap. The bears yanked the price back below the breakout level on Jan. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4c6bce85-0056-462b-8f72-0978b5260d2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.38). If the price rebounds off this support, it will indicate that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The bulls will then try to drive the price above the $0.42 to $0.44 zone. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could start an up-move to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to strengthen their position, they will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA. That could tempt short-term traders to book profits and the pair may plummet to the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rally seems to have hit a wall near $0.38. The bears repeatedly thwarted attempts by the bulls to overcome this barrier between Jan. 22 and Jan. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5865eb71-957e-4883-b6df-505e3ee7d430.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of a negative divergence, signaling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing down. Sellers could strengthen their position further if they pull and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.34). The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first slump to $0.32 and after that to the 50-day SMA ($0.30).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and ascends above $0.38, it will negate the negative divergence. The pair could then travel to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been facing strong resistance at $0.09. The price once again turned down from this level and slipped to the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Jan. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d46bbad8-3b22-4a27-9614-ae5456db8578.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls may be losing their grip. The DOGE/USDT pair could then extend its stay inside the $0.07 to $0.09 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls want to retain their edge, they will have to quickly propel and sustain the price above $0.09. That could open the doors for a rally to $0.11, which may again act as a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to thrust Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $1.05 on Jan. 24 but the bears did not budge. That pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($0.93).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/3fcb13ba-1a4b-444b-a510-fcfb62b9c651.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to keep the upper hand, they will have to protect the 20-day EMA with vigor. The MATIC/USDT pair could then again rise to $1.05. Usually, a tight consolidation near a stiff overhead resistance resolves to the upside. If that were to happen, the pair could ascend to $1.16 and subsequently to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair could remain stuck inside the range between $0.69 and $1.05 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/six-on-chain-metrics-suggesting-bitcoin-is-a-generational-buying-opportunity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Six on-chain metrics suggesting Bitcoin is a \u8216\'20\'18generational buying opportunity\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong uptrend. Buyers pushed the price above $93 on Jan. 23 but the bears sold at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5765c8ec-377f-4a88-be72-bfd890b7aa6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($84), which is likely to act as a strong support. Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $92 to signal the resumption of the up-move. The LTC/USDT pair could then jump to $100 and later to $107.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are booking profits. That could start a correction to the breakout level of $75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) nudged above the resistance line on Jan. 23 and Jan. 24 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1b66d8a2-a631-4f2a-84b7-ab44823f93c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 While the upsloping 20-day EMA ($5.73) indicates advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it could increase the possibility of a break above the resistance line. The DOT/USDT pair could then climb to $7.42 and later to $8.05.\par \par \uc2 The bears will gain the upper hand if they sink the price below the 20-day EMA. That could start a deeper correction to $5.50 and below that to the 50-day SMA ($5.08).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line on Jan. 24, indicating that bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/edd0c246-230a-45a3-b825-4713b45468c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($15.79) as the bulls are expected to buy the dips to this level. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will again try to clear the overhead hurdle. If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to $22 and thereafter to $24.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($13.48).\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvZjlhZDE1MTQtYmRhOC00OGEyLWE5Y2EtOGRjZGQ1MDBkMDdlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230125ej1p000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Loophole\par \b \uc2 What is the Bitcoin Loophole, and how does it work?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   Arunkumar Krishnakumar \par \uc2 878 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Anyone can make money trading Bitcoin and other cryptocurrencies thanks to Bitcoin Loophole, a well-known automated trading platform.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Loophole facilitates Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) trading through automated crypto trading software. It uses trading bots to help users make financially sound decisions in the crypto markets to make large chunks of profits. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/how-to-trade-cryptocurrencies-the-ultimate-beginners-guide"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cryptocurrency trading}}}\uc2  has gone mainstream, with traders making large sums of money in the market. Bitcoin Loophole takes this experience one step further.\par \par \uc2 Over the past decade, what started as a peer-to-peer electronic cash system on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/blockchain-for-beginners/how-does-blockchain-work-everything-there-is-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blockchain technology}}}\uc2  has evolved into a pioneering idea for digital assets. Cryptocurrencies have garnered widespread adoption as millions have started to trade to make profits on a day-to-day basis.\par \par \uc2 However, financial markets are a zero-sum game, and when some win, others lose. This applies to the trading of Bitcoin and other crypto assets. Often large institutions and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-are-crypto-whale-trackers-and-how-do-they-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto whales}}}\uc2  profit at the expense of retail investors. That could change with the Bitcoin Loophole.\par \par \uc2 Trading in contemporary markets is a high-risk endeavor. There is a big chance that traders lose money, and this risk is compounded by a volatile crypto market. This necessitates trustless setups that will help novice traders make money in a more protected environment.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Loophole is a trading platform that uses artificial intelligence to place trades on behalf of users. It claims to have an 85% win rate with its trades. It also doesn\u8217\'20\'19t charge a registration fee or a commission from the profits of traders.\par \par \uc2 How to get started with Bitcoin Loophole\par \par \uc2 Starting on Bitcoin Loophole is a three-step process with a seamless user experience. Registration on Bitcoin Loophole is similar to any banking application users sign in to. A free-of-charge sign-up process verifies the email and mobile number provided. This is followed by the user depositing a minimum of $250 onto the platform.\par \par \uc2 This deposit amount will be used as an initial deposit to trade on behalf of the user. The software takes care of the trading by default, and should users require to trade themselves, they can change the setting to manual.\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin loophole supports 14 digital assets: BTC, Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Gold, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ), Zcash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/zec-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZEC}}}\uc2  ), Dash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DASH}}}\uc2  ), EOS ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/eos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS}}}\uc2  ), NEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/neo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEO}}}\uc2  ), BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Iota ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/iota-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MIOTA}}}\uc2  ) and XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 What are the advantages of the Bitcoin Loophole?\par \par \uc2 From security and minimal investment to skill-based trading preferences, there are a plethora of advantages to using the Bitcoin Loophole that make it an alluring choice for crypto traders.\par \par \uc2 To comprehend why certain value propositions of Bitcoin Loophole are essential, it is important to first grasp certain fundamental problems plaguing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/blockchain-for-beginners/what-is-web-3-0-a-beginners-guide-to-the-decentralized-internet-of-the-future"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3}}}\uc2  and cryptocurrency markets. What are they?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/1046a056d3d8e32686071fed5633d667.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fundamental problems plaguing Web3 and cryptocurrency markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Each of the five problems listed above is an obstacle to the Web3 world, hindering widespread adoption and creating an atmosphere of doubt and stress in the market. The average crypto trader is also hit with several options through social media and sometimes struggles to spot good trading practices and platforms.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, users are afraid to enter and stay in this ecosystem. Bitcoin Loophole alleviates the above pain points with structured interventions. Bitcoin Loophole partners with trusted partners and brokers and offer easy access to use the platform. Also, a trader only has to invest $250 to get started and can withdraw that amount along with the profits anytime they wish. There are zero license fees and 24/7 customer support to help with queries and platform issues.\par \par \uc2 What sets the Bitcoin Loophole apart?\par \par \uc2 Along with solving fundamental Web3 problems, Bitcoin Loophole has strong offerings to create exponential value for its customers. With crypto assets prone to considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , there is a strong need for algorithms and strategies that can carefully project future prices of digital assets, and this is exactly what Bitcoin Loophole does. It provides strategic recommendations based on fundamental, technical and sentimental analysis using advanced AI and makes calls that are extremely accurate.\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin Loophole platform supports beginners and advanced traders alike with a high trade win rate. This has propelled Bitcoin Loophole to be one of the market leaders in the industry.\par \par \uc2 Solving industry-wide problems is crucial from a user-acquisition and adoption vantage point; however, only by offering sustainable upside can such platforms scale over time. The Bitcoin Loophole platform seems to have got that right.\par \par \uc2 What is the future of AI-enabled trading platforms?\par \par \uc2 AI-enabled trading platforms could be the future of trading on the cryptocurrency markets. As more investors and traders use the platform, AI gathers more data and learns from it, making it a lot more useful to users.\par \par \uc2 Platforms like Bitcoin Loophole are a boon for different users in the cryptocurrency sphere. They cater to the needs of a beginner who wishes to make money through crypto trading and to a seasoned trader who wishes to become a professional.\par \par \uc2 By removing bias and emotions from trading decisions, these platforms effectively provide sound buy and sell signals to users, making them reap the benefits of the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the cryptocurrency world.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy81OTlmN2Q2MWY1OWI0ZDIxYWUxMWQ2N2UxMzhmMjMyYi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230124ej1o0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,829 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the S&P 500 could remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  leading into the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting on Feb. 1.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has risen about 37% year-to-date and is not showing any signs of slowing down. The S&P 500 index (SPX) has also made a winning start to the year but has seen a relatively muted rally of roughly 4%.\par \par \uc2 While the price of risky assets is rising, the United States Dollar Index (DXY), perceived as a safe haven, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-metrics-exit-capitulation-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extended its downtrend}}}\uc2 , falling more than 1% in January.\par \par \uc2 The change in sentiment toward risky assets may have been triggered by expectations that the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  could slow down its rate hikes as inflation cools off. Some analysts even expect the Fed to pivot and start cutting rates before the end of the year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/90624399-8f28-4839-bda6-e5b6dcbc24d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Several {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-surge-breakthrough-or-bull-trap-pundits-weigh-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts remain skeptical}}}\uc2  about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally but the longer the price sustains above $20,000, the greater the possibility that the macro low may have been made in November. If the next decline forms a higher low, it could further confirm that the worst may be behind us.\par \par \uc2 Could the rally in Bitcoin and altcoins witness profit booking in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 reversed direction from the downtrend line on Jan. 18 and plunged below the moving averages on Jan. 19 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/81946b40-3fe5-47c5-b7b7-1cdd5abace32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip on Jan. 20 and pushed the price back above the moving averages. Buyers built upon this strength and are trying to clear the overhead obstacle at the downtrend line on Jan. 23. If they manage to do that, it will suggest a potential trend change. The index may soar to 4,325 with a minor pit stop at 4,100.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the index fails to sustain above the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 A break below 3,885 could tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the sellers. The index may then decline to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) continues to be in a downtrend. Buyers tried to start a recovery on Jan. 18 but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/ee425d71-475d-49c0-850a-b954afe7c1a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. Buyers may try to defend the support line of the descending broadening wedge pattern but could face strong selling at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 103.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, buyers are likely to guard the psychological level of 100 because if this support cracks, the selling could intensify and the index may tumble to 97.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the resistance line of the wedge.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Bitcoin above $22,800 on Jan. 21 and Jan. 22 but the long wick on the candlesticks shows that bears are selling at higher levels. The bears tried to start a correction on Jan. 22 but the bulls purchased the intraday dip, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4273ebc1-57ca-48d9-b9c8-e40c66ae53ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the RSI in the overbought territory cautions that a minor correction or consolidation is possible. For that to happen, the bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $22,292. The BTC/USDT pair could then slide to $21,480.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers propel the price above the $23,078 to $23,371 resistance zone, the pair could accelerate to $25,211. The bears may mount a strong defense at this level, which could lead to a short-term correction.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price is facing rejection at $1,680 but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the short-term traders are holding their positions as they anticipate the up-move to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/e11a9810-8723-45c7-a7f1-2efe28f7db9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1,483) and the RSI in the overbought territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $1,680 could start the journey to $1,800. This level may again act as a res