stains above $0.09, the DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.11. This level may act as a formidable barrier and the bulls may find it difficult to ascend it in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to sustain above $0.09, short-term traders may book profits and that could sink the pair below the moving averages. The pair may then decline to the support near $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-signs-axie-infinity-price-risks-giving-up-its-135-gains-in-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 signs Axie Infinity price risks giving up its 135% gains in January}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to move up gradually but the bears are trying to stall the recovery near $0.38. If the price turns down from the current level, it could slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.33).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/c3caecb3-c69c-4144-8c7e-38d3077e85e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because a strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to overcome the barrier at $0.38. If they are successful, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand in the near term, they will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.29).\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $1.05 on Jan. 21 but the bears did not budge. Although the bears have successfully defended $1.05 in the past few days, they have not been able to tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.93).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/acd03aff-03b4-4a5b-a374-d887870aff93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have a slight edge. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it. If the price turns up from the current level, the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance improve. The MATIC/USDT pair could then jump to $1.16 and thereafter to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will sense an opportunity and try to drag the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the pair may remain stuck inside the $0.69 to $1.05 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Jan. 21 and Jan. 22, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1ffcc2b0-09b3-46ca-b13c-738a645cb182.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That uncertainty resolved to the upside on Jan. 23 with a break above $6.50. If buyers sustain the price above this level, the DOT/USDT pair could first rise to $7.42 and if this level is taken out, the rally could touch $8. The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($5.63). Sellers will have to sink the price below this support if they want to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvOGMzMjk5MzItODYzMS00Nzg2LThmMjUtOTBlOTk3ODYxYjNhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230123ej1n000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,750 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market turns green after traders ignored the Genesis bankruptcy news by piling back into Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets are on track to finish the week in the red but that has not resulted in a deeper loss for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). The news of cryptocurrency lender {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-lender-genesis-files-for-bankruptcy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Genesis filing for Chapter 11 bankruptcy}}}\uc2  also did not have any meaningful impact on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price. This shows that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 However, trading firm QCP Capital warned in the latest edition of its regular markets newsletter that the current recovery in Bitcoin was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-can-pass-30k-before-setting-new-bear-market-low-forecast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 only a bear market relief rally}}}\uc2 . They anticipate this recovery to be followed by another bout of selling which could sink the price of Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below their 2022 low. QCP used the Elliott Wave analysis to arrive at this conclusion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/38978030-9a7a-4a2a-8840-11b5bf218409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After an extended bear phase, the price action always climbs a wall of worry during the initial days of a new bull market. At that time, several analysts remain in disbelief as they keep expecting the price to move lower but traders could catch a change in trend if they keep an eye on the formation of higher highs and higher lows.\par \par \uc2 Are Bitcoin and select altcoins showing signs of a bottom formation? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has been trading in a tight range between $20,400 and $21,650 for the past few days. Usually, a tight consolidation near a stiff resistance is a positive sign as it shows that traders are not rushing to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/922701ba-2bf2-4e65-b870-43620e0e476c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will have to drive and sustain the price above $21,650 to signal the resumption of the up-move. The BTC/USDT pair could then start its journey toward $25,211.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears do not allow the price to rise above $21,650, several traders who may have purchased at lower levels could be tempted to book profits. The selling could magnify on a break below $20,400.\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average ($19,268). If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $21,650 but if the 20-day EMA cracks, the correction could extend to $18,388.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The sellers tried to start a deeper correction in Ether but the bulls purchased the dip near $1,500 on Jan. 18. This shows that the bulls are buying on minor pullbacks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/03d2497a-556c-460b-a5fe-2e49734231bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the price above the overhead resistance zone between $1,610 and $1,680. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could move to $1,800. This level may again act as a barrier but if bulls overcome it, the pair could reach $2,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to weaken the momentum, they will have to defend the overhead zone and yank the price below $1,500. The pair could then slide to the 20-day EMA ($1,428), which may attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($281) on Jan. 19 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the momentum as higher levels are attracting sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/082cea54-a36f-4db5-9474-58a686b85552.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The zone between the 20-day EMA and the 50-day SMA ($268) is an important one to keep an eye on because if the price turns up from it, the bulls will again try to thrust the BNB/USDT pair above $318. If they do that, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it could clear the path for a possible drop to $240 and later to $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) found support at the moving averages on Jan. 18 and turned up on Jan. 19. This indicates strong buying at the 20-day EMA ($0.37).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/250d2b5d-c6b3-4ca1-84e8-cf94da5f02ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to maintain the tempo and push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.42. This is a key level for the bears to defend because if it gets taken out, the XRP/USDT pair could surge to $0.51 as there is no major obstacle in between.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans as they will again try to pull the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the pair could plummet to the support line where buying may emerge.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the support line of the flag pattern on Jan. 19, which is a positive sign. Buyers will try to propel the price above the flag to signal the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/2f470b51-c131-414a-89bb-d0d4b8d1a72b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On a break above the flag, the bears may mount a strong defense at $0.37 but if bulls overcome this barrier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar to $0.44. This level may again prove to be a sticking point for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the flag. That could attract further selling from short-term traders and the pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.29).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to kick Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above $0.09 on Jan. 18 but the bears aggressively protected the level as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4210ee1b-0ff1-4c16-97cb-aec714e46911.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls held the 20-day EMA ($0.08) support on the downside but the weak bounce on Jan. 19 and Jan. 20 indicates hesitation to buy aggressively. This may embolden the bears who will try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the pair could tumble to the strong support near $0.07. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint indicate a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their advantage, they will have to clear the hurdle at $0.09. The pair could then start its northward march to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside the large range between $0.69 and $1.05. Generally, in a well-established range, traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/ce8b084a-dc3e-4537-8ee0-66d7ad2048e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That is what happened with the MATIC/USDT pair which turned down from the overhead resistance at $1.05. The first line of support is at the 20-day EMA ($0.90). Buyers held this level on Jan. 19 but they will need to propel the price above $1.05 to start a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bears on a break below the 50-day SMA ($0.86).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-eyes-21-4k-zone-as-analyst-predicts-btc-price-will-chase-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin eyes $21.4K zone as analyst predicts BTC price will chase gold}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) sprung back from the 20-day EMA ($81) on Jan. 19, indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/661216aa-f3d9-4194-9d85-9acc57d06d53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the price to $91 where they may run into strong resistance by the bears. If the bulls bulldoze their way above $91, the LTC/USDT pair could accelerate and reach the psychologically important level of $100 and then $107.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the bounce fizzles out and does not rise above $91. That could increase the likelihood of a break below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then collapse to the breakout level of $75.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) continues to witness a see-saw battle near the downtrend line. This indicates that lower levels are attracting buyers but the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/bdd5812e-9ee6-40f6-987c-2fcb05770160.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($5.34) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the uncertainty may resolve in favor of the bulls. The buyers will have to thrust the price above $6.53 to take charge. If they can pull it off, the DOT/USDT pair could soar to $7.42 and thereafter to $8.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and dives below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears have overpowered the bulls. That could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($5).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line on Jan. 14 but the bears failed to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($14.72). This suggests that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/94387ec7-6616-4e4a-b3bd-d11d91912e0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will make one more attempt to drive the price above the resistance line. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $22 and thereafter to $24. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be negated in the short term if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA. That could attract further selling and the pair could then extend its decline to the 50-day SMA ($13.09).\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvNmM4YTFkMTctN2UxMS00NTVlLWIyZGQtYTBlZWM3MWVhNzRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230120ej1k000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After rallying for several days, Bitcoin and select altcoins are witnessing profit booking and the recent negative newsflow could add to the selling.\par \par \uc2 The United States producer price index (PPI) fell 0.5% for the month, which was much more than the 0.1% decline estimated by economists surveyed by Dow Jones. The largest monthly decline since April 2020 was also aided by a sharp drop in energy prices.\par \par \uc2 Another report showed that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-new-4-month-high-as-us-ppi-retail-data-posts-big-misses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 retail sales data}}}\uc2  dropped 1.1% in December, a tad bit more than the anticipated 1% decrease.\par \par \uc2 Although both data points show inflation is cooling off, the U.S. stock markets failed to hold on to their initial gains. Similarly, several cryptocurrencies sold off from their intraday highs, indicating that traders may have booked profits ahead of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s meeting on Feb. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/41fdc7ed-fc57-4280-80c5-85c5c5e9d162.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong crypto recovery in the past few days has seen traders return to the fore. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-strength-intensifies-as-risk-loving-traders-bring-volume-back-to-the-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading volume soared 114% over seven days}}}\uc2 . Strong volume accompanied by a sharp rise in prices usually indicates aggressive buying by the bulls. This increases the likelihood that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s November low at $15,476 may not be breached.\par \par \uc2 How far could Bitcoin and altcoins correct and what are the important support levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the overhead resistance of $21,480 on Jan. 17 and Jan. 18 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlesticks. This shows that the bears are protecting the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/5c7c9411-3abe-4cf7-9cb6-f857ac8804a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain above the overhead resistance may attract profit-booking by short-term traders. That could start a short-term correction in the BTC/USDT pair. The first strong support is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $19,489.\par \par \uc2 If the price springs back from this level, it will suggest that shallow dips are attracting buyers. The bulls will then again attempt to thrust the price above $21,480. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the up-move to $25,000.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be invalidated if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average ($18,865).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The $1,600 level in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has proven to be a formidable resistance for the bulls. Although buyers managed to break above this resistance, they could not achieve a close above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/292acdc7-58eb-473a-badd-a01124a3825f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could start a pullback that could reach the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,439 and then the 20-day EMA ($1,400).\par \par \uc2 This zone could entice buyers who may have missed the bus previously. That could result in a retest of the $1,600 resistance. If this level is scaled on a closing basis, the pair could soar to $1,800 and then make a dash to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to invalidate this positive view, they will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) retreated from the overhead resistance of $318 on Jan. 14 and reached the 20-day EMA ($280) on Jan. 18. Buyers bought this dip with vigor as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/3ea061ea-3da7-4b36-b034-f905034ff7d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to build upon this momentum and catapult the price above the overhead resistance at $318. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could march toward $338. The bears may mount a strong defense at this level but if bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could skyrocket to $400.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate inside the large range between $250 and $338 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down and slipped to the moving averages on Jan. 18 but the long tail on the candlestick indicates aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/eb30e609-b67c-4ed8-85ab-c4e65245c95d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls could prevail. A break and close above $0.42 could start an up-move that may hit the overhead resistance at $0.51. This level may again attract selling but if bulls pierce this resistance, the rally could stretch to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the bulls from launching the price higher, they will have to pull and sustain the XRP/USDT pair back below the moving averages.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  flag trading pattern in the past few days. If buyers propel the price above the flag, it will point to a possible resumption of the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/c57986b8-74a6-4ab9-bf17-90bb4af5a943.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first surge to $0.44 and thereafter to the psychologically crucial level of $0.50. Such a move will suggest that the downtrend may have ended.\par \par \uc2 The bears may not want that to happen. They will try to pull the price below the flag. If they manage to do that, the pair could slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.31). If the price rebounds off this level with strength, buyers will again try to overcome the obstacle at $0.37.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the moving averages could tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery faced rejection near $0.09 on Jan. 14 and again on Jan. 18, which shows that the bears have not given up and are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/0b46e8af-aec7-4589-b166-11e1a639cf63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the moving averages on Jan. 18 but have failed to sustain the lower levels. The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($0.08) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have a slight edge. Buyers will try to kick the price above $0.09 and start the northward march toward $0.11.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price closes below the moving averages, the DOGE/USDT pair could tumble to the critical support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers again tried to thrust Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $1.05 on Jan. 16 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/00f5e7ed-9703-4325-930a-3dae8ffd8ac7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure to clear the overhead hurdle may tempt the short-term traders to book profits. If that happens, the MATIC/USDT pair could slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.90). Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the large range between $0.69 and $1.05 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and pops above $1.05, it will signal the start of a new up-move. The pair could then rally to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-technicals-hint-at-35-gains-versus-bitcoin-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price technicals hint at 35% gains versus Bitcoin in 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) up-move faltered near $91 on Jan. 14 and the bears pulled the price back to the 20-day EMA ($80) on Jan. 18. Buyers are trying to protect the level as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/00d66c46-59c8-4d87-ac98-7d364dd31be2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate a mild advantage to buyers. If the price turns up and climbs above $91, the LTC/USDT pair could soar to $100 and then to $107.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slides below the 20-day EMA, the pair could reach the breakout level of $75. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if this support cracks, the pair could plunge to $65.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the downtrend line for the past few days, indicating a tussle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4d8dd92e-9822-414b-a2f1-a1cc8524d26a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.24) has started to turn up and the RSI is near the overbought territory indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive the price above $6.53, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum and travel to $7.42 and thereafter to $8.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and slips below $5.60, it will signal that bears are trying to make a comeback. The sellers will come out on top if they manage to sink the pair below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the downtrend line on Jan. 11, indicating a potential trend change. The bears have not yet given up as they are trying to stall the up-move at $18.54.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1880191a-6f8f-432c-a7c6-620908e14e01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($14.42) indicates advantage to buyers but the RSI in the overbought zone suggests a few days of consolidation or a minor correction in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $15.50, the AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a bounce off it could increase the likelihood of a rally to $20.63. The bears will gain the upper hand if the pair plummets below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvYTFkNGVlNzgtMzg5OC00YjMzLWEwODgtZmNmNGYwM2Q2NDIzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230118ej1i000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/17: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin chart shows some indecision among traders, but if the DXY index continues to show weakness, altcoins could extend their current uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Risk assets have started the new year on a strong note. The S&P 500 (SPX) and the Nasdaq closed in the positive for the second successive week and also notched their best weekly performance since November.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) led the recovery in the crypto markets with a sharp 21% rally last week. That sent the Bitcoin Fear and Greed Index into the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-steps-out-of-fear-for-the-first-time-in-nine-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 neutral territory of 52 on Jan. 15}}}\uc2 , its highest since April 5, 2022. However, the index has given back its gains and is again back into the Fear zone on Jan. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/c907859d-17ea-46f7-8698-0fce5d8588c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rally in Bitcoin has divided analysts' opinions. While some expect the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-breakout-or-bull-trap-5k-twitter-users-weigh-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally to be a bull trap}}}\uc2 , others believe that the up-move could be the start of a new bull market. The confirmation of the same will happen during the next dip. If the cryptocurrencies form a higher low followed by a higher high, it will suggest that the downtrend could be over.\par \par \uc2 Could the S&P 500 extend its rally? What are the critical levels on BTC and the cryptocurrencies to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 continued its recovery last week and has reached the downtrend line. The 20-day exponential moving average (3,904) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/53643a9f-9b6c-47d4-907b-07a08bf21a52.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to thrust and sustain the price above the downtrend line to signal a potential trend change. The bears may try to stall the up-move in the 4,100 to 4,120 zone but if bulls overcome this resistance, the index could rally to 4,200 and then 4,325.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent this change in trend, they will have to quickly pull the price below the moving averages. If they do that, it will suggest that higher levels are attracting sellers. The index could then slide to 3,764.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) has been falling inside a descending broadening wedge pattern for the past few days. Buyers are trying to protect the support line of the wedge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/e96fa9db-0348-4ba6-a438-2667f9ce4e84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally could reach the 20-day EMA (103), which could act as a strong barrier. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on minor rallies. The bears will then try to resume the downtrend and sink the price to the psychological support at 100.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the index could march toward the resistance line of the wedge. The 50-day SMA (105) is placed close to the resistance line, hence the bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to pierce the overhead resistance at $21,480 and extend the recovery in Bitcoin but the bears are in no mood to relent. The RSI remains in deeply overbought territory, indicating a possible consolidation or correction in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/d63115cf-1e19-491b-a1c6-f5a4649f3e76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is the psychological level of $20,000 and then the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $19,489. If the price turns up from this zone, it will suggest that traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will then make one more attempt to drive the price above $21,500. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could start the next leg of the up-move. The pair could then rise to $22,800 and later make a dash to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price breaks below $19,489, the pair could plummet to the breakout level of $18,388.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery met with strong resistance at $1,600 on Jan. 14 but the bulls are not ceding ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls expect the up-move to continue after a brief pause.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/99f1e7bf-5a14-4705-8808-1aada9601ec2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price consolidates in a tight range near $1,600, it will enhance the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. The ETH/USDT pair could then climb to $1,700 and later to $1,800.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $1,516, the pair could witness profit booking. The pair could then slump to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $1,439 and thereafter to the 20-day EMA ($1,362). This zone could attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) reached the overhead resistance at $318 on Jan. 14. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are trying to protect the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/63d93275-9e9a-453e-87aa-354b66916dab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the rising 20-day EMA ($276) and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bulls will strive to drive the BNB/USDT pair to $338. A break above this resistance could signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may stay inside the range between $220 and $320 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) soared above the triangle and the moving averages on Jan. 11 but the bulls have failed to start a strong up-move. This shows a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1c91e217-3df2-4370-b3af-79d4a6c1f0e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Jan. 16 candlestick shows that bears are selling near the overhead resistance at $0.42. If the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will keep the pair stuck between $0.32 and $0.42 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to keep their chances alive, they will have to aggressively buy the pullback to the 20-day EMA ($0.36). If the price rebounds off this level, the XRP/USDT pair could retest $0.42. If this level gets taken out, the pair could soar to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the 50-day SMA ($0.08) on Jan. 13 but the bulls could not capitalize on this strength. The long wick on the Jan. 14 candlestick shows that bears are selling above $0.09.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/3d1cceaa-654d-42df-af41-438fa868ed42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, it will point to a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will indicate a shift in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to drive the price above $0.09 and catapult the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.11. This level may again act as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-see-25k-by-march-2023-as-u-s-dollar-prints-death-cross-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could see $25K by March 2023 as US dollar prints \u8216\'20\'18death cross\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Analysis}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The strong relief rally in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is facing profit-booking near $0.37. The overbought levels on the RSI point to a minor correction or consolidation in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f0aac641-a938-4392-ab8f-d00a77301cf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could turn down and slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.30). If buyers want to continue the recovery, they will have to defend this level aggressively. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $0.37. The pair could then continue its northward march toward $0.44.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages. Such a move will imply that bears are back in command.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) touched the $1.05 overhead resistance level on Jan. 14 but the long wick on the candlestick indicates that the short-term traders may have booked profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/2b5a322d-417e-4222-a5be-c14759496b3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers again tried to overcome the obstacle on Jan. 16 but the bears thwarted their attempts as seen from the long wick on the candlestick. The sellers will try to pull the price down to the moving averages, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If the price springs back from the moving averages, it will indicate that lower levels are attracting buyers. The bulls will then try to kick the price above $1.05. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair could surge to $1.30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price collapses below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the $0.69 to $1.05 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the downtrend line on Jan. 14 but higher levels seem to have attracted selling as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/7c951642-3079-4787-8127-5b4a9569f57f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Jan. 15, which resolved to the downside on Jan. 16. This suggests that the failure to sustain above the downtrend line may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $5.40 and below that is the 20-day EMA ($5.10). If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls may again try to push and sustain the pair above the downtrend line. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up above $6.50 while the bears may be back in control if the pair dives below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvZmUxMGZmYzgtNzcxNy00MjAzLTkxY2ItYWNjMTRjMjJkZmU3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230117ej1h000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,747 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong buying in Bitcoin and select altcoins has pushed their prices above the most immediate resistance levels, indicating accumulation at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above $19,000 on Jan. 12, the highest level since Nov. 8. Although a bull market may not start in a hurry, Glassnode data suggests that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/13-of-btc-supply-returns-to-profit-as-bitcoin-sees-massive-accumulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 foundation for a macro bottom in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  may be in place. The on-chain analytics firm tweeted on Jan. 12 that \u8220\'20\'1C13% of the Circulating Supply\u8221\'20\'1D returned to profit when Bitcoin rallied to $18,200. This suggests a large phase of accumulation took place in the $16,500 to $18,200 range.\par \par \uc2 Along with Bitcoin, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is also witnessing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-shark-accumulation-shanghai-hard-fork-put-2k-eth-price-in-play"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signs of accumulation}}}\uc2 . The number of Ethereum sharks, holding between 100 and 10,000 Ether, has risen by 3,000 since November 22, according to Santiment data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/6ca88868-7c59-4b5d-b665-8a010dfa7d39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Many times, traders miss a bottom because they remain in denial. If traders want to catch a trend early, they should keep a close eye on the price action because a sequence of higher highs and higher lows may indicate a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Are Bitcoin and altcoins showing signs of starting a new uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is on the path of recovery. Strong buying by the bulls propelled the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $18,388 on Jan. 12. This is the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/e6f0b4b4-7b0a-442d-b10e-753637a36389.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into overbought territory, signaling a possible correction or consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not allow the price to dip below the breakout level of $18,388, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The BTC/USDT pair could then continue its recovery toward the next major resistance at $21,500.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to slow down the positive momentum, they will have to quickly pull the price back below $18,388. The pair could then drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($17,378).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether soared above the overhead resistance of $1,352 on Jan. 11 and followed that up with a break above the downtrend line on Jan. 12. This suggests that the bulls are on a strong comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/48e4020d-b2b7-475a-8ca9-b7943d8fc79f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to stall the recovery and pull the price back below the breakout level of $1,352. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($1,292). A strong bounce off this level will suggest that traders are buying the dips. That could improve the prospects of a rally toward $1,700. This level may again act as a strong hurdle.\par \par \uc2 The positive view could invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages. Such a move could indicate that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($268) on Jan. 10 and continued its northward march. The price is nearing $300 where the bears may mount a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/55468a6d-6fe3-4582-acd9-f7efee495b49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($266) and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the price turns down from $300, it is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA ($266). A strong bounce off this level could catapult the BNB/USDT pair to the $318 to $338 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and slides below the moving averages, the pair could retest the $250 to $236 support zone.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.37) on June 12 but the bulls successfully defended the breakout level from the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/eabc69f1-4e00-4c76-bd95-1a2134ff0401.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.35) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will try to drive the price above $0.38 and extend the up-move to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to sustain above the 50-day SMA ($0.37), the bears will again try to pull the XRP/USDT pair back into the triangle. If they do that, the pair could tumble to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back into the wedge on Jan. 11 but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/758915f6-2787-49b8-b722-0c0b1d803c47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has continued its up-move, which has pushed the RSI into the overbought territory. This suggests that the rally may be overheated in the near term and the pair could enter a short-term correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level but rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.29), it will suggest demand at lower levels. Buyers will then again try to clear the hurdle at $0.35 and launch a rally to $0.38 and later to $0.44. The bears will have to yank the price below the moving averages to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Jan. 11 and 12 but the bulls held their ground. Buyers are trying to kick the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.08) on Jan. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/72a58207-e156-401d-bfc2-3a00d3e25174.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could pick up pace and start a rally toward $0.11. This level may witness strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down sharply from it, there is a possibility that the pair may stay range-bound between $0.07 and $0.11 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and tumbles below the 20-day EMA. That will suggest a negative sentiment and may keep the pair stuck between the 50-day SMA and $0.07 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) Jan. 12 candlestick shows that traders are buying the dips to the moving averages. Buyers will try to push the price to $0.97, which may act as a roadblock.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/7211f15e-0aa2-4f45-905c-511a8593fc6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.84) has started to turn up and the RSI is near 67, signaling that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the bulls do not give up much ground from $0.97, the MATIC/USDT pair could continue its up-move and touch $1.05.\par \par \uc2 As the pair has been stuck inside the large range between $0.69 and $1.05 for the past several days, the bears may sell aggressively near the resistance. On the downside, a drop below the moving averages could tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the sellers.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-wants-to-retest-2017-all-time-high-near-20k-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price wants to retest 2017 all-time high near $20K \u8212\'20\'14 analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After facing resistance at $85 for a few days, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) soared above the level on Jan. 12. However, the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/2ddbe545-b888-4413-8cb0-09985f8240e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price falls and closes below $85, it will suggest that the bears have not yet given up. The sellers will then try to sink the price to the 20-day EMA ($77).\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because a strong rebound off it will suggest that the sentiment is positive and traders are buying on pullbacks. The bulls will then again attempt to thrust the LTC/USDT pair above the overhead resistance and resume the uptrend toward $100.\par \par \uc2 The bears will gain the upper hand if they drag the price below the 50-day SMA ($74). That could open the doors for a decline to $61.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to halt Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery at the 50-day SMA ($4.92) on Jan. 9 and 10 but the bulls did not surrender. They bulldozed their way above the resistance on Jan. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/c35c209c-bd54-43c6-9e9e-e8ecf24e659c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair will try to touch the downtrend line. The sellers have halted recovery attempts near the downtrend line on three previous occasions, hence they will try to repeat their performance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance but turns up from the moving averages, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to propel the pair above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price turns lower and plummets below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) reached close to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on Jan. 12 but the bulls could not clear this hurdle. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/02ba4b68-4406-46cf-8dcf-24806ff434e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.62) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that buyers have a slight edge. If the price springs back from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the UNI/USDT pair above the triangle. If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a new up-move that could reach $7.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slumps below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain stuck inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvYTM0NDQwMTgtMjFkMi00OWU2LWJkZTAtZDZjM2E5YWJhYWM1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230113ej1d000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/11: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,825 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 U.S. consumer price index data will be released on January 12 and investors are hopeful that positive print will extend the current rally in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Crypto and stock markets are usually forward-looking. Meaning, traders tend to ignore the near-term negatives and focus on the positives down the line. With Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) next halving in 2024, analysts are shifting their attention to this event.\par \par \uc2 Independent market analyst Rekt Capital highlighted this unique market dynamic in 2015 and 2019, a year before halving, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gained-300-in-year-before-last-halving-is-2023-different"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin rallied 234% and 316% respectively}}}\uc2 . If history repeats itself, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action may spring a surprise in 2023.\par \par \uc2 However, the near term remains uncertain and the Consumer Price Index (CPI) data on Jan. 12 may lead to a sharp uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Some analysts are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-taps-17-5k-as-traders-in-disbelief-doubt-crypto-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 skeptical of the growing dominance of altcoin}}}\uc2  trading volume, which is above 50%. According to CryptoQuant contributor Maartunn, the altcoin dominance warns of \u8220\'20\'1Ca potential risk for further downside.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/41cabacf-cdf4-4481-9df6-87bad632f6e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 One event that is being closely tracked is the crisis brewing at the \uc2 Digital Currency Group\uc2  (\uc2 DCG\uc2 ). \uc2 Galaxy Digital Holdings\uc2  CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2 , in an interview with CNBC on Jan. 10, said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/it-ll-be-ok-dcg-crisis-likely-won-t-include-a-lot-of-selling-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DCG, Genesis and Gemini overhang}}}\uc2  could \u8220\'20\'1Cplay out in the next quarter\u8221\'20\'1D Though it is \u8220\'20\'1Cnot going to be great,\u8221\'20\'1D Novogratz does not believe it will trigger \u8220\'20\'1Ca lot of selling.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins continue their recovery or will higher levels attract strong selling? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall the recovery near $17,400 on Jan. 9 but they could not sink the price below $17,061. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips. The price bounced on Jan. 10 and the buyers are trying to extend the relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/8bcc921c-858b-4f8f-9f42-7026cc0fc357.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($16,982) has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) is above 66, indicating that bulls are in control. The BTC/USDT pair could climb to $17,850 and if this level is scaled, the next stop may be $18,388.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may continue to oscillate between $16,256 and $18,388 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the overhead resistance of $1,352 for the past two days. The 20-day EMA ($1,261) has started to turn up and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/8a6f4448-ee24-4f8e-be3b-c32065db722a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers catapult the price above $1,352 and the downtrend line, it will suggest a potential trend change. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to $1,700 and if this level is scaled, the next stop could be $1,800. The bears are likely to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could again drop to the moving averages. If this support cracks, it will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action between $1,352 and $1,150 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $283 on Jan. 9 but the bears could not yank the price below the 50-day SMA ($269). This suggests that the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/57a43c45-106d-47ff-960e-aabef184847c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to kick the price above the overhead resistance at $283. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could climb to $300 and then to $318. The rising 20-day EMA ($261) and the RSI in the positive zone, indicate that the bulls have the edge.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the moving averages. The pair could then decline to the $250 to $236 support zone. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend this level because the failure to do so may result in a decline to $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading inside the symmetrical triangle for the past several days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has made a strong move higher on Jan. 11. The bulls have pushed the price above the triangle and the 50-day SMA ($0.37).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/20108ec4-b663-40a0-845d-ed922a6ca2b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the triangle, the possibility of a rally to $0.42 increases. This level may act as a major obstacle but if buyers overcome it, the XRP/USDT pair could soar to $0.51. The RSI has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that the momentum favors the buyers.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to stop the up-move, they will have to quickly pull the price back into the triangle. The pair could then decline to the 20-day EMA ($0.35) and subsequently to the support line.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line of the falling wedge pattern on Jan. 9 and 10 but the bulls could not build upon the advantage. This suggests hesitation to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4a668d2d-947a-4589-b98d-e412bd8b56b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to yank the price back into the wedge on Jan. 11. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off it suggests aggressive buying at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to drive the pair above $0.35. If this hurdle is crossed, the pair could attempt an up-move to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and slumps below the moving averages, it will suggest that the breakout above the wedge may have been a bull trap. The pair could then fall to $0.26 and later to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to thrust Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.08 on Jan. 9 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are fiercely guarding the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a1865248-539a-4e7a-94c6-8886971cbeeb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a range-bound action in the near term. The DOGE/USDT pair could then trade between $0.08 and $0.07 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 50-day SMA ($0.08). If that happens, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could then soar to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 50-day SMA ($0.84) since Jan. 9, which is a positive sign. This suggests that the bulls are trying to flip the moving averages into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/953b5062-1411-4d71-a26a-a0118d2924fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.81) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls propel the price above $0.88, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.97. This level may act as a major obstacle but if bulls overcome it, the rally could touch $1.05.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could fall to the 20-day EMA. If this support gives way, the pair could extend the decline to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-rally-risks-exhaustion-after-sol-s-120-pump-in-two-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana price rally risks exhaustion after SOL's 120% pump in two weeks}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance near the overhead resistance at $85 but the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the buyers are not booking profits as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/4626c1d2-d096-461b-a4e5-bf1ff7ea833f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the overbought territory, indicating that bulls are in command. If buyers thrust the price above $85, the LTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the psychologically important level of $100.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or fails to sustain above $85, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off this support will suggest that the bulls are buying the dips. That could result in a retest of $85 but if the price slides below the moving averages, the pair could tumble to $61.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day SMA ($4.92) on Jan. 9 but the higher levels attracted sellers as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f63c2b69-186f-4037-abcb-4df84a5be2dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the price dipped back below the 50-day SMA, the bears have not been able to drag the DOT/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($4.70). This suggests that the bulls are not rushing to the exit and will again try to drive the pair above $5.10.. If they can pull it off, the pair could soar to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then fall toward the crucial support at $4.22.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for a few days, Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($5.58) on Jan. 8. This indicates that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/a1a3cd25-8ce7-49e4-a4ad-c127807494c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The UNI/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. The bears may again try to halt the recovery at this level. If the price turns down from this resistance but rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that traders are buying on dips. That could increase the likelihood of a break above the triangle. The pair could then start an up-move toward $7.8.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the resistance line and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvZTkwZmZjZDEtOWQwMC00OTFiLWFhN2YtZDc2YmRkYjY2N2Q4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230111ej1b000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 5 signs that an altcoin bull run could be underway\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nivesh Rustgi \par \uc2 1,282 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Record-low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and investors\u8217\'20\'19 hope that inflation is trending down is translating to some new crypto trading opportunities.\par \par \uc2 While 2022 ended on a grim note with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/macroeconomic-data-points-toward-intensifying-pain-for-crypto-investors-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 macro headwinds}}}\uc2  providing little hope of a revival in 2023, the start of a new year has surprised bears with a surge in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and altcoin prices. The period of sparse \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the crypto market appears to be ending with a breakout to the upside.\par \par \uc2 The increase has been particularly striking in some altcoins such as Lido (LIDO), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). The primary factors promoting the spike in these coins are the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-shanghai-upgrade-could-supercharge-liquid-staking-derivatives-here-s-how"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upcoming Ethereum Shanghai update}}}\uc2  (for LIDO) and the negative funding rate in the futures market, especially for \uc2 SOL\uc2 . The negative rates implies that most traders are holding short positions, giving an opportunity for whale buyers to run their stop losses. Funding rates for some other tokens remain exposed to a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the new year has also seen the re-emergence of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/glossary/degen"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 degen}}}\uc2  gambling that had taken a back seat after the collapse of FTX in November. A memecoin price surge is evidence of the residual degen spirit. Technically, the total market capitalization of altcoins has surpassed a key technical resistance level as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum builds.\par \par \uc2 While the sustainability of the bull run is questionable due to the broader trend remaining \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the fledgling uptrend could still bring some pain for late sellers. The five primary factors influencing altcoin prices are:\par \par \uc2 Job market data revives the hope of a soft landing\par \par \uc2 Defying Dow Jones estimates for an additional 200,000 nonfarm payrolls added in December and market expectations of a slowdown, the labor market report showed tha230,000 were added, a 0.2% increase in employment.\par \par \uc2 A strong jobs market goes against the prevalent recession claims and acts as a catalyst for a risk-on rally. The Consumer Price Index (CPI) reading for December coming out on Jan. 12 will be instrumental in either building on the newfound \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment or returning to negative sentiments.\par \par \uc2 If inflation continued its downtrend, with December\u8217\'20\'19s CPI print below 7.7%, then the market's confidence in a soft landing could increase. However, if inflation rose in December, then the chances of a higher rate hike in the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting toward the end of January increase, risking a steep correction.\par \par \uc2 Traders hunt for perpetual swaps with negative funding rates\par \par \uc2 As the spot trading {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-bear-market-is-far-from-over-but-data-points-to-improving-investor-sentiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 volume and liquidity on cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  exchanges dried up toward the year-end, especially during the holiday season, futures markets gained more influence in moving the prices. A contrarian price reaction against a crowded trade position is highly likely.\par \par \uc2 Solana's latest surge in prices is clear evidence of short-squeeze driving prices. Over the weekend, $200 million in \uc2 SOL\uc2  shorts were liquidated as its price surged over 27% from the Jan. 6 low of $13. According to independent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1612312815167209472"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market analyst}}}\uc2  Alex Kruger, \u8220\'20\'1CSOL still has room to go but the outperformance phase is mostly behind.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/424ab45e-920a-4a5f-9f9c-ee31970c4d8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Funding rate for \uc2 SOL\uc2  perpetual swaps. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 While Solana\u8217\'20\'19s pump might be close to over, the majority of traders are still net short on numerous altcoins like Apecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/apecoin-ape-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 APE}}}\uc2  ), Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ) and Gala Games ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/gala-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GALA}}}\uc2  ). This provides an opportunity for buyers to push the price up and hunt the stop-loss liquidity of perpetual swap sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/6a2c8d41-cd8f-485c-84ba-726016e457d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Funding rate for altcoins across crypto exchanges. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Meme coins pump, then dump\par \par \uc2 In the first week of January, a Solana-based memecoin named BONK experienced a whopping 25x surge. The rise symbolized the degenerate gambling spirit that was prevalent during the 2021 to 2022 bull run. Bear markets, on the other hand, tend to promote caution among traders.\par \par \uc2 Despite BONK\u8217\'20\'19s eventual price collapse, the successful pump-and-dump playout of meme coins like it suggest that some traders are still indulging in high-risk plays.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/68b8deca-72a9-44bb-9318-bb624d961eb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BONK price chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 Positive technical breakout\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization broke above the 50-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $465 billion. Buyers will likely target the 100-day EMA at $563 billion \u8212\'20\'14 an expected average 20% gain across the tokens. Technical traders would look to tap these key levels before reversal begins.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength indicator (RSI) for altcoin market capitalization also moved into \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory, increasing above the 60-point resistance. Furthermore, if buyers build support above the 50-day EMA with positive volumes, the short-term uptrend could extend toward the end of Q1 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/cca4afef-bf59-4adf-9343-edb56ed06939.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market capitalization (excluding Bitcoin). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1f541e50-3f84-4460-a5b1-62590ed67bf8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://voting.cointelegraph.com/top-100/p/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cast your vote now!}}}\par \par \uc2 Historical trends and positive sentiment spike\par \par \uc2 The sustainability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  altcoin run is questionable, especially since the underlying trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It\u8217\'20\'19s difficult to identify the fundamental catalyst supporting this bull run, and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price trades below its resistance of between $18,200 and $19,000. Thus, the uptrend will likely fade as buyers get exhausted.\par \par \uc2 If we look at previous crypto cycles, altcoins outperformed Bitcoin in a bull run, and the following cooldown period saw a cross-over with Bitcoin leading the crypto market gains.\par \par \uc2 The recent parabolic run of 2021 played out similarly, with altcoins outperforming Bitcoin. However, the correction period hasn\u8217\'20\'19t seen a wipeout of the altcoin market relative to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Both altcoin market capitalization and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price have lost 75% of their value from the peak, as opposed to altcoin losses surpassing Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/12b1cba2-b0ae-4d6f-b0f2-97d21ed1ffd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins outperform Bitcoin during bull markets. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 An exception to the above rule can be due to Ether\u8217\'20\'19s increasing dominance in the market. Ethereum has maintained its market dominance of around 20% with technical breakthroughs such as the shift to an energy-friendly proof-of-stake mechanism and reduced inflation supporting its price strongly despite the negative trend. Still, a deeper correction in the broader altcoin market capitalization cannot be ruled out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/37866838-c4ec-47a1-a64e-85b1fc635fcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (orange) and Ethereum (blue) dominance over the crypto market. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Lately, social media circles have witnessed a revival of positive sentiment. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://santiment.net/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santiment}}}\uc2  data shows that the social media mentions of keywords like \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cbottom\u8221\'20\'1D spiked on platforms like \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , Reddit, and Telegram. Usually, a positive sentiment spike is a top indicator suggesting a reversal of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f154cc7f-7fc4-4673-86d7-b322a005ff8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Social media volume for \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cbottom\u8221\'20\'1D key words. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 One of the first hurdles will be supporting the price after a wipeout of short orders. Being two of the first tokens to surge, Solana and Cardano could provide clues that point toward the end of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 If the price of \uc2 SOL\uc2  breaks below support at $14.33 with a simultaneous drop below $0.30 for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it could be a warning sign of the bull\u8217\'20\'19s exhaustion.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, tokens like LIDO that benefit from the liquid staking derivative narrative could continue to rise until Ethereum core developers implement the Shanghai upgrade. Macro market movers such as the CPI print and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action will also play a crucial role in sustaining an altcoin bull run.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvZDZjNGM1ODgtOTBmMy00NGJlLTk4M2YtMGZiMDVlMDFmOGI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230111ej1a0000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 5 signs that an altcoin bull run could be underway\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nivesh Rustgi \par \uc2 1,279 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Record-low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and investors' hope that inflation is trending down is translating to some new crypto trading opportunities.\par \par \uc2 While 2022 ended on a grim note with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/macroeconomic-data-points-toward-intensifying-pain-for-crypto-investors-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 macro headwinds}}}\uc2  providing little hope of a revival in 2023, the start of a new year has surprised bears with a surge in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and altcoin prices. The period of sparse \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the crypto market appears to be ending with a breakout on the upside.\par \par \uc2 The increase has been particularly striking in some altcoins such as Lido (LIDO), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). The primary factors promoting the spike in these coins are the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-shanghai-upgrade-could-supercharge-liquid-staking-derivatives-here-s-how"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upcoming Ethereum Shanghai update}}}\uc2  (for LIDO) and the negative funding rate in the futures market, especially for \uc2 SOL\uc2 . The negative rates implies that most traders are holding short positions, giving an opportunity for whale buyers to run their stop losses. Funding rates for some other tokens remain exposed to a short squeeze.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the new year has also seen the re-emergence of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/glossary/degen"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 degen}}}\uc2  gambling that had taken a back seat after the FTX collapse in November 2022. A meme coin price surge is evidence of the residual degen spirit. Technically, the total market capitalization of altcoins has surpassed a key technical resistance level as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum builds.\par \par \uc2 While the sustainability of the bull run is questionable due to the broader trend remaining \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the fledgling uptrend could still bring some pain for late sellers. The five primary factors influencing altcoin prices are:\par \par \uc2 Job market data revives the hope of a soft landing\par \par \uc2 Defying the Dow\u8217\'20\'19s estimate for 200,000 nonfarm payrolls and market expectations of a slowdown, labor market data from December 2022 showed a 230,000 or 0.2% increase in employment.\par \par \uc2 A strong jobs market goes against the prevalent recession claims and acts as a catalyst for a risk-on rally. The consumer inflation price (CPI) reading for December 2022 coming out on Jan. 12 will be instrumental in either building on the newfound \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment or returning to negative sentiments.\par \par \uc2 If inflation continued its downtrend, with December's CPI print below 7.7%, then the market's confidence in a soft-landing could increase. However, if inflation rose in December, then the chances of a higher rate hike in the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting toward the end of January risks a steep correction.\par \par \uc2 Traders hunt for perpetual swaps with negative funding rates\par \par \uc2 As the spot trading {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-bear-market-is-far-from-over-but-data-points-to-improving-investor-sentiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 volume and liquidity on cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  exchanges dried up toward the year-end, especially during the holiday season, futures markets gained more influence in moving the prices. A contrarian price reaction against a crowded trade position is highly likely.\par \par \uc2 Solana's latest surge in prices is clear evidence of short-squeeze driving prices. Over the weekend, $200 million in \uc2 SOL\uc2  shorts were liquidated as its price surged over 27% from Jan. 6 low of $13. According to independent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1612312815167209472"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market analyst}}}\uc2  Alex Kurger, \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 SOL\uc2  still has room to go but the outperformance phase is mostly behind.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/424ab45e-920a-4a5f-9f9c-ee31970c4d8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Funding rate for \uc2 SOL\uc2  perpetual swaps. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 While Solana\u8217\'20\'19s pump might be close to over, the majority of traders are still net short on numerous altcoins like Apecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/apecoin-ape-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 APE}}}\uc2  ), Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ), Bitcoin Cash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-cash-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BCH}}}\uc2  ), and Gala Games ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/gala-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GALA}}}\uc2  ). This provides an opportunity for buyers to push the price up and hunt the stop-loss liquidity of perpetual swap sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/6a2c8d41-cd8f-485c-84ba-726016e457d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Funding rate for altcoins across crypto exchanges. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Meme coins pump, then dump\par \par \uc2 In the first week of January 2023, a Solana-based meme coin named BONK experienced a whooping 25x surge. The rise symbolized the degenerate gambling spirit that was prevalent during the 2021 to 2022 bull run. Bear markets, on the other hand, tend to promote caution among traders.\par \par \uc2 Despite BONK\u8217\'20\'19s eventual price collapse, the successful pump-and-dump playout of meme coins like it suggest that some traders are still indulging in high-risk plays.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/68b8deca-72a9-44bb-9318-bb624d961eb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BONK price chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 Positive technical breakout\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market capitalization broke above the 50-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $465 billion. Buyers will likely target the 100-day EMA at $563 billion\u8212\'20\'14an expected average 20% gain across the tokens. Technical traders would look to tap these key levels before reversal begins.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength indicator (RSI) for altcoin market capitalization also moved into \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory, increasing above the 60-point resistance. Furthermore, if buyers build support above the 50-day EMA with positive volumes, the short-term uptrend could extend toward the end of Q1 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/cca4afef-bf59-4adf-9343-edb56ed06939.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total market capitalization of altcoin (excluding Bitcoin). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/1f541e50-3f84-4460-a5b1-62590ed67bf8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://voting.cointelegraph.com/top-100/p/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cast your vote now!}}}\par \par \uc2 Historical trends and positive sentiment spike\par \par \uc2 The sustainability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  altcoin run is questionable, especially since the underlying trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It\u8217\'20\'19s difficult to identify the fundamental catalyst supporting this bull run, and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price trades below the resistance between $18,200 and $19,000. Thus, the uptrend will likely fade as buyers get exhausted.\par \par \uc2 If we look at previous crypto cycles, altcoins outperformed Bitcoin in a bull run, and the following cooldown period saw a cross-over with Bitcoin leading the crypto market gains.\par \par \uc2 The recent parabolic run of 2021 played out similarly, with altcoins outperforming Bitcoin. However, the correction period hasn\u8217\'20\'19t seen a wipeout of the altcoin market relative to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Both altcoin market capitalization and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price have lost 75% of their value from the peak, as opposed to altcoin losses surpassing Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/12b1cba2-b0ae-4d6f-b0f2-97d21ed1ffd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins outperform Bitcoin during bull markets. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 An exception to the above rule can be due to Ether\u8217\'20\'19s increasing dominance in the market. Ethereum has maintained its market dominance around 20% with technical breakthroughs such as the shift to a energy-friendly proof-of-stake mechanism and reduced inflation supporting its price strongly despite the negative trend. Still, a deeper correction in the broader altcoin market capitalization cannot be ruled out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/37866838-c4ec-47a1-a64e-85b1fc635fcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (orange) Ethereum (blue) dominance over the crypto market. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Lately, social media circles have witnessed a revival of positive sentiment. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://santiment.net/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santiment}}}\uc2  data shows that the social media mentions of keywords like \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cbottom\u8221\'20\'1D spiked on platforms like \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , Reddit, and Telegram. Usually, a positive sentiment spike is a top indicator suggesting a reversal of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f154cc7f-7fc4-4673-86d7-b322a005ff8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Social media volume for \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cbottom\u8221\'20\'1D key words. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 One of the first hurdles will be supporting the price after a wipeout of short orders. Being one of the first tokens to surge, Solana and Cardano could provide clues that point toward the end of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 If the price of \uc2 SOL\uc2  breaks below support at $14.33 with a simultaneous drop below $0.30 for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it could be a warning sign of the bull\u8217\'20\'19s exhaustion.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, tokens like LIDO that benefit from the liquid staking derivative narrative could continue to rise until Ethereum core developers implement the Shanghai upgrade. Macro market movers such as the CPI print and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action will also play a crucial role in sustaining an altcoin bull run.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvZDZjNGM1ODgtOTBmMy00NGJlLTk4M2YtMGZiMDVlMDFmOGI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230110ej1a000e7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,722 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 January 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are rallying toward key resistance levels but do bulls have enough momentum to flip them to support?\par \par \uc2 The United States December nonfarm payrolls report showed a growth of 223,000 jobs, above the market's expectation of an increase of 200,000 jobs. While this shows that the economy remains strong, market observers shifted their focus to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-yo-yos-on-us-macro-data-amid-call-for-btc-price-to-retest-17k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slower wage growth}}}\uc2  of 0.3% for the month, below economists\u8217\'20\'19 expectation of 0.4%.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the euro zone\u8217\'20\'19s headline inflation dropped from 10.1% in November to 9.2% in December. Both economic data boosted hopes that the central bank\u8217\'20\'19s aggressive rate tightening may slow down. This triggered a rally in the U.S. and European stock markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f123d82b-c893-451f-86f8-ab41ce569269.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the reaction in the cryptocurrency space remains muted, with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continuing to trade inside a narrow range. The crypto investors may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/huobi-confirms-20-layoffs-denies-insolvency-rumors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking a cautious approach due to rumors}}}\uc2  about Huobi\u8217\'20\'19s insolvency, which the company\u8217\'20\'19s representative said were untrue.\par \par \uc2 Several analysts believe that the extended period of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin could be followed by an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/big-move-brewing-for-btc-price-bitcoin-may-stay-flat-hints-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increase in \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  but \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2 , the creator of Bollinger Bands, thinks otherwise. Responding to a tweet by Wolf of All Streets podcast host Scott Melker, Bollinger said that \u8220\'20\'1Cprolonged squeezes are rarely valuable signs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Are Bitcoin and altcoins showing signs of a breakout or will they remain stuck inside the range for some more time? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the moving averages on Jan. 4 but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at $17,061. This shows that bears are fiercely defending the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/15d0f0e5-deda-4e88-a878-903a338ff045.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the price tumbled below the moving averages on Jan. 6, the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels. The bulls may make one more attempt to drive the price above $17,061.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $17,854 and then to $18,138.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will indicate that the pair may consolidate in the narrow range of $17,061 to $16,256 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $1,150 and $1,352 for the past few days. The price action inside the range could be random and volatile.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/377958ab-78aa-4b2a-a5f8-bbe8332fd49d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have flattened out but the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. If the price turns up and breaks above $1,272, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1,352.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down and dives back below the moving averages. In that case, the pair could decline to the immediate support at $1,150. This level could witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally at $261 but a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/67cbcb6b-98a6-44fa-a97c-f8472f8884c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average ($252) with strength, the BNB/USDT pair could jump to the 50-day simple moving average ($268). This level may act as a barrier but it is likely to be crossed. The pair could then soar to $300.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price back below $250. If that happens, the $236 support may come under attack. If this level also gives way, the pair could dive to the critical support at $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.35) on Jan. 4 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f52ac0b2-6692-4959-990e-e5f757f6568e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and slumped to the support line of the symmetrical triangle on Jan. 5. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes below the triangle, the XRP/USDT pair could start its downward journey toward the pivotal support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and climbs above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying near the support line. The pair could then reach the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the important support at $0.07 fizzled out at the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Jan. 5. This suggests that bears are selling on every relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/aa5937c9-b4c2-4d8f-82ac-0c91ffb5e19a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has dropped back to the $0.07 support where buyers are mounting a strong defense because if the level breaks down, the DOGE/USDT pair could tumble to $0.06 and thereafter to the vital support near $0.05. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to salvage the situation, they will have to propel the price above the resistance zone between the 20-day EMA and $0.08. That could start a sustained recovery toward $0.11.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) climbed and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Jan. 4 which is the first indication that bulls are attempting a comeback. However, the bears are in no mood to surrender their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/f701e120-822d-408b-9e88-141e1785dc86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Jan. 6 candlestick shows that higher levels are attracting sellers. The bears will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and yank the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair toward the crucial support near $0.24.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the bulls will try to protect the 20-day EMA. If the price turns up from the current level, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.29). This level could again witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.80) on Jan. 4 but the bulls could not sustain the recovery. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Jan. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/35c28089-8c5d-49d9-9353-d4759ac8fbf5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price below the immediate support of $0.75. If they manage to do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could drop to the support of the range at $0.69. Buyers are likely to defend this level with all their might because a break below it could start a new downward move.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to invalidate the negative view, they will have to quickly push and sustain the price above the moving averages. The pair could then rise toward $0.97.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-shanghai-upgrade-could-supercharge-liquid-staking-derivatives-here-s-how"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Shanghai upgrade could supercharge liquid staking derivatives \u8212\'20\'14 Here\u8217\'20\'19s how}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery has stalled near the 20-day EMA ($4.59) but a minor positive is that the bulls did not give up much ground. This indicates that buyers expect a move higher, hence they are not closing their positions in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/368a802c-3f4c-4e0d-a7b5-1b9583cee5ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price ascends above $4.68, the DOT/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($4.98). This level may again act as a barrier but if bulls overcome it, the pair could surge to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and slides below $4.50, it will suggest that bears continue to defend the zone between the moving averages. The pair could then again drop toward the vital support at $4.22.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the minor resistance at $78 on Jan. 4 but rebounded off the moving averages on Jan. 6. This suggests that bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/73013e3d-69ea-4661-a356-8b5fa287b4ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls thrust the price above the resistance at $78, the LTC/USDT pair could soar to $85.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. A break and close below the moving averages could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair could then slide to the next support at $65.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a roadblock at the 50-day SMA ($5.56) on Jan. 4. This may have tempted short-term traders to book profits, which pulled the price to the support line of the triangle on Jan. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-01/13314681-7ed0-4b7c-8c00-4b20c0f1e724.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($5.36). This indicates that the bulls are aggressively guarding the support line. Buyers will again try to overcome the obstacle at the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, the UNI/USDT pair could start its march toward the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the support line to gain the upper hand. The pair could then decline to the $4.94 to $4.71 support zone.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDEvMTJjM2UzNjItOTViYy00ZDdkLTg5YjMtZDQ3ZDM2ODIwNjc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230106ej16000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,766 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Every recovery attempt in Bitcoin and altcoin is being sold into, indicating that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par \uc2 Investors have faced a tumultuous year in 2022 as stocks, bonds, and the cryptocurrency sector have all {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/everything-bubble-bursts-worst-year-for-us-stocks-and-bonds-since-1932"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessed sharp declines}}}\uc2 . As of Nov. 30, the performance of a traditional portfolio comprising 60% stocks and 40% bonds has been the worst since 1932, according to a report by \uc2 Financial Times\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The next big question troubling crypto investors is whether the pain in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is over or will the downtrend continue in 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/8k-dive-or-22k-rebound-bitcoin-traders-anticipate-q1-btc-price-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Analysts seem to be divided}}}\uc2  in their opinion for the first quarter of the new year. While some expect a drop to $10,000 others anticipate a rally to $22,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1386b591-288f-4124-8684-1b43be9f6dd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the near-term remains uncertain, research and trading firm Capriole Investments said in its latest edition of the Capriole Newsletter that Bitcoin could copy gold\u8217\'20\'19s explosive bull move in the 1970s and if that happens, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-would-surge-past-600k-if-hardest-asset-matches-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could soar past $600,000}}}\uc2  over the next few years.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins start a recovery in the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slipped below the immediate support of $16,559 on Dec. 28. This indicated that the tight range had resolved in favor of the bears. The next support on the downside is $16,256.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/0a6a6b06-307c-4fdb-8489-e98bdefd7634.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price below $16,256 on Dec. 30 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls are trying to protect the level. Buyers may face a strong resistance at the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,820), the possibility of a break below $16,256 increases. The BTC/USDT pair could then dive to the $16,000 and $15,476 support zones.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. That could trigger a rally to the $18,000 to $18,388 zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the support at $1,150 and the 20-day EMA ($1,218). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b0fdd700-8f75-437b-a23f-3b1f05c1e8c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to $1,150. This is an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-needs-to-defend-1-180-to-sustain-this-50-day-ascending-pattern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 important support to watch}}}\uc2  out for in the near term because if it cracks, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern and may plunge to $1,075.\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended this level on two previous occasions, hence they may try to do that again. If they can pull it off, the pair may extend its range-bound action between $1,075 and $1,352 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears sink the price below $1,075, the pair could fall to the psychologically critical level of $1,000 and later to the pattern target of $948.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade in a tight range near the overhead resistance zone between $250 and $255. This suggests that both the bulls and the bears are battling it out for supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1b4f55cc-52db-40e4-92ff-298875976599.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, such tight ranges are followed by a sharp pick-up in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout. Hence, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before jumping in.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above $255, several short-term bears may get trapped. They may then hurry to close their positions, which could catapult the BNB/USDT pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($272).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and slips below $236, the pair may drop to $220. This level may act as a minor support but if it gives way, the pair could nosedive to $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the symmetrical triangle on Dec. 29 but the bulls could not start a recovery. The bears maintained their grip and again pulled the price to the support line on Dec. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/84d9a45d-b5a6-4f5f-bc0c-9955f9233bd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is below 39, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price drops below the support line, it will indicate that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The XRP/USDT pair could then retest the June low near $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to propel the pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.36). If they do that, the pair could ascend to the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 There was a weak attempt from the bulls to defend the important support at $0.07 on Dec. 29. The bears kept up the selling pressure and pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the key support on Dec. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/46cb55b7-94d5-42a7-b9d8-0b56bf9c9eea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $0.07 will complete a descending triangle pattern, which is a huge negative. The DOGE/USDT pair could then continue its decline and retest the crucial support near $0.05. If this support collapses, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly thrust the price back above the breakdown level at $0.07. That could trap the aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. The pair could first rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.09) and thereafter climb to $0.11.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the support at $0.25 on Dec. 29, indicating that the downtrend remains in force. The fall has pulled the RSI into the oversold zone, suggesting that a relief rally or a consolidation is likely in the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/156479d0-252c-4019-9aaf-a0b6b0e2d6b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have defended the support line of the falling wedge pattern on numerous occasions in the past few weeks and they may try to do that again. If the price bounces off the support line with strength, the bulls try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.27). If they succeed, the pair could climb to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the recovery off the support line is shallow, it will suggest a lack of demand from the bulls. The bears will then try to sink the price below the support line and pull the pair to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside a large range between $0.69 and $1.05. The bears pulled the price below the immediate support of $0.75 on Dec. 30, opening the doors for a drop to $0.69.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fcac9a44-ed70-402e-9195-eab1df986b1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In a range, traders usually buy at the support and sell near the resistance. Therefore, the fall to $0.69 may be bought aggressively. A strong rebound off this support will indicate that the MATIC/USDT pair may continue its range-bound action for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a weak rebound off $0.69 could embolden the bears and enhance the prospects of a breakdown. If that happens, the pair could start a new down move that could reach $0.52.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to avoid the downtrend, they will have to quickly push the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-joins-ranks-of-ftt-luna-with-sol-price-down-97-from-peak-is-a-rebound-possible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana joins ranks of FTT, LUNA with SOL price down 97% from peak \u8212\'20\'14 Is a rebound possible?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) remains in a firm bear grip. The bulls are trying to arrest the decline near $4.22 but have failed to achieve a meaningful bounce. This increases the likelihood of the resumption of the down move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/6d753ff2-1b14-45be-92eb-f5e90b982627.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The next support on the downside is at $4 and then at $3.60. This zone had acted as a strong floor between September to November 2020, hence the bulls may again try to defend it with all their might.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a rally above the 20-day EMA ($4.65) will be the first indication of strength. The DOT/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) fell below the moving averages on Dec. 27 and continued its pullback on Dec. 28. The price bounced off the lower levels on Dec. 29 and has reached the 20-day EMA ($68).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/df264ba2-548d-49ca-84f6-5de8301d7dcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to flip the moving averages into resistance. If they do that, the LTC/USDT pair could turn down and break below the immediate support at $65. That could start a decline to $61.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term because if it fails to hold, the selling could accelerate and the pair could plunge to $56.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, the pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $75.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Dec. 28. This suggests that the uncertainty between the bulls and the bears has resolved in favor of the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/bfac4b70-f251-43f6-9436-4b951e17e3c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back into the triangle on Dec. 29 but the bears held their ground. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below $4.97, the next stop could be $4.71 and then $4.60. This negative view could be invalidated in the near term if the UNI/USDT pair re-enters the triangle and breaks above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvM2FjNjlkNzMtNjgyZC00YTY5LWFlNmUtYTU1NTExMDBmOGE4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221230eicu000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,660 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bears successfully defended the overhead resistance in Bitcoin and select altcoins, suggesting that the trend remains negative.\par \par \uc2 Gold has been an outperformer in 2022 compared to the United States equities markets and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). The yellow metal is almost flat for the year while the S&P 500 is down more than 19% and Bitcoin has plunged roughly 64%.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hodlers-sit-on-record-8m-btc-in-unrealized-loss-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp fall in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has hurt}}}\uc2  both short-term and long-term investors alike. According to Glassnode data, 1,889,585 Bitcoin held by short-term holders was at a loss as of Dec. 26 while the loss-making tally of long-term holders was 6,057,858 Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/080f980a-fc7f-4b13-9602-ac5332252fc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In spite of gold\u8217\'20\'19s good showing and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dismal performance in 2022, billionaire investor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hodlers-sit-on-record-8m-btc-in-unrealized-loss-data-shows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mark Cuban continues to favor Bitcoin over gold}}}\uc2 . While speaking on Bill Maher\u8217\'20\'19s Club Random podcast, Cuban told Maher, \u8220\'20\'1CIf you have gold, you\u8217\'20\'19re dumb as fuck.\u8221\'20\'1D He advised Maher to \u8220\'20\'1Cjust get Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin lead a recovery in the final few days of the year or will the crypto markets close the year with a whimper? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck inside a tight range between $16,559 and the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,877) for the past few days. This indicates that both the bulls and the bears are lying low during the holiday season.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/70016644-9fa6-4411-8dec-9fcd2518634a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down gradually and the relative strength index (RSI) is near 43, indicating a slight advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and slips below $16,500, the selling could pick up pace and the BTC/USDT pair could fall to the $16,000 to $15,476 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to fiercely defend this zone because if it collapses, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair could then soar to $18,388 where the rally may again hit a roadblock.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,223), indicates that the bears are defending the level with vigor. That may have led the bulls to surrender and close their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9de44a51-f667-44af-b945-624d995997e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pair could now slump to $1,182. If this support fails to hold, the ETH/USDT pair may sink to the robust support at $1,150. If the price bounces off this level with strength, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $1,150 and $1,352 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price nosedives below $1,150, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. The pair could first decline to $1,075 and then plunge toward the pattern target of $948.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to catapult BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance zone between $250 and $255 on Dec. 27 but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $250 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/e5d10a26-7ce2-41bb-b95d-9b93b52dce6d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could now slide to the immediate support at $236. If the price rebounds off this level, it will indicate that the pair may remain stuck inside a tight range between $236 and $255 for a while longer. That could increase the likelihood of a break above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price tumbles below $236, it will suggest that the bears are trying to assert their supremacy. The pair could then retest the critical support at $220. A break below this level could open the doors for a possible dip to $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) scaled above the 20-day EMA ($0.36) on Dec. 26 but the bulls could not sustain the tempo and overcome the barrier at the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. This may have tempted the short-term bulls to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/24d8bf2a-631c-4b04-b5e6-293121ee984b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair fell back below the 20-day EMA on Dec. 28. The pair could now decline to the support line of the triangle. This suggests that the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to start after the price escapes the triangle. If the price plummets below the triangle, the pair could drop to $0.30 and then to $0.25. Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the triangle, the pair could rally to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has dropped to the crucial support at $0.07 on Dec. 28. This level successfully held off assaults by the bears on three previous occasions, hence the bulls will again try to protect it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/60265d57-a840-4095-b90f-48c178511609.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern will be negated. That could result in short-covering by the aggressive bears, propelling the price to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks and closes below $0.07, the descending triangle pattern will complete. That could start a downward move toward $0.06 and thereafter to the pivotal support near $0.05.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled just below the 20-day EMA ($0.27) on Dec. 27, indicating that relief rallies are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/156f0b10-72ac-479e-a747-3656878719dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the strong support near $0.25. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slump to the support line of the falling wedge pattern. This level has acted as a strong support on several occasions, hence the bulls will again try to defend it aggressively.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then advance toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to pierce the 20-day EMA ($0.82) on Dec. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) could slip to the immediate support at $0.75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/26556db8-3bc5-429c-8d5c-b78a223a37d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.75, the MATIC/USDT pair could fall to the strong support at $0.69. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the pair could start a downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.52.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the $0.75, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on minor dips. They will then try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA and thrust the price toward $0.97.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-beats-tesla-stock-in-2022-as-btc-price-heads-for-60-losses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin beats Tesla stock in 2022 as BTC price heads for 60% losses}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 In a strong downtrend, the relief rallies are usually shallow and do not last long. That is what happened in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), which turned down on Dec. 27 and broke below the $4.37 support on Dec. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1bea22de-fa0f-415b-8db6-adbf8fa90bab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are trending down and the RSI is near the oversold territory, indicating that bears are firmly in the driver's seat. If the price sustains below $4.37, the DOT/USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $4.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($4.73). The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($5.21). A trend change will be signaled after bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the moving averages on Dec. 26 but the bulls could not sustain the momentum. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/3e87ab1a-1101-482b-be5a-74695849981c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The LTC/USDT pair dropped back below the moving averages on Dec. 27 and the bears are trying to pull the price below the uptrend line on Dec. 28. If they manage to do that, the pair could fall further to $65 and later to $61.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to kick the price to the overhead resistance at $75.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Uniswap\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) Dec. 27 candlestick shows that bears continue to sell on relief rallies near the 20-day EMA ($5.42).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/0191de72-0ecb-4230-b702-303c6c28ac9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure on Dec. 28 and are trying to sustain the price below the support line of the triangle. There is strong support near $5 but if this level gives way, the UNI/USDT pair could start a downward move to $4.60.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the moving averages. That could trap the aggressive bears and propel the pair toward the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZTViNGNlYTEtNDlmNS00NjdiLTgwYzUtYTE2ZDg0ZWJlNTEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221228eics000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin beats \uc2 Tesla\uc2  stock in 2022 as BTC price heads for 60% losses\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   William Suberg \par \uc2 524 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action is still outperforming \uc2 Tesla\uc2  stock year-to-date and Bitcoin may continue to do so, one analyst believes.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) circled $16,750 after the Dec. 28 Wall Street open after stocks dragged markets lower.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/712c674d-b706-4df4-a227-ef0d209dca79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin analysts stick to downside fears\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracked BTC/USD as it recovered from local lows of $16,559 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After days of barely any movement up or down, Bitcoin finally saw a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dips-1-on-wall-street-open-as-bitcoin-miners-worry-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 flicker of action}}}\uc2  as traditional markets opened after the Christmas break. Unfortunately for bulls, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to the downside, with BTC/USD seeing its lowest levels since Dec. 20.\par \par \uc2 On equities markets, United States indexes improved after a weak first day, which nonetheless failed to leave much of an impression on BTC commentators, many of whom stuck to grim short-term price forecasts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI can't stress this enough,\u8221\'20\'1D Toni Ghinea {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ToniGhinea/status/1607665013459910656"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in part of a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  update.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe sell-off will accelerate in the coming weeks. This bear market is far from over.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Accompanying charts showed targets for Bitcoin and several altcoins, with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) due a trip as low as $600.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9d1ad70e-1d6e-45d3-9c66-94c96c6f4dba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ether, MATIC and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price charts. Source: Toni Ghinea/\uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Fellow analytics account Illiquid Markets likewise {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/illiquidmarkets/status/1608086693982208000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  followers to \u8220\'20\'1Cbe prepared for even lower prices in 2023,\u8221\'20\'1D with these to be \u8220\'20\'1Clower than most expect.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Amid an absence of buyer interest, only \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  and its CEO, \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2 , were on record for increasing BTC exposure.\par \par \uc2 The firm, already the public company with the largest Bitcoin treasury, added another 2,500 BTC to its reserves, it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.microstrategy.com/en/investor-relations/financial-documents/microstrategy-increases-bitcoin-holidings-by-2500-and-now-holds-132500-btc_12-28-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 confirmed}}}\uc2  in a filing.\par \par \uc2 Down, but better than \uc2 Tesla\par \par \uc2 At $16,700, meanwhile, BTC/USD traded at around 60% down year-to-date, with three days until the yearly close.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-underperforms-stocks-gold-for-the-first-time-since-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin underperforms stocks, gold for the first time since 2018}}}\par \par \uc2 This was noticeably comparable to \uc2 Tesla\uc2  stock, which at $113 was on track to seal year-to-date losses of 72% or more.\par \par \uc2 For \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2 , senior macro strategist at Bloomberg Intelligence, there was enough evidence in the assets\u8217\'20\'19 performance to entertain the possibility of Bitcoin coming out on top.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe near certainty of declining Bitcoin supply vs. the rising amount of \uc2 Tesla\uc2  shares outstanding favors outperformance by the crypto, if the rules of economics apply,\u8221\'20\'1D research he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mikemcglone11/status/1604891687242940416/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  on Dec. 19 read.\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2  CEO \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s offloading of TSLA in 2022 remained on others\u8217\'20\'19 radar. Discussing trading activity at the firm on Dec. 25, analyst Christopher Bloomstran {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChrisBloomstran/status/1606811132488032257"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  both \uc2 Tesla\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s BTC stake and shareholders as \u8220\'20\'1Csuffering mightily\u8221\'20\'1D this year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince the March 15, 2021 rebranding, \uc2 Tesla\uc2  and Bitcoin are down 48% and 70%, respectively. Great fun,\u8221\'20\'1D he summarized.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/24f2bfaa-5243-4653-aa9e-9731a8919a15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD vs. TSLA chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvMzRmMWZiOGYtOTI0NC00NjIxLTlmMjItNGEyMWFjNzg2NTQyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221228eics0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin\par \b \uc2 Underdog rises: Dogecoin survived carnage in 2022 better than most\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 683 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 DOGE is holding up relatively well in 2022 compared to other assets, with 54% of DOGE hodlers in the green compared to 46% of BTC and 47% of ETH hodlers.\par \par \uc2 Amid the severe crypto downturn in 2022, the price of Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has held up much better than most of the top assets on the market.\par \par \uc2 DOGE is the third-best performer in the top ten, having dropped "just" 58% this year, beaten only by XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), which saw declines of 57.2% and 53%.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the top 10 assets in terms of market capitalization as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptobubbles.net/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 per}}}\uc2  Crypto Bubbles data, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) have all shed considerably more: 65.1%, 67.8%, 80.9 and 68.8%, respectively, over the past 12 months.\par \par \uc2 DOGE also comes in well ahead of other big names in the top 20 such as Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), which have all plunged, by 84%, 93.8%, 70.3% and 89.9%, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/3b02d3a2-963b-4ad9-ab95-31c4a08eae59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Asset price nightmare 2022: Crypto Bubbles\par \par \uc2 Data from Intotheblock (ITB) also has interesting insights, with the majority (54%) of DOGE hodlers currently in the green at the current price of $0.07, while 3% are breaking even and 43% in the red.\par \par \uc2 ITB\u8217\'20\'19s figures rely on identifying the average cost of token purchases in its tracked wallets and comparing it to the current price of the given asset.\par \par \uc2 Looking at other assets, ITB data indicates that 46% of BTC holders and 47% of ETH holders are currently in the green at the time of writing, showing the memecoin has performed well despite its volatile history.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/c6de5b13-2d31-4609-bb28-77ea8e97cb15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE summary: Intotheblock\par \par \uc2 The strong performance comes despite no significant news for the Dogecoin network or anything in the pipes to justify excitement going forward, barring some recent speculation that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rumors-of-a-new-native-twitter-coin-emerge-while-dogecoiners-remain-hopeful"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE could potentially, possibly, one day be integrated}}}\uc2  with \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 By way of comparison, Ethereum cut its energy consumption rates by 99% this year, with a slew of layer 2 projects helping it to scale. Fundamentals don't have the power of memes, apparently.\par \par \uc2 SHIBA INU vs DOGE\par \par \uc2 However, DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s memecoin competitor Shiba INU ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has also struggled, despite community efforts this year to build a full-fledged ecosystem consisting of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nifty-news-dr-disrespect-unveils-nft-game-to-mixed-reaction-fc-barcelona-s-first-nft-sells-for-700k-and-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blockchain games}}}\uc2 , nonfungible tokens and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shiba-inu-developer-says-wef-wants-to-work-with-project-to-help-shape-metaverse-global-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a metaverse platform}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The token is down 76.1% over the past 12 months, with just 14% of hodlers in the green, 4% breaking even and 82% in the red, according to ITB.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-real-life-dog-behind-memecoin-doge-is-seriously-ill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The real-life dog behind memecoin DOGE is seriously ill}}}\par \par \uc2 As it stands, DOGE is the eighth-largest crypto asset in terms of market cap at $10.1 billion, while SHIB sits at No. 17 with $4.8 billion, according to data from CoinGecko.\par \par \uc2 In some potentially \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news for the SHIB community, however, pseudonymous lead dev Shytoshi Kusama has hinted that there could be a new partnership in the works relating to the Shibarium project.\par \par \uc2 Shibarium is an upcoming Ethereum Layer 2 scaling solution that will host the ecosystem\u8217\'20\'19s metaverse platform, games and a decentralized exchange.\par \par \uc2 Shytoshi Kusama\u8217\'20\'19s bio was recently updated to read \u8220\'20\'1CWE are not alone\u8221\'20\'1D while their location was set to \u8220\'20\'1CWith a new fren\u8230\'20\'26 guess who?.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This followed up from a Christmas Eve tweet to their 865,400 followers that read:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWen Shibarium? Please know it will come very soon*, but not during a crucial time for people to spend with their family (or the resulting New Years party time). Enjoy these next days, next year is an important one for humanity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Happy Holidays to more than half the . Wen Shibarium? Please know it will come very soon*, but not during a crucial time for people to spend with their family (or the resulting New Years party time). Enjoy these next days, next year is an important one for humanity.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Shytoshi Kusama\u8482\'21\'22 (@ShytoshiKusama) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ShytoshiKusama/status/1606678505378430980?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 24, 2022}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZTViNDY3N2ItMjE1NS00YTMwLWI5YzAtYzliNjZjYzlkNmJiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221228eics00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,799 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The tight range trading in Bitcoin and altcoins could break out to the upside if the S&P 500 rises above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency markets are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-withdrawals-sink-to-7-month-low-as-users-forget-ftx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading at record-low \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-withdrawals-sink-to-7-month-low-as-users-forget-ftx"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-withdrawals-sink-to-7-month-low-as-users-forget-ftx}}}\uc2  as investors have largely {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-community-expresses-christmas-market-sentiments-no-santa-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stayed away during the holiday season}}}\uc2 . That could be because investors are unsure about the cryptocurrencies that could lead the next bull run.\par \par \uc2 Cumberland senior research analyst Steven Goulden said in a \u8220\'20\'1CYear in Review\u8221\'20\'1D report that he expects four \u8220\'20\'1Cemerging narratives\u8221\'20\'1D to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/4-emerging-narratives-in-crypto-to-watch-for-trading-firm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lead the crypto space}}}\uc2  over the next six to 24 months. Goulden anticipates growth in nonfungible tokens, Web3 apps and games. He expects export-oriented nations to add Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) as reserve assets and if that happens, it could be a huge positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/26189149-d338-4e5b-b969-18e71240507d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Jared Gross, head of institutional portfolio strategy at \uc2 JPMorgan Asset Management\uc2 , holds a different view. While speaking to Bloomberg, Gross said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-is-a-nonexistent-asset-for-big-institutional-investors-jpmorgan-exec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market had broken the notion}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin could act as a form of digital gold or an inflation hedge. He added that large institutional investors have stayed away from the crypto sector and that approach was unlikely to change anytime soon.\par \par \uc2 Could the S&P 500 index (SPX) and the cryptocurrency sector witness a recovery in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) turned down sharply from the downtrend line and tumbled below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 3,885 on Dec. 16. Buyers tried to push the price back above the 50-day SMA on Dec. 21, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/81dfaae1-045a-4ede-8e98-e5ce49b31a37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers pulled the price below the immediate support of 3,795 on Dec. 22 but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will again try to thrust the price above the moving averages and challenge the downtrend line. A break and close above the downtrend line could indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 3,907, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. The index could then drop below 3,764 and reach the next support at 3,650.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) has been trading below 105 for the past few days. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 105 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/ff0dc167-31c8-4aae-8829-d1441100e243.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating an advantage to the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below 103.44, the selling could pick up momentum and the index could plunge to 102 and later to the psychological level of 100. The bulls may vigorously defend this level.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to kick the price above the 20-day EMA of 105 to suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The index could then attempt a rally to 107 and subsequently to 108. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading in a tiny range for the past few days. This indicates that traders are not clear about the next directional move, hence they may be sitting on the sidelines.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fd0e2b23-94c5-454c-b5ac-ed11ce92be74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight-range trading may not continue for long because traders thrive in a volatile market. Buyers will try to establish their supremacy by pushing the price above the moving averages and the resistance at $17,100.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair could rally to $17,854 and then to the stiff resistance at $18,388. This level may act as a major obstacle and the bulls may find it difficult to surpass it.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the current level and dips below $16,550, the bears will try to extend the decline to the $15,500 to $16,000 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Ether toward the $1,150 support on Dec. 25, but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls are buying on minor dips. Buyers are currently attempting to catapult the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/554393be-5444-4d89-be9c-22357277fe51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up pace and rally to $1,352. This level could act as a major hurdle because the bears will try to defend it to the best of their ability. If the price turns down from $1,352, it will suggest that the pair could remain stuck inside a large range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will enhance the prospects of a break below $1,150. The pair could then slide to $1,075 where buying may emerge. The flattish 20-day EMA of $1,227 and the RSI near 47 indicate a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are aggressively defending the breakdown level of $250 but a minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the bulls will again try to propel BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance zone between $250 and $255.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/a5d0a937-19af-4c1f-868b-817f678eb12d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could quickly move up to the $290 to $300 resistance zone, which may act as a major barrier.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate an advantage to the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below $236, it will suggest that the bears have succeeded in flipping $250 into resistance. The pair could then drop to $220. If this level cracks, the pair could sink to the psychological level of $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a symmetrical triangle pattern. The price rebounded off the support line on Dec. 19 and reached the 20-day EMA of $0.36 on Dec. 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/37b9d895-0229-4292-838b-ea9d1198980c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair below the support line. If they succeed, the pair could plunge to the pivotal support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the resistance line. The bears may fiercely protect this level, but if the bulls overcome their resistance, the pair could start a strong recovery. The pair could first rally to $0.42 and then to the pattern target at $0.47.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery from the strong support at $0.07 fizzled out at $0.08. This suggests that bears continue to sell on minor relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/c392af6b-7cdc-4933-9fc4-5744d5969d76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could trade between $0.07 and $0.08 for some time. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate an advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $0.07, the selling could intensify and the pair may plummet to the critical support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA of $0.08. The pair could then attempt a