\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Strikes Red Alert, The Hideaways (HDWY) Ready For 2023 Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 503 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 December 2022\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2022, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has faced another staggering decline in the past few days, even experiencing a loss of 13.00% in the 24-hour timeline.\par \par \uc2 But when \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other leading tokens plummeted, The Hideaways (HDWY) managed to withstand the adverse effect of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, making it the center of attention.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Prints Two-Year Low\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has hit another plunge after imprinting the lowest lows in almost two years as traders run to the exit. Subsequently, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  skidded 16.40% to $0.26 in the past seven days, issuing distress signals to the markets.\par \par \uc2 The red turn of the cryptocurrencies came as investors expect the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  to retain its aggressive monetary policy in 2023, despite the recent modest rate increase.\par \par \uc2 The downturn of major coins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has led traders to look at alternatives with more potential in the short term. The Hideaways (HDWY) is the trending presale star who has navigated its way to the headlines, winning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysts' predictions for next year.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, investors are starting to grasp the harsh reality that a soft landing is not in the cards for Cardano. Otherwise, a snowball recession and price avalanche are in sight.\par \par \uc2 Where Is Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Headed Next?\par \par \uc2 Recent efforts to push Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) have been unsuccessful as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  approached the lower boundary support of a falling channel.\par \par \uc2 At press time, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Moving Average Convergence Divergence (MACD) indicator cites a selling signal. Thus, the overhead pressure will likely intensify, predicting more losses for the token.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Relative Strength Index (RSI) has touched the oversold barrier. Analysts have cited that Cardano could continue the extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment and slump into $0.20 next year.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, The Hideaways (HDWY) is about to wrap its presale this month, offering massive rewards of up to 100% bonus on all investments.\par \par \uc2 The Hideaways (HDWY) On The Road To Surpass Cardano(\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Anyone currently looking for a reward-giving cryptocurrency investment must go forward with The Hideaways (HDWY).\par \par \uc2 The upcoming cryptocurrency project is on its way to overtake Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), as analysts have highlighted the bright future ahead for HDWY.\par \par \uc2 The Hideaways offers investors a new-generation investment option for luxury real estate in the form of minting nonfungible tokens. Remarkably, HDWY is a game changer and could make everyone a fortune.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, The Hideaways (HDWY)\u8217\'20\'19s presale is now in its final stage, selling at $0.10 per token. This affordable investment will also launch a prize draw, offering $100,000!\par \par \uc2 Never waste a second and hop in with The Hideaways (HDWY)!\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thehideaways.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.thehideaways.io}