hain.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/still-bullish-40-of-survey-respondents-plan-to-buy-crypto-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bought crypto this year}}}\uc2 , and 40% plan to purchase crypto in the next year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/8bc05d1c-c0b5-4488-99bf-4155849e1e6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, a sustained recovery in risk assets may happen only after inflation shows signs of cooling. That would raise expectations of a pivot by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  from its aggressive monetary tightening to an expansionary policy.\par \par \uc2 In the short term, markets may remain volatile as volumes are likely to remain thin during the holiday season. Could Bitcoin and altcoins start a recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is trying to cling to the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,955). The bears tried to pull the price lower on Dec. 22, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/277d7b59-ca0d-4adc-b2ab-fdcc7b375233.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up pace and soar to the strong overhead resistance at $18,388. This is an important level to watch because a break and close above it could attract huge buying. The pair could then surge to $21,500.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to push the price above the moving averages, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will try to make use of this opportunity and pull the pair below $16,256. If they do that, the pair could plummet to the support at $15,476.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce off $1,150 has been facing strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1,230) for the past two days. Sellers tried to pull the price down on Dec. 22, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9ec8d570-1c06-4981-bf26-f2f9e65f3741.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattish, and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers. A break above the 50-day SMA ($1,259) could tilt the near-term advantage in favor of the bulls. The ETH/USDT pair could then climb to $1,352.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to sink the price below the immediate support at $1,150 to gain the upper hand. Such a move would complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern in the near term. The pair could first drop to $1,075 and then plunge to the target objective of $948.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating near the breakdown level of $250 for the past few days. This suggests that bears are protecting this level, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1073a8ff-c50c-4bba-ba2e-f64137e44f8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above $255, it could trap several aggressive bears who may then hurry to close their short positions. That may result in a short squeeze, which could push the price to the 50-day SMA ($283) and then to $300.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level and slides below $236, it will suggest that bears remain in control. Sellers will then try to sink the price below $220 and extend the decline to the psychological support at $200.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is trying to start a recovery, but it could face selling near the breakdown level of $0.37. Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is below 40, suggesting that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/ab099798-1b0a-45b6-a4f1-9eb1013d2d38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the XRP/USDT pair below $0.33. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the critical support at $0.30, which the bulls will likely try to protect.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up from the current level and buyers drive the pair above the overhead resistance at $0.37. If that happens, the pair could rally to $0.41, which may again behave as a major obstacle.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $0.07 on Dec. 20, indicating that buyers are trying to defend this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/8265d4e9-262f-4adf-a5df-6b155c5f5fbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pullback could reach the downtrend line where the bears may mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this level, it will increase the likelihood of a break below the support at $0.07. If this level cracks, the selling could accelerate and the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the vital support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers thrust the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.09), it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then rally to $0.11, which may again act as a strong barrier.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to sink Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the support line of the falling wedge pattern on Dec. 21 and 22, but the bulls defended the level successfully.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9f8027cb-08d6-489b-8c1a-8e47d1826705.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to propel the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.29). This level may act as a major barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.32) and then to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will fancy their chances and attempt to sink the pair below the support line. If they can pull it off, the downtrend could extend to the psychological support at $0.20.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8216\'20\'18s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to start a relief rally, but the bears are in no mood to relent. They are offering a stiff resistance near $0.81, but the long tail on the Dec. 22 candlestick shows that bulls continue to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/d59364a8-fe82-4cbc-92d8-82cfb938159f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above $0.81, the MATIC/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($0.84). The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI below 41 suggest that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 Sellers may again try to stall the relief rally at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this level, a retest of $0.76 is possible. Conversely, if buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.90).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-five-most-googled-cryptocurrencies-worldwide-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top-five most Googled cryptocurrencies worldwide in 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8216\'20\'18s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $4.40 support on Dec. 22, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. This indicates buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/68c0eded-c69b-4ebf-9dfe-5f23b6cb3fb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to sustain their buying and push the price above the 20-day EMA ($4.92) to indicate strength. The DOT/USDT pair could then move up to the 50-day SMA ($5.45) and later attempt a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below $4.37, it will suggest that the downtrend remains intact. The pair could then drop to $4. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold area suggest that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance near $67. The failure of the bulls to push the price to the moving averages shows that bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/13bfd725-f107-4735-9b9d-5515f1e3f01a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating an advantage for bears. If the price turns down and breaches the support at $61, the LTC/USDT pair could plummet to $56.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to invalidate this negative view, they will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. The pair could then attempt a rally to $75 where the bears may again mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap\u8216\'20\'18s UNI ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) is trading in a tight range between the support line of the symmetrical triangle and $5.50. This suggests that bulls are buying the dips but have not been able to clear the overhead hurdle at $5.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/831536a2-7f06-42f6-aaad-1f8d16304eef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate an upper hand to the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, the UNI/USDT pair could plunge to $4.60.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above $5.50, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($5.84). This level may again act as a resistance but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could reach the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by the HitBTC exchange.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZTQzNGFjOGQtOTgzOS00ZmQ3LTlmNmYtODMwZDhjYmI3NGEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221223eicn000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
