/s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/20f87a44-5c34-48c2-8217-980ddc1f9d1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and broke below the uptrend line on Dec. 11. The bears tried to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the critical support at $5 on Dec. 12 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that bulls are trying to defend the level.\par \par \uc2 If the relief rally rises above the 20-day EMA, the recovery could pick up speed and the pair could touch the 50-day SMA ($5.82). On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the odds of a break below $5 increase. The pair could then drop toward $4.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvN2ZhOTYwNzktNTRlZS00OWE1LWIxNWItYTg0YzYwZGNkNGQ2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221212eicc000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin bulls protect $17K as trader eyes key China BTC price catalyst\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   William Suberg \par \uc2 495 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price could reap the benefits of waning inflation, a weaker dollar and rising China investment, say Bitcoin analysts.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) maintained $17,000 support into Dec. 10 ahead of a critical week of macro data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7a6388c1-5023-4b63-b567-5b2e13861ec3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 CPI print will make Fed "slow down"\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  followed BTC/USD as it traded sideways after the close of trading on Wall Street.\par \par \uc2 The pair looked set for a quiet weekend, with all eyes focused on United States inflation readings and policy updates due from Dec. 13 onward.\par \par \uc2 With the Producer Price Index (PPI) November print behind it, the month\u8217\'20\'19s Consumer Price Index (CPI) results took center stage.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-tests-17k-on-ppi-as-bitcoin-analysts-eye-cpi-fomc-catalysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , expectations remain that CPI will show U.S. inflation continuing to abate, sparking renewed strength in risk assets, including crypto.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy personal expectations are that we'll be seeing CPI come in at 7.0-7.2%, Core CPI at 5.9-6.1% and that we'll have a big impact on the markets again,\u8221\'20\'1D Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, founder and CEO of trading firm Eight, wrote in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1601507209305010176"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter thread}}}\uc2  on the topic.\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe added that the Federal Reserve\u8217\'20\'19s Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meeting on Dec. 15 should respond in kind should that outcome result.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFOMC to pause and slow down after this event,\u8221\'20\'1D he predicted.\par \par \uc2 Macro economist and stocks analyst James Choi meanwhile produced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JC_Investment/status/1601225727177003011"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 list}}}\uc2  of stock market catalysts as the week closed, these including emerging markets and \u8220\'20\'1Cnever ending suppression\u8221\'20\'1D in the VIX \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  index.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUSA Peak inflation, Weaker $USD, China reopening are making some great investing opportunities. Chinese Real estate ETF $CHIR up staggering 80% since November. Unbelievable,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JC_Investment/status/1601230490308337664"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7496fa8a-fcba-46d3-be2a-514ddaff6414.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index (DXY) 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 China gets Bitcoin bulls excited\par \par \uc2 Continuing on China, crypto analyst and trader TechDev outlined a potential leading indicator for Bitcoin strength in the form of the Chinese ten-year bond yield versus the U.S. dollar index (DXY).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-9-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-doge-matic-dot-ltc-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI}}}\par \par \uc2 Now heading higher, if history repeats itself, BTC/USD could benefit in kind, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1601349278525689862"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in one of several \uc2 Twitter\uc2  posts this week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFew signals have correlated with Bitcoin's macro inflections as tightly as China's 10-year yield,\u8221\'20\'1D further commentary {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1600987144851714050/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 read}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLocal tops at major $BTC impulse tops. Local CN10Y downtrend breaking with 3W RSI exceeding 50... Began each of Bitcoin's last 3 largest moves.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/74256edf-7eea-446c-944f-aad739673a0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 China 10-year bond yield vs. BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: TechDev/ \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvNTZmNzUxYWMtNTI5Ny00ZWQwLTljMzMtMDZmMWYzOGJiMDVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221210eica0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,761 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins may consolidate in a tight range for a few days as traders closely watch the outcome of next week\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets are headed for a down week as market participants remain cautious ahead of next week\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-tests-17k-on-ppi-as-bitcoin-analysts-eye-cpi-fomc-catalysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key Consumer Price Index data}}}\uc2  for November.\par \par \uc2 The CPI report will be followed by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Federal Open Market Committee meeting on Dec. 13-14, where the central bank is expected to hike rates by 50 basis points, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html?redirect=/trading/interest-rates/countdown-to-fomc.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to the FedWatch Tool.\par \par \uc2 The outcome of the events next week could increase the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and result in a trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b0e3bee6-60dd-419c-9888-5b56b7f75430.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After a terrible year that saw some high-profile cryptocurrency companies go bust, the bulls will expect 2022 to end on a strong note. Bears will also try to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/countries-and-institutions-move-into-crypto-despite-market-drop-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 maintain their stronghold and extend the decline}}}\uc2  in the next year.\par \par \uc2 What is the path of least resistance in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the $16,787 support on Dec. 7, indicating strong demand at lower levels. Buyers propelled Bitcoin back above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $17,004 on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fe95a092-523d-4ba7-951f-b98c031dc1c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a possible range-bound action in the near term. Usually, tight-range trading is followed by a range expansion, which leads to a trending move.\par \par \uc2 At times, the first breakout tends to be a fake move, hence traders could wait for a confirmation before jumping on to take the trade.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the resistance zone between $17,622 and the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $18,046, the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair could signal a potential trend change. The pair could then attempt a rally to $20,000 and later to $21,500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $16,787, the bears will try to pull the pair to the pivotal support at $15,476.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA of $1,254 on Dec. 7 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9d112e25-e81d-4c12-a14e-75214d1fd5aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will once again strive to thrust the price above the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA of $1,331. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair could surge toward the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it could keep the pair stuck inside the range for a few days. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint also indicate a consolidation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The advantage could tilt in favor of the bears if the price turns down and breaks below $1,212.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed below the $285 support on Dec. 7 but the bears could not capitalize on this opportunity. The bulls purchased the dip and have pushed the price to the 20-day EMA of $291.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1d728803-5452-4d70-9ed2-4a944e28d70a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening moving averages and the RSI above 48 suggest a balance between supply and demand. This could result in a volatile range-bound action in the near term but the boundaries of the range are not yet defined.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to yank the BNB/USDT pair below $281. If that happens, the selling could accelerate and the pair may slide to $275 and later to the strong support at $250. If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to push and sustain the price above $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the strong support of $0.37 on Dec. 7, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips. This is the second occasion when the bulls have defended this level, hence $0.37 becomes an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/5827bbfa-7146-4251-9f73-8425fb18e216.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattish and the RSI is near the midpoint, implying that the XRP/USDT pair could remain stuck between $0.37 and $0.41 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $0.41. This level may act as a major barrier for the bulls but if they manage to overcome it, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $0.37 and strengthen their hold. If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to $0.34.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend and the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/cc33c39d-5566-4ac3-bda2-2728e864eacf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have an opportunity to start a recovery by pushing the price above the 20-day EMA of $0.32. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The 50-day SMA of $0.35 may offer minor resistance but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to clear the 20-day EMA quickly, the possibility of a break below the critical support of $0.29 increases. That could signal the resumption of the downtrend and the pair may plummet to $0.27.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip to the 50-day SMA of $0.09 on Dec. 7, but they are facing resistance at the psychological level of $0.10. This indicates that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell the rallies in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/24b107e6-23c2-4d42-a759-38f23193dcf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If sellers pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA, the DOGE/USDT pair risks a drop to $0.08 and then to the vital support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could consolidate between $0.09 and $0.11 for a few days. The flattening 20-day EMA of $0.10 and the RSI just above the midpoint also hint at a range-bound action in the near term. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up above $0.11.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA of $0.90 on Dec. 7, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/720ef161-4f41-4df4-b37b-29357010cd96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to keep up the buying pressure and push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.97. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.05, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The next break below the 20-day EMA may pull the price to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-chase-web3-as-blockchain-industry-builds-despite-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investors chase Web3 as blockchain industry builds despite bear market}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) took support at $5.24 on Dec. 7, indicating that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low in the near term but the bears continue to defend the 20-day EMA of $5.48 with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/bf0a35f0-414c-41a4-956a-71c38cdf6f73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the Nov. 22 low of $5 could be retested. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail, the DOT/USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair could then slump to the next support at $4.32.\par \par \uc2 The first resistance to watch on the upside is the 20-day EMA. A close above this level could indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA of $5.86 and thereafter to $6.18.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA of $74 on Dec. 8, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fd5b5edb-a40c-4700-9a9d-3f155d8fa3ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA and then $70. If this zone breaks down, it could lead to long liquidation and the LTC/USDT pair may slide to the 50-day SMA of $65.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the pair could consolidate between $75 and $85 for some time. A break above $85 could clear the path for a possible rally to $104.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) remains inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Buyers purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA of $5.97 on Dec. 8 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/06c89c8e-843e-412b-8631-d2e0cb74f852.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action inside a triangle is usually random and volatile. If the 20-day EMA support cracks, the UNI/USDT pair could gradually decline to the support line of the triangle. This level could attract buyers who will try to protect the support line.\par \par \uc2 The near-term advantage could shift in favor of the bulls if they propel the price above $6.55. The pair could then climb to the resistance line of the triangle. Buyers will have to overcome this hurdle to signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZDI1NGQwYzAtNDI3Ni00MWY3LWIxM2QtMmNiNzliNzQ5N2VlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221210eic9000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,740 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins may consolidate in a tight range for a few days as traders closely watch the outcome of next week's \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets are headed for a down week as market participants remain cautious ahead of next week's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-tests-17k-on-ppi-as-bitcoin-analysts-eye-cpi-fomc-catalysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key consumer price index data}}}\uc2  for November.\par \par \uc2 The CPI report will be followed by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Federal Open Market Committee meeting on Dec. 13-14 where the central bank is expected to hike rates by 50 basis points, according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html?redirect=/trading/interest-rates/countdown-to-fomc.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FedWatch}}}\uc2  Tool.\par \par \uc2 The outcome of the events next week could increase the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and result in a trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b0e3bee6-60dd-419c-9888-5b56b7f75430.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After a terrible year that saw some high-profile cryptocurrency companies go bust, the bulls will expect 2022 to end on a strong note. Bears will also try to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/countries-and-institutions-move-into-crypto-despite-market-drop-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 maintain their stronghold and extend the decline}}}\uc2  in the next year.\par \par \uc2 What is the path of least resistance in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the $16,787 support on Dec. 7, indicating strong demand at lower levels. Buyers propelled Bitcoin back above the 20-day exponential moving average ($17,004) on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fe95a092-523d-4ba7-951f-b98c031dc1c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a possible range-bound action in the near term. Usually, tight range trading is followed by a range expansion, which leads to a trending move.\par \par \uc2 At times, the first breakout tends to be a fake move, hence traders could wait for a confirmation before jumping on to take the trade.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the resistance zone between $17,622 and the 50-day simple moving average ($18,046), the BTC/USDT pair could signal a potential trend change. The pair could then attempt a rally to $20,000 and later to $21,500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $16,787, the bears will try to pull the pair to the pivotal support at $15,476.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($1,254) on Dec. 7 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/9d112e25-e81d-4c12-a14e-75214d1fd5aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will once again strive to thrust the price above the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($1,331). If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair could surge toward the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it could keep the pair stuck inside the range for a few days. The flat moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint also indicate a consolidation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The advantage could tilt in favor of the bears if the price turns down and breaks below $1,212.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) closed below the $285 support on Dec. 7 but the bears could not capitalize on this opportunity. The bulls purchased the dip and have pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($291).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1d728803-5452-4d70-9ed2-4a944e28d70a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening moving averages and the RSI above 48 suggest a balance between supply and demand. This could result in a volatile range-bound action in the near term but the boundaries of the range are not yet defined.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to yank the BNB/USDT pair below $281. If that happens, the selling could accelerate and the pair may slide to $275 and later to the strong support at $250. If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to push and sustain the price above $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the strong support of $0.37 on Dec. 7, indicating that bulls are buying the dips. This is the second occasion when bulls have defended this level, hence $0.37 becomes an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/5827bbfa-7146-4251-9f73-8425fb18e216.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattish and the RSI is near the midpoint, implying that the XRP/USDT pair could remain stuck between $0.37 and $0.41 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $0.41. This level may act as a major barrier for the bulls but if they manage to overcome it, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $0.37 and strengthen their hold. If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to $0.34.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend and the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/cc33c39d-5566-4ac3-bda2-2728e864eacf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have an opportunity to start a recovery by pushing the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.32). If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The 50-day SMA ($0.35) may offer minor resistance but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to clear the 20-day EMA quickly, the possibility of a break below the critical support of $0.29 increases. That could signal the resumption of the downtrend and the pair may plummet to $0.27.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip to the 50-day SMA ($0.09) on Dec. 7 but they are facing resistance at the psychological level of $0.10. This indicates that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell the rallies in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/24b107e6-23c2-4d42-a759-38f23193dcf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If sellers pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA, the DOGE/USDT pair risks a drop to $0.08 and then to the vital support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could consolidate between $0.09 and $0.11 for a few days. The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.10) and the RSI just above the midpoint, also hint at a range-bound action in the near term. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up above $0.11.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.90) on Dec. 7 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/720ef161-4f41-4df4-b37b-29357010cd96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to keep up the buying pressure and push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.97. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.05 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The next break below the 20-day EMA may pull the price to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-chase-web3-as-blockchain-industry-builds-despite-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investors chase Web3 as blockchain industry builds despite bear market}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) took support at $5.24 on Dec. 7, indicating that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low in the near term but the bears continue to defend the 20-day EMA ($5.48) with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/bf0a35f0-414c-41a4-956a-71c38cdf6f73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the Nov. 22 low of $5 could be retested. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail, the DOT/USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair could then slump to the next support at $4.32.\par \par \uc2 The first resistance to watch on the upside is the 20-day EMA. A close above this level could indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($5.86) and thereafter to $6.18.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($74) on Dec. 8, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fd5b5edb-a40c-4700-9a9d-3f155d8fa3ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the negative divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA and then $70. If this zone breaks down, it could lead to long liquidation and the LTC/USDT pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($65).\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the pair could consolidate between $75 and $85 for some time. A break above $85 could clear the path for a possible rally to $104.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) remains inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Buyers purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($5.97) on Dec. 8 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/06c89c8e-843e-412b-8631-d2e0cb74f852.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action inside a triangle is usually random and volatile. If the 20-day EMA support cracks, the UNI/USDT pair could gradually decline to the support line of the triangle. This level could attract buyers who will try to protect the support line.\par \par \uc2 The near-term advantage could shift in favor of the bulls if they propel the price above $6.55. The pair could then climb to the resistance line of the triangle. Buyers will have to overcome this hurdle to signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZDI1NGQwYzAtNDI3Ni00MWY3LWIxM2QtMmNiNzliNzQ5N2VlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221209eic9000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
