image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest said in the latest edition of its The Bitcoin Monthly newsletter that while the FTX implosion \u8220\'20\'1Ccould be the most damaging event in crypto history,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-clings-to-17k-as-ark-flags-historically-significant-capitulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized blockchains were}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cas strong as ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could lower levels attract buyers in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to spot the levels where buyers may step in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading near its 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $16,966 for the past few days, Bitcoin is threatening to dip below immediate support at $16,787.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b69fc985-e9eb-41aa-83cd-896b66050bf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bears and the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair may drop to $16,000. Such a move will suggest that the pair could remain stuck between $15,476 and $17,622 for a few more days. The longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger will be the breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $18,122 to gain the upper hand. The pair could then pick up momentum and rally to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for the past few days, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA of $1,250 on Dec. 7. This suggests that the bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7d76679b-9639-4bb5-a282-ad9b178e4ebc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could dive to $1,151 and then to the important support at $1,073.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up quickly and climbs back above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying on dips. That could increase the likelihood of a break above the 50-day SMA of $1,331. Above this level, there is no significant resistance until the pair reaches the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $300 on Dec. 5 but the bears held their ground. The sellers strengthened their position on Dec. 7 by pulling the price below the immediate support at $285.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/2bfd1c7d-6d35-4680-b62b-f31ee75847d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $285, the BNB/USDT pair could slump to $275. This level may act as a minor support but if it breaks down, the selling could pick up and the pair may plunge to crucial support at $250.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to push and sustain the price above $300. That could trap the aggressive bears on the wrong foot and push the price toward the overhead resistance at $338. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears successfully defended the 20-day EMA of $0.39 in the past few days and pulled XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the uptrend line on Dec. 7. This invalidates the developing ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/17b0cebe-9e70-4e29-89ac-9d683af41e46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to salvage the situation by defending the strong support at $0.37. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.37 and $0.41 for some time. A break and close above $0.41 will suggest the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to break the support at $0.37 and pull the price to $0.34. That could keep the pair range-bound between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above the 20-day EMA of $0.32 on Dec. 5, which may have tempted short-term buyers to close their longs and the bears to establish fresh short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/22266015-8a36-4ad9-8c4a-cc8cabe7371c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to pull the price below the crucial support at $0.29 but they may face strong resistance from the bulls because if the level gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Although the trend is down, the relative strength index (RSI) is maintaining its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that lower levels may attract buyers. The first sign of sustainable recovery could be on a break and close above $0.33. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Dec. 5 candlestick shows that bears are defending the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/35eeebca-278d-41ad-9d66-2a2ff7e1d0e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA of $0.09 on Dec. 7 but a minor positive is that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA of $0.09. If the price rebounds off the current level, the pair could again rise to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dropped close to the center which suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be waning. The bears may try to tug the price below the 50-day SMA and gain the upper hand. If they succeed, the pair could gradually slip toward $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to thrust Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above $0.95 on Dec. 5 but the bears vigorously defended the level. The price turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA of $0.90 on Dec. 7. This indicates that efforts by the bulls to flip the 20-day EMA into support have failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b97085eb-b60c-4ebc-ab8d-6bbf8383b99d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon this opportunity and drag the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on as the bulls have successfully defended it on three previous occasions. If this support collapses, the MATIC/USDT pair could slide to the crucial support at $0.69.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the overhead resistance at $0.97. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) repeatedly broke above the 20-day EMA of $5.50 from Dec. 2 to 5, but the bulls could not build upon this strength. This shows that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/22940867-66d2-4f59-ad43-3810707b2e93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to resume the downtrend by pulling the price below the strong support at $5. If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could plummet to $4.32.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off $5. That will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then try to drive the price above $5.73. If they can pull it off, it could signal a double bottom pattern. The pair could then rise to $6.18 and later to the pattern target of $6.46, which is near the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $84 resistance on Dec. 5 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows selling at higher levels. This may have tempted short-term traders to book profits, which has pulled the price to the breakout level of $75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fade5f29-3c6f-4824-8fb5-bcc5f85be6cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping up but the RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the buying pressure may be reducing. A break and close below the 20-day EMA of $74 could enhance the prospects of a drop to the 50-day SMA of $64.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA of $74, it will suggest that the trend remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $85 and push the LTC/USDT pair toward $104.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) climbed above the 50-day SMA of $6.16 on Dec. 2 but the bulls could not sustain the buying pressure and push the price to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7aa6d13e-fbdb-4ef7-8ac8-9ef468dfd035.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Dec. 7 and the bears are trying to sink the price back below the 20-day EMA of $5.92. If this level fails to hold, the selling momentum could pick up and the UNI/USDT pair could decline to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above $6.55, it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the buyers. The pair could then rise to the resistance line where the bulls may again encounter strong selling by the bears. The next trending move could begin on a break above or below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvMzM4OGI0YjAtNWI4Yi00NWQxLTlmZTMtYTJkMTg3NWFkNGI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221208eic70005w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,688 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins have stumbled near overhead resistance, indicating that the recovery will take longer than most investors expect.\par \par \uc2 The FTX crisis kept Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price under pressure in November, but data from \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  exchange shows institutional investors may have viewed the dip as a buying opportunity. The exchange told Cointelegraph that compared to October, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-investors-still-eye-crypto-despite-the-ftx-collapse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revenue from institutions increased}}}\uc2  by 34% in November.\par \par \uc2 In another positive sign, \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  executive Mathew McDermott told Reuters that the bank was doing some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-reportedly-looking-to-buy-crypto-firms-after-ftx-collapse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 due diligence on crypto companies}}}\uc2  since they were \u8220\'20\'1Cpriced more sensibly\u8221\'20\'1D after the FTX crash.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/5ed10a92-d568-487f-98df-a12c7c39febc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 ARK Invest said in the latest edition of its monthly \u8220\'20\'1CThe Bitcoin Monthly" newsletter, that the FTX implosion \u8220\'20\'1Ccould be the most damaging event in crypto history,\u8221\'20\'1D but added that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-clings-to-17k-as-ark-flags-historically-significant-capitulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized blockchains were}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cas strong as ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could lower levels attract buyers in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to spot the levels where buyers may step in.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading near the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,966) for the past few days, Bitcoin is threatening to dip below the immediate support at $16,787.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b69fc985-e9eb-41aa-83cd-896b66050bf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bears and the BTC/USDT pair may drop to $16,000. Such a move will suggest that the pair could remain stuck between $15,476 and $17,622 for a few more days. The longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger will be the breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average ($18,122) to gain the upper hand. The pair could then pick up momentum and rally to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for the past few days, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($1,250) on Dec. 7. This suggests that the bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7d76679b-9639-4bb5-a282-ad9b178e4ebc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could dive to $1,151 and then to the important support at $1,073.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up quickly and climbs back above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying on dips. That could increase the likelihood of a break above the 50-day SMA ($1,331). Above this level, there is no significant resistance until the pair reaches the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $300 on Dec. 5 but the bears held their ground. The sellers strengthened their position on Dec. 7 by pulling the price below the immediate support at $285.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/2bfd1c7d-6d35-4680-b62b-f31ee75847d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $285, the BNB/USDT pair could slump to $275. This level may act as a minor support but if it breaks down, the selling could pick up and the pair may plunge to the crucial support at $250.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to push and sustain the price above $300. That could trap the aggressive bears on the wrong foot and push the price toward the overhead resistance at $338. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($0.39) in the past few days and pulled XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the uptrend line on Dec. 7. This invalidates the developing ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/17b0cebe-9e70-4e29-89ac-9d683af41e46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to salvage the situation by defending the strong support at $0.37. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.37 and $0.41 for some time. A break and close above $0.41 will suggest the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to break the support at $0.37 and pull the price to $0.34. That could keep the pair range-bound between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($0.32) on Dec. 5 which may have tempted short-term buyers to close their longs and the bears to establish fresh short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/22266015-8a36-4ad9-8c4a-cc8cabe7371c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to pull the price below the crucial support at $0.29 but they may face strong resistance from the bulls because if the level gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Although the trend is down, the relative strength index (RSI) is maintaining its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that lower levels may attract buyers. The first sign of sustainable recovery could be on a break and close above $0.33. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Dec. 5 candlestick shows that bears are defending the 50% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/35eeebca-278d-41ad-9d66-2a2ff7e1d0e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Dec. 7 but a minor positive is that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($0.09). If the price rebounds off the current level, the pair could again rise to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dropped close to the center which suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be waning. The bears may try to tug the price below the 50-day SMA and gain the upper hand. If they succeed, the pair could gradually slip toward $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to thrust Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above $0.95 on Dec. 5 but the bears vigorously defended the level. The price turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.90) on Dec. 7. This indicates that efforts by the bulls to flip the 20-day EMA into support have failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b97085eb-b60c-4ebc-ab8d-6bbf8383b99d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon this opportunity and drag the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on as the bulls have successfully defended it on three previous occasions. If this support collapses, the MATIC/USDT pair could slide to the crucial support at $0.69.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the overhead resistance at $0.97. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) repeatedly broke above the 20-day EMA ($5.50) from Dec. 2 to 5 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. This shows that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/22940867-66d2-4f59-ad43-3810707b2e93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to resume the downtrend by pulling the price below the strong support at $5. If they do that, the DOT/USDT pair could plummet to $4.32.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off $5. That will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then try to drive the price above $5.73. If they can pull it off, it could signal a double bottom pattern. The pair could then rise to $6.18 and later to the pattern target of $6.46, which is near the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $84 resistance on Dec. 5 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows selling at higher levels. This may have tempted short-term traders to book profits, which has pulled the price to the breakout level of $75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fade5f29-3c6f-4824-8fb5-bcc5f85be6cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping up but the RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the buying pressure may be reducing. A break and close below the 20-day EMA ($74) could enhance the prospects of a drop to the 50-day SMA ($64).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($74), it will suggest that the trend remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $85 and push the LTC/USDT pair toward $104.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) climbed above the 50-day SMA ($6.16) on Dec. 2 but the bulls could not sustain the buying pressure and push the price to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7aa6d13e-fbdb-4ef7-8ac8-9ef468dfd035.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Dec. 7 and the bears are trying to sink the price back below the 20-day EMA ($5.92). If this level fails to hold, the selling momentum could pick up and the UNI/USDT pair could decline to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above $6.55, it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the buyers. The pair could then rise to the resistance line where the bulls may again encounter strong selling by the bears. The next trending move could begin on a break above or below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvMzM4OGI0YjAtNWI4Yi00NWQxLTlmZTMtYTJkMTg3NWFkNGI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221207eic7000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,814 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins may need equities markets to sustain their recent momentum in order to break the crypto market out of its current resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s the final month of the year and analysts are out with their projections for the next year. In a note to investors, \uc2 Standard Chartered\uc2  suggested that \u8220\'20\'1CThe financial-market surprises of 2023\u8221\'20\'1D will include Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price diving to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/standard-chartered-forecasts-surprise-bitcoin-downside-after-ftx-collapse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $5,000}}}\uc2  at some point in the year. The fall will be triggered by a liquidity crunch, which could result in more bankruptcies and a fall in investor confidence in the crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 If this feels like an extreme, venture capitalist Tim Draper went in the opposite direction and predicted that Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/12/05/tim-draper-predicts-bitcoin-will-reach-250000-despite-ftx-collapse.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 skyrocket}}}\uc2  to $250,000 by the middle of 2023. While speaking with CNBC, Draper said that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s massive rally is likely to be fuelled by increased participation from women who control a large part of retail spending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/a2fff6be-37d5-4e10-8169-6f1238ca55c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In the short term, analysts remain divided on the prospects of a Bitcoin rally. While some analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-levels-to-watch-as-bitcoin-holds-17k-into-the-market-open"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expect a Christmas rally}}}\uc2  to push Bitcoin toward $19,000, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imminent-crash-for-stocks-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 others are not so optimistic}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could the S&P 500 index (SPX) witness profit booking in the near term? Is the U.S. dollar index (DXY) ripe for a recovery? What is the effect of these two asset classes on cryptocurrencies? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average (3,967) on Nov. 30, indicating that bulls continue to view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1efd5b0d-54d7-4a9e-8ee9-d1f4d5a208cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price reached the downtrend line on Dec. 1 but the bulls failed to pierce this resistance. This indicates that the downtrend line is likely to act as a formidable resistance. The price could oscillate between the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the price closes above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further and the index may rally to 4,300.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could pull the index to the 50-day simple moving average (3,818).\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in the U.S. dollar index (DXY) fizzled out at the 20-day EMA (107) on Nov. 30. This shows that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/defc980d-129d-4d1d-9c63-3deba6011c95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the strong support of 105 on Dec. 1 and thwarted attempts by the bulls to push the price back above 105 on Dec. 2. Although the downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears, they could not capitalize on the breakdown and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price back above 105 on Dec. 5. If bulls sustain the price above this level, the index could ascend to the 20-day EMA. This level could again act as a barrier but if bulls catapult the price above it, the index could rally to 108.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading near the 20-day EMA ($16,979) for the past four days, Bitcoin attempted a move higher on Dec. 5. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/c719a573-a7cb-4268-b17e-b7ac96bda349.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to defend the overhead zone between $17,622 and the 50-day SMA ($18,223) with vigor. If the price turns down from the zone but does not break below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are buying on dips. That could increase the likelihood of a rally to $20,000 and thereafter to $21,500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the BTC/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $15,476 and $18,200 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) back below the 20-day EMA ($1,251) on Dec. 3 but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that the buyers are defending the 20-day EMA aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/1e48d9e4-a3dd-4c54-bbf8-f71a293e4a76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. This improves the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA ($1,334).\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the resistance line of the descending channel which could act as a major roadblock.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below $1,236 could suggest that bears are attempting a comeback. The pair could then slide to $1,150.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) price has been trading near the moving averages for the past three days. This indicates a tussle between the bulls and the bears to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/c659bca3-559d-4637-b0ff-5685def18930.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $300 to indicate strength. The BNB/USDT pair could then rise to $318 and thereafter to $338.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below $285, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $275. There is a minor support at this level but if it fails to hold, the decline could extend to the vital support at $250.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at $0.41 but finding support at the uptrend line. The price action of the past few days has formed an ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.41.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/ae797fa7-5c90-4ef6-bfc0-f0808217f9b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, it will suggest a potential trend reversal and the XRP/USDT pair could start an up-move to $0.45 and later to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the uptrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could sink the price to $0.37 and then to $0.34. Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the large range between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) nudged above the 20-day EMA ($0.32) on Dec. 5 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b4bde8fb-739b-4907-8f7d-2e51102d3194.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 For the recovery to strengthen further, the bulls will have to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.35) and subsequently to the downtrend line. This level may offer a strong resistance to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a range-bound action in the near term. The bears will have to sink the price below $0.29 to signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/litecoin-eyes-100-after-rare-ltc-price-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin eyes $100 after 'rare' LTC price breakout}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery rose above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.10 and reached near the 50% retracement level of $0.11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/f9169e8f-d5d3-482a-ae0b-f5e777fdfc41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Dec. 5 candlestick shows that the bears are defending the zone between the 50% retracement at $0.11 and the 61.8% retracement at $0.13. The first line of support to watch out for on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.09).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers and that could increase the possibility of a rally above $0.13. The pair could then complete a 100% retracement and rise to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be negated if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.90) on Dec. 4, indicating that bulls are attempting to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/44faf6cb-17cc-47ea-8b1e-4a95c1dee4d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to slope up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating that buyers have a slight edge. There is a minor resistance at $0.97 but it is likely to be crossed. The MATIC/USDT pair could then rally to $1.05 where the bears may try to stall the recovery.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $1.05, the pair could again drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong bounce off it could improve the chances of a break above $1.05. Contrarily, a break below the moving averages could pave the way for a decline to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($5.54) on Dec. 2 and the bulls successfully defended the retest on Dec. 3. Buyers tried to propel the price to the 50-day SMA ($5.92) on Dec. 5 but met with significant resistance at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/19c08db4-4798-490b-8222-d75efac9260a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen to the midpoint, indicating that the downward momentum is weakening. This increases the possibility of a break above the 50-day SMA. If this level is crossed, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. This level is likely to act as a major obstacle for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could decline to $5.30 and then to $5.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvZDJiM2I3NzUtZWJmOC00MzM3LTg1MzgtYTllODQwOTZjOTEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221205eic5000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,762 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are beginning to flash signals of a potential trend change, but a handful of downside risks remain.\par \par \uc2 Non-farm payrolls in the United States rose by 263,000 in November, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/12/02/jobs-report-november-2022.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exceeding}}}\uc2  economists\u8217\'20\'19 expectations of an increase of 200,000. Analysts believe that the numbers remain hot and do not allow much scope for the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  to slow down its aggressive rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 This is contrary to Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s remarks delivered at the \uc2 Brookings Institution\uc2 , where he said that the central bank could reduce the pace of rate hikes \u8220\'20\'1Cas soon as December.\u8221\'20\'1D That triggered a sharp rally in risk assets. After the latest jobs report, the market participants will closely watch the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s comments and decision in its Dec. 13 and Dec.14 meeting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fefbad8b-ad1a-4054-bb90-d14ffb699b60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s decision may also affect Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which remains in a firm bear grip. Coinglass data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-worst-monthly-close-in-2-years-as-traders-watch-16-7k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly returns in November}}}\uc2  of 2018, 2019 and 2021 were negative and that was followed by a further fall in December.\par \par \uc2 Will history repeat itself and Bitcoin decline again in December or will buyers come out on top and push the price higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to gain some insight.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin soared above the descending triangle and the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $16,949 on Nov. 30. This is the first indication that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/d759d934-c3b6-425e-9672-c03babaff3d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium would shift in favor of the bulls if they thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above this level, the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair could pick up momentum and rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $18,349. This level may again act as a huddle but is likely to be crossed. The pair could then start its northward march toward $21,500.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to propel the price above $17,622, the pair could remain range-bound for some more time.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern but the bulls are attempting to tilt the short-term advantage in their favor. Buyers drove the price above the 20-day EMA of $1,245 on Nov. 30, suggesting demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/192cb553-3af7-4e9a-b67b-a9fad5d78d75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to stall the recovery at the 50-day SMA of $1,335, but the likelihood of a break above it is high. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel. This level may prove to be a major roadblock for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the failure to push the price above the 50-day SMA may create an opening for the bears to pull the pair back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then give back its recent gains and drop to $1,151.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on Nov. 29 but the bulls could not clear the overhead barrier at $300. This indicates that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/4741227b-f11b-40d7-8872-99281496b433.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price dipped back below the moving averages on Dec. 2 and the bears are trying to pull the BNB/USDT pair below $286. If they can pull it off, the pair could decline to $275 and thereafter to the strong support at $258.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $306, it will suggest that buyers are attempting a comeback. The pair could then attempt a rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint, indicate a range formation.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) again failed to break above the overhead resistance of $0.41 on Nov. 30 and Dec. 1, indicating that the bears are vigorously defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b1149468-a2c4-4e16-8adb-459b3f944ae9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has slipped below the 20-day EMA of $0.40 and the bears will now try to pull the price below $0.37. If they do that, the pair may extend its stay inside the large range between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or $0.37, it will suggest buying on dips. The bulls will then try to propel the price above the 50-day SMA of $0.43 and start an up-move to $0.51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure could be reduced and a recovery may be on the cards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7e8700f1-a631-45fd-9507-cfdd64b7414c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price climbs above the 20-day EMA of $0.32, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could pick up momentum and attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then again drop toward $0.29.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.12. This suggests that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/047db9fb-f89b-4291-a61e-8ff3d3d337c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has dipped to the breakout level of $0.09, which is an important level to watch out for. A strong bounce-off will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will then again try to drive the price above $0.11 and resume the recovery. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the 61.8% retracement level of $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.09, it will suggest that the recovery may be over. The pair could then decline to the moving averages and later to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the moving averages on Nov. 30, suggesting that the bulls are making a comeback. The price turned down on Dec. 1 but the bulls are attempting to flip the 20-day EMA of $0.89 into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/cb443319-4fab-4c2a-be8d-f8dd7bad2d8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $0.97, the recovery could pick up the pace and the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.05. This level may act as a stumbling block, but if the bulls push the price above it, the pair could make a dash toward $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from $0.97, the bears will make another attempt to drag the pair below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could retest the support at the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/apecoin-risks-30-crash-after-ape-staking-debut-in-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ApeCoin risks 30% crash after APE staking debut in December}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a recovery in a downtrend. After hesitating near the 20-day EMA of $5.53 for two days, buyers pushed the price above the resistance on Dec. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/934ff939-7f42-470b-810c-88056693f901.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA of $5.96, which may act as a minor obstacle, but it is likely to be crossed. The pair could thereafter extend the relief rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The bears had halted two previous recovery attempts at the downtrend line, hence they may again try to defend the level. If bears want to regain control, they will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and break the support at $5. The pair could then plummet to $4.32.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the breakout level of $75 but the bulls are facing stiff resistance in the zone between $80 and $84. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/571130d3-d32c-45cf-909d-333d266b8b21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This indicates that the positive momentum could be weakening. The LTC/USDT pair may remain stuck between the 20-day EMA and $84 for a while.\par \par \uc2 A consolidation near the overhead resistance is usually a positive sign as it suggests that buyers are not hurrying to book profits. If the bulls propel the price above $84, a new uptrend could begin and the pair may rally to $104.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $70, the pair could start a decline to the 50-day SMA ($61).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA of $5.74 on Nov. 30. This is the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will try to strengthen their position by kicking the price above the 50-day SMA of $6.17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/98be3576-b8ad-410e-ad56-4768baa702e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, it will suggest that the symmetrical triangle may have acted as a reversal pattern. The pair could then start a new up-move to $8 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then retest the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvMDM1NWUyNGMtODU4ZC00YTI4LThhOWMtY2VhMjlhMTYzODFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221203eic20008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,742 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 December 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are beginning to flash signals of a potential trend change, but a handful of downside risks remain.\par \par \uc2 Non-farm payrolls in the United States rose by 263,000 in November, exceeding economists\u8217\'20\'19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/12/02/jobs-report-november-2022.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expectations}}}\uc2  of an increase of 200,000. Analysts believe that the numbers remain hot and do not allow much scope for the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  to slow down its aggressive rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 This is contrary to Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s remarks delivered at the \uc2 Brookings Institution\uc2  where he said that the central bank could reduce the pace of rate hikes \u8220\'20\'1Cas soon as December.\u8221\'20\'1D That triggered a sharp rally in risk assets. After the latest jobs report, the market participants will closely watch the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s comments and decision in its Dec. 13 and Dec.14 meeting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/fefbad8b-ad1a-4054-bb90-d14ffb699b60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The Fed\u8217\'20\'19s decision may also affect Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which remains in a firm bear grip. Coinglass data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-worst-monthly-close-in-2-years-as-traders-watch-16-7k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s monthly returns in November}}}\uc2  of 2018, 2019, and 2021 were negative and that was followed by a further fall in December.\par \par \uc2 Will history repeat itself and Bitcoin decline again in December or will buyers come out on top and push the price higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to gain some insight.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin soared above the descending triangle and the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,949) on Nov. 30. This is the first indication that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/d759d934-c3b6-425e-9672-c03babaff3d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium would shift in favor of the bulls if they thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above this level, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($18,349). This level may again act as a huddle but is likely to be crossed. The pair could then start its northward march toward $21,500.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to propel the price above $17,622, the pair could remain range-bound for some more time.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel pattern but the bulls are attempting to tilt the short-term advantage in their favor. Buyers drove the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,245) on Nov. 30, suggesting demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/192cb553-3af7-4e9a-b67b-a9fad5d78d75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to stall the recovery at the 50-day SMA ($1,335) but the likelihood of a break above it is high. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel. This level may prove to be a major roadblock for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the failure to push the price above the 50-day SMA may create an opening for the bears to pull the pair back below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then give back its recent gains and drop to $1,151.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on Nov. 29 but the bulls could not clear the overhead barrier at $300. This indicates that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/4741227b-f11b-40d7-8872-99281496b433.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price dipped back below the moving averages on Dec. 2 and the bears are trying to pull the BNB/USDT pair below $286. If they can pull it off, the pair could decline to $275 and thereafter to the strong support at $258.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $306, it will suggest that buyers are attempting a comeback. The pair could then attempt a rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint, indicate a range formation.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) again failed to break above the overhead resistance of $0.41 on Nov. 30 and Dec. 1, indicating that the bears are vigorously defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/b1149468-a2c4-4e16-8adb-459b3f944ae9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.40) and the bears will now try to pull the price below $0.37. If they do that, the pair may extend its stay inside the large range between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or $0.37, it will suggest buying on dips. The bulls will then try to propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.43) and start an up-move to $0.51.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing and a recovery may be on the cards.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/7e8700f1-a631-45fd-9507-cfdd64b7414c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price climbs above the 20-day EMA ($0.32), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could pick up momentum and attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then again drop toward $0.29.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.12. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/047db9fb-f89b-4291-a61e-8ff3d3d337c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has dipped to the breakout level of $0.09, which is an important level to watch out for. A strong bounce-off it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will then again try to drive the price above $0.11 and resume the recovery. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the 61.8% retracement level of $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.09, it will suggest that the recovery may be over. The pair could then decline to the moving averages and later to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the moving averages on Nov. 30, suggesting that bulls are making a comeback. The price turned down on Dec. 1 but the bulls are attempting to flip the 20-day EMA ($0.89) into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/cb443319-4fab-4c2a-be8d-f8dd7bad2d8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above $0.97, the recovery could pick up pace and the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.05. This level may act as a stumbling block but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could make a dash toward $1.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from $0.97, the bears will make another attempt to drag the pair below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could retest the support at the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/apecoin-risks-30-crash-after-ape-staking-debut-in-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ApeCoin risks 30% crash after APE staking debut in December}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a recovery in a downtrend. After hesitating near the 20-day EMA ($5.53) for two days, buyers pushed the price above the resistance on Dec. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/934ff939-7f42-470b-810c-88056693f901.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($5.96), which may act as a minor obstacle but it is likely to be crossed. The pair could thereafter extend the relief rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The bears had halted two previous recovery attempts at the downtrend line, hence they may again try to defend the level. If bears want to regain control, they will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and break the support at $5. The pair could then plummet to $4.32.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the breakout level of $75 but the bulls are facing stiff resistance in the zone between $80 and $84. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/571130d3-d32c-45cf-909d-333d266b8b21.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This indicates that the positive momentum could be weakening. The LTC/USDT pair may remain stuck between the 20-day EMA and $84 for a while.\par \par \uc2 A consolidation near the overhead resistance is usually a positive sign as it suggests that buyers are not hurrying to book profits. If bulls propel the price above $84, a new uptrend could begin and the pair may rally to $104.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $70, the pair could start a decline to the 50-day SMA ($61).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($5.74) on Nov. 30. This is the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will try to strengthen their position by kicking the price above the 50-day SMA ($6.17).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-12/98be3576-b8ad-410e-ad56-4768baa702e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, it will suggest that the symmetrical triangle may have acted as a reversal pattern. The pair could then start a new up-move to $8 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then retest the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTIvMDM1NWUyNGMtODU4ZC00YTI4LThhOWMtY2VhMjlhMTYzODFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221202eic2000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,824 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and many altcoins are kicking up dust after the Federal Reserve chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  discussed the possibility of smaller rate hikes in 2023, but is the momentum sustainable?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has shrugged off the weakness in the United States equities markets and is attempting to start a recovery on Nov. 30. Buyers are attempting to achieve a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-taps-17k-as-analysis-warns-of-inbound-bitcoin-risk-events"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 monthly close above $17,000}}}\uc2 . This suggests that the selling that had picked up due to the FTX crisis may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Usually, smaller investors panic and dump their holdings in a bear market but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/non-whale-bitcoin-investors-break-new-btc-accumulation-record"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it has been the opposite with Bitcoin investors}}}\uc2 . According to Glassnode data released on Nov. 27, investors holding less than one Bitcoin, also called shrimps, bought 96,200 Bitcoin since the FTX crash.\par \par \uc2 Along similar lines, investors holding between 1 to 10 Bitcoin, classified as crabs, bought 191,600 Bitcoin over the past 30 days. This shows investors are continuing to accumulate at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/2ad166cb-47b0-48b7-a10d-d8c064d48b98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a sharp recovery in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is unlikely for some time. Trading firm QCP Capital believes that the United States Consumer Price Index data on Dec. 13 and the U.S. Fed\u8217\'20\'19s policy decision on Dec. 14 could act as risk factors because many investors could be \u8220\'20\'1Cforced to continually sell assets to raise liquidity.\u8221\'20\'1D QCP expects the situation to turn around only in the second or third quarter of next year after the Fed possibly pivots and releases liquidity in the system.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin lead the cryptocurrency markets higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned up from $15,995 on Nov. 28 and broke above the developing descending triangle pattern on Nov. 30. This invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and may have attracted buying from the bulls who are trying to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($16,910).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6672131a-cd10-4d01-9a4d-2718d459cc67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bears may be losing their grip. The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to $17,622 and later to the 50-day simple moving average ($18,434). The sellers are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone but bounces off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying the dips. That could increase the possibility of a rally to $20,000 and then to $21,500.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from $17,622. If that happens, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $15,476 and $17,622 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,234) on Nov. 26 but the bulls arrested the decline at $1,151 on Nov. 28. This indicates a pick-up in demand and a sign that the sentiment could be turning positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/beb48143-c9f5-4888-a8c5-53d60202cbc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA and will next attempt to break above the 50-day SMA ($1,335). If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. This level may attract strong selling by the bears because a break above the channel could indicate a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to defend the 50-day SMA and pull the price back below $1,051. The pair could then decline to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on Nov. 29 but the bulls are struggling to build upon this move. This suggests that bears are likely to pose a strong challenge between $300 and $318.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f55d487a-a9b4-4a88-abd9-03f3e36d673b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($292) is flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The advantage could tilt in favor of the buyers if they catapult the price above $318. That could clear the path for a rally to $338 where the bears may again erect a stiff barrier.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages. The pair could then decline to the support at $258.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the retest of the breakout from the symmetrical triangle on Nov. 28. This is a positive sign as it shows that traders are buying the dips in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/0236eac0-fc5c-4524-bdcd-3d183f000224.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce has reached the overhead resistance at $0.41, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If bulls catapult the price above this resistance, the XRP/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.45 and then to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are aggressively selling near $0.41. They will then again try to pull the price inside the triangle. If they can pull it off, the pair could drop to $0.34.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains in a downtrend but the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/277cb540-1b2c-496a-830d-9a82cf83f6f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to thrust and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.32) to signal strength. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may start a recovery to the downtrend line. The 50-day SMA ($0.36) may act as a resistance but is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are selling on minor rallies. The bears will then try to resume the downtrend and sink the price to the support line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Nov. 28, indicating that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/5da93f31-029a-4af5-a361-99f5ae594034.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI above 60 suggest that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers are trying to extend the recovery to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.11 and next to the 61.8% retracement level of $0.12.\par \par \uc2 The sellers are likely to mount a strong defense in this zone. If the price turns down from it, the DOGE/USDT pair could again drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers thrust the price above the overhead zone, the pair could complete a 100% retracement and rally to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the 20-day EMA ($0.88) and the uptrend line. The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/11ca6282-cd2b-4189-beed-8fa70c8829de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to drive the price above the moving averages and gain the upper hand. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair could climb to $0.97 and then rally to $1.05. This level could again attract selling by the bears but if bulls clear this hurdle, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the moving averages and slides below the uptrend line. The pair could then drop to the important support at $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftm-price-rebounds-50-as-fantom-reveals-30-years-runway-without-having-to-sell-its-token"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTM price rebounds 50% as Fantom reveals 30 years runway (without having to sell its token)}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $5.06 on Nov. 28, indicating that bulls are attempting to form a low at $5. The price reached the 20-day EMA ($5.52) on Nov. 30, which is likely to act as a formidable resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/80bf7829-0168-4fec-ae57-232a8fee7838.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence as it has not tracked the DOT/USDT pair lower. This indicates that the selling pressure could be weakening and increases the likelihood of a break above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($6) and later attempt a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are viewing the relief rallies as a selling opportunity. A break below $5 could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $4.32.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) Nov. 28 candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. This suggests that buyers are trying to flip the breakout level of $75 into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/b6b22edf-ab85-4aed-af58-c31116a84c53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($69) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will have to push the price above $84 to start a new up-move, which could reach $104.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls fail to propel the price above $84, the bears will again try to sink the LTC/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, several aggressive bulls may get trapped resulting in long liquidation. The pair may then fall to the 50-day SMA ($60).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are buying the dips to the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. This is a positive sign as it indicates demand at lower levels. Buyers are trying to strengthen their position by pushing Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($5.67).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/423a03aa-36e9-4b72-8a5f-3519ff53eb40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has risen close to the midpoint, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the UNI/USDT pair may attempt a rally to the resistance line of the triangle. A break above the triangle will suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price fails to rise above the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. They will then again try to pull the price below the triangle and open the doors for a decline to $4.60 and then $3.33.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvMGQ4ODVlNmUtMDllZi00MGViLWE2NmMtMjBiZGJiNzllOTk4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221130eibu000e9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Kyle White \par \uc2 897 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market and Bitcoin is up today, possibly due to positive news from the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins all rallied after \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  suggested that December could see the start of smaller-sized interest rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 Crypto and equities markets responded positively to Powell\u8217\'20\'19s Brookings Institute {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.brookings.edu/events/federal-reserve-chair-jerome-powell-the-economic-outlook-and-the-labor-market/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speech}}}\uc2  in which he mentioned promising developments with inflation leading to softer rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 Generally, the crypto market is still reeling from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-bankruptcy-filing-speculates-over-1-million-creditors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX\u8217\'20\'19s recent bankruptcy}}}\uc2 , but Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price reacted positively by rallying to an intraday high at $17,191, while traders are still {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-worst-case-scenario-puts-btc-bear-market-bottom-near-6k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warning of a final capitulation}}}\uc2  in BTC price.\par \par \uc2 With \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  still likely, some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-taps-17k-as-analysis-warns-of-inbound-bitcoin-risk-events"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts believe the bottom is still not in}}}\uc2  for the crypto market and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-capitulations-abound-data-shows-realized-and-unrealized-losses-at-record-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC on-chain losses}}}\uc2  hit record highs.\par \par \uc2 The picture for the rest of Q4 remains muddy with the official Federal Reserve meeting on Dec. 3, while some analysts still expect 2022 to copy the 2018 bear market. At the same time, there is hope that this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bear-market-will-last-2-3-months-max-interview-with-btc-analyst-philip-swift"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gone for good}}}\uc2  by the start of 2023 with lower inflation and lower rate increases.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three of the major factors influencing crypto market strength on the day.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/a7c9f077-34ea-4a25-b6a9-d56996438a7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Nasdaq, S&P 500, Dow Jones, Ether and Bitcoin. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Powell\u8217\'20\'19s statement suggests progress is being made with high inflation\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 High inflation}}}\uc2  has been a year-long problem and back-to-back negative CPI reports have given the Fed multiple reasons to continue raising rates. After the CPI data boosted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-gains-1k-in-minutes-as-cpi-data-deals-dxy-fresh-2-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin upward of $1,000 in minutes}}}\uc2  on Nov. 10, further positive data and Powell\u8217\'20\'19s speech may have confirmed that inflation has peaked.\par \par \uc2 If inflation were to level off, Powell's suggestion of smaller hikes in subsequent months would likely result in boosted sentiment from market participants. Powell noted:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt makes sense to moderate the pace of our rate increases as we approach the level of restraint that will be sufficient to bring inflation down. The time for moderating the pace of rate increases may come as soon as the December meeting.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 December\u8217\'20\'19s Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) is currently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html?redirect=/trading/interest-rates/countdown-to-fomc.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 expected}}}\uc2  to yield a hike of 25 to 50 basis points, not the usual 75 basis points, according to \uc2 CME Group\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FedWatch Tool.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/87665cef-e0ba-405a-96c1-bbc6a7153f0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Fed target rate probabilities chart. Source: \uc2 CME Group\par \par \uc2 Powell cautioned that aggressive monetary policy would continue saying:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDespite some promising developments, we have a long way to go in restoring price stability\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin analysts celebrate Powell\u8217\'20\'19s speech\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin still has risk events that can impact the price, BTC futures are showing traders switch from majority short to long. According to Coinglass, 51.91% of traders are long Bitcoin at a ratio of 1.08 compared to BTC shorts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/82cb39fb-d478-4548-b96a-f9c1a08311e7.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin long versus short ratio. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 In October, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sharp-bitcoin-price-move-expected-as-volatility-hangs-at-record-lows-and-sellers-are-exhausted"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  even fell below}}}\uc2  that of some major fiat currencies, making BTC look more like a stablecoin than a risk asset. But November has been a different story after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-collapse-followed-by-an-uptick-in-stablecoin-inflows-and-dex-activity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX\u8217\'20\'19s failure}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A look at the Bitcoin historical \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  index (BVOL) shows \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has settled around 2.49.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/827f668a-c8a8-4cfd-97f3-8444dc7c8ea6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  index. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Charles Edwards, the founder of crypto asset management firm Capriole was quite \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the news.\par \par \uc2 The Fed is pivoting. The language starts soft and preps the market. Right on schedule for Q1.\par \par \uc2 So we have:\par \par \uc2 - Ultra undervalued Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 - Leverage completely wiped out\par \par \uc2 - indications of a changing policy\par \par \uc2 The stage is set. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/gQTjSxMXYe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/gQTjSxMXYe}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Edwards (@caprioleio) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/caprioleio/status/1598024643046125568?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 30, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-30-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-doge-matic-dot-ltc-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 11/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin price has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/don-t-believe-the-hype-bitcoin-price-rally-to-17k-reflects-improving-sentiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 been impacted by the endless flow of negative news}}}\uc2 , today\u8217\'20\'19s rally shows a flash of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The dollar continues to cool off\par \par \uc2 After a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-still-has-14k-target-warns-trader-as-dxy-due-parabola-break"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 parabolic uptrend throughout 2022}}}\uc2 , the U.S. dollar index is now beginning to show signs of cooling off.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) recently hit its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-loses-20k-as-trader-warns-us-dollar-not-quite-topped-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highest levels since 2002}}}\uc2 , and momentum may have cooled after the recent CPI and PPI print showed the Fed making some progress with run-away inflation. In a perfect world, investors would ideally view a retracting DXY as a reason to increase sentiment for risk assets like cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime, DXY is under pressure and its descent came in lockstep with a return to form for Bitcoin and altcoins. Historically, a cooling DXY is followed by Bitcoin price moving in the opposite direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/3ed6ebc4-0117-49ae-bd5c-b007a91dc455.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/DXY comparison. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Overall, crypto markets are likely to continue seeing price whipsaws and most analysts agree that there are plenty of volatile days ahead.\par \par \uc2 While the positive news of easing rates is providing a nice short-term bump in crypto prices, Powell\u8217\'20\'19s ultimate decision in December will be the true determinant of which direction the market chooses to take.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvYTYzMzIzMGQtM2Y5YS00NzQ5LThiYWItMDE3YzRiOTQzNWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221130eibu000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/28: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,758 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Weakness in the stock markets may add to the selling pressure in Bitcoin and altcoins.\par \par \uc2 China witnessed a spike in COVID-19 cases and that has resulted in strict lockdown restrictions in several parts of the country. This triggered widespread protests in China and has possibly pulled the global stock markets lower.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the turmoil in China, the cryptocurrency markets, which are already in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market}}}\uc2  grip, are reeling under pressure from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blockfi-files-for-bankruptcy-as-many-expected-cites-ftx-collapse-for-its-troubles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chapter 11 bankruptcy filing by BlockFi}}}\uc2  and its subsidiaries. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is down 21% in November, on track to its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-teleport-to-14k-or-worse-if-btc-breaks-16k-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 worst November performance since 2018}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6e22b048-d166-4319-8797-91c9451d1bce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-millionaire-wallets-drop-80-in-year-of-btc-price-bear-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drastically reduced the number of wallets}}}\uc2  holding more than $1 million worth of Bitcoin. There were 112,898 millionaire wallets on Nov. 8, 2021, but Glassnode data shows that as of Nov. 25, only 23,245 wallets boast of a Bitcoin balance worth $1 million or more.\par \par \uc2 Could the weakness in the S&P 500 index (SPX) pull Bitcoin below $16,000? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the S&P 500 index has risen close to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to defend this level as they had done on two previous occasions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/58c5878a-f57b-437d-935d-20a52940bdce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will have to sink the price below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA of 3,922 to tilt the short-term advantage in their favor. Post that, the index could drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 3,794 and later to 3,700.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance but bounces off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. That could improve the prospects of a break above the downtrend line. If that happens, the index could rise to 4,300. Such a move will suggest that the downtrend has ended.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) turned down from 108 on Nov. 21, indicating that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the traders may be using the rallies to lighten long positions and establish short positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/e8e869a2-ef4d-49b6-8ad3-edd7857b84c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA of 108 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that the bears are in command. If the bears succeed in pulling the price below 105, the selling could intensify and the index may slide to 103.50 and then 102.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the rebound off $105 sustains, the recovery could reach the 20-day EMA. If the relief rally again faces rejection at this level, the likelihood of a break below 105 increases.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, buyers will have to pierce the resistance at 108 to signal a strong comeback. The index could then rise to the uptrend line, where it may face tough resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally could not even reach the 20-day EMA of $16,972, indicating that traders are hesitant to buy at higher levels. The sellers will now try to pull the price to the crucial support at $15,476.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/60fa14aa-badf-4858-a17d-875c231c6fe7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair is forming a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below $15,476. This negative setup has a target objective of $13,330.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to the bears, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it could invalidate the negative setup. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $17,622. Buyers will have to kick the price above this level to indicate that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA of $1,233 on Nov. 26, but the bulls could not propel the price above it. This suggests that the bears continue to defend the 20-day EMA vigorously.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/e059bfc0-56f8-469f-b860-1617be2a0315.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers may try to pull the price to the support line of the descending channel pattern, which is close to the psychologically critical level of $1,000.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are likely to defend this level with all their might but they will have to clear the overhead obstacle at the 20-day EMA to start a sustained recovery. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA of $1,337 and subsequently to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the channel could accelerate selling and sink the pair to the June low at $881.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery turned down from $318 on Nov. 26 and plunged back below the breakout level of $300 on Nov. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6713e2a3-d21e-402a-afc1-437be429c742.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to solidify their position by pulling the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, it will suggest that the break above $300 may have been a bull trap. The BNB/USDT pair could then decline to $275 and later to $258.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the moving averages, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The pair could then again rise to $318. If the bulls drive the price above this resistance, the pair could rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance of $0.41 on Nov. 25 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/bbaf129f-724e-445a-b318-4c71d5e05991.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This may have attracted selling by the bears, who pulled the price below the 20-day EMA of $0.39 on Nov. 28. The price has dipped to the breakout level from the symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $0.30 to $0.41 range for a few more days. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near 45 suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $0.41 to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) relief rally could not even reach the 20-day EMA of $0.33, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/aa1a622e-fb86-4f3a-9ff2-4b5b0bc9a35c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage and resume the downtrend by pulling the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the support near $0.30. If they do that, the pair could drop to the support line, where buyers may step in and arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate in the near term if the price rebounds off the support near $0.30 and rises above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then attempt a rally to the downtrend line, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-btc-miner-capitulation-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New BTC miner capitulation? 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) soared above the psychological level of $0.10 on Nov. 27, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. Profit booking pulled the price back into the range on Nov. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/21b5da0a-6cb6-418d-abe7-64541caa29ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA of $0.09 is gradually sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that buyers have a slight edge. If the price springs up from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to resume the up-move by pushing the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.11. If they manage to do that, the rally could reach the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the break above the range may have been a bull trap. The pair could then drop to the support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers are struggling to push Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA of $0.88. This suggests that the bears are viewing the relief rallies as a selling opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/fb8959ff-7f95-4164-b15e-7ea31a52602c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could again drop to the uptrend line. This level has acted as a strong support on four previous occasions, hence the bulls will again try to defend it aggressively. If the price bounces off the uptrend line, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA of $0.90.\par \par \uc2 A break above this level will suggest that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then rise to $0.97. On the contrary, if the price breaks below the uptrend line, the pair could drop to the important support at $0.69.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong downtrend. Attempts by the bulls to start a recovery fizzled out at $5.53 on Nov. 24. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/53ef573b-2820-4ffb-9bff-f17a99b54065.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price near the crucial support at $5. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $4.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $5, it will suggest demand at lower levels. Buyers will again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA of $5.57 and extend the relief rally. The pair could then rise to $6.50.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decisio