\par\par \b \uc2 Investors in Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) and Polkadot (DOT) Have Their Portfolios in Red, While Flasko (FLSK) Price Surge\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 665 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 November 2022\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2022, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Polkadot (DOT) are top coins in the cryptocurrency community. These tokens have witnessed good times since their launch, but the recent market declines have left investors second-guessing their investment in these coins with portfolios in the red.\par \par \uc2 This is why investors are looking to Flasko, a new alternative investment that analysts predict to have a 4,000% price surge in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Continues On A Downtrend\par \par \uc2 After Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) couldn't break its recent resistance at $0.44, analysts expected $0.32 to be the support. Still, the price of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) fell further to its current $0.30 alongside the broad cryptocurrency market. Investors believe that if the price of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) cannot hold the $0.30 price position, then a continuous fall would be expected.\par \par \uc2 Analysts point out data as seen in the Moving Average Convergence, prompting bulls to be careful as it shows a sell signal with frequent red bars. Conversely, if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) can successfully consolidate above the $0.30 price range for some days, investors can expect a short attempt at $0.44 or even higher in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 But, since the crypto market is still experiencing market downturns, it might take weeks or even months for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) to achieve a price of $1. This is why investors are already searching for other alternatives.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT): Upward Trend Not Foreseeable In The Short Term\par \par \uc2 In terms of social activity, Polkadot (DOT) has made some headlines in recent weeks as it topped the list. This was a positive development for the Polkadot (DOT) token since it showed its popularity among crypto communities.\par \par \uc2 But, even with these developments, things don't look too good for the Polkadot (DOT) token. CoinMarketCap shows that the Polkadot (DOT) token has had a negative 12% performance in the last seven days. At the time of writing, Polkadot (DOT) costs $5.16 after a 2.2% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the previous day.\par \par \uc2 A look at the stochastic signal showed that Polkadot (DOT) is currently oversold, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal. Even with Polkadot (DOT) topping blockchain lists of development activity, Polkadot (DOT) token volume has reduced in the past few days.\par \par \uc2 The daily chart showed worse things for the Polkadot (DOT) token, as many indicators showed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal in the coming days. With such data, investors aren't too keen on Polkadot (DOT) token providing gains in the coming weeks. This is why investors are in search of alternatives.\par \par \uc2 Experts Predict Flasko (FLSK) To Surge 4,000% In The Coming Months\par \par \uc2 Flasko will be the first alternative investment to let investors trade in fractionalized and minted NFTs. These NFTs are tied to real-world assets such as luxury wines, rare champagnes, and whiskeys.\par \par \uc2 A complete purchase of an NFT will let investors get their assets delivered to them. Flasko will partner with wine stores to get the assets into the market while ensuring investors can get discounts and first access to products. Currently, Flasko is worth $0.085, and analysts predict that this price will rise by 4,000% in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Though Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Polkadot (DOT) might have some good price action in the coming months, expert analysts believe that investing in Flasko would provide the best gains in the coming months. Since it has been audited by Solid Proof and will lock its liquidity for 33 years, investors are assured of a risk-free investment. You can follow the links below to learn more about the project.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://flasko.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://flasko.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.flasko.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://presale.flasko.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/flaskoio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/flaskoio}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/flasko_io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/flasko_io}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020221127eibr0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, LTC, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,702 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The recovery in Bitcoin and most major altcoins needs to clear the overhead hurdle to attract further buying and signal a potential bottom.\par \par \uc2 FTX\u8217\'20\'19s collapse dealt a major blow to the already fragile sentiment among cryptocurrency investors. Although a quick recovery is unlikely, Blockchain analysis firm \uc2 Chainalysis\uc2  said that the crypto universe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-survived-worse-than-the-fall-of-ftx-chainalysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could emerge stronger from this crisis }}}\uc2 . \uc2 Chainalysis\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 research lead Eric Jardine arrived at the conclusion after comparing FTX\u8217\'20\'19s fall to that of \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another calming statement came from Bloomberg Intelligence exchange-traded fund analyst James Seyffart, who said that there was a \u8220\'20\'1C99.9% chance\u8221\'20\'1D that the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) held the Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC }}}\uc2  ) it claimed. He added that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-still-due-12k-dip-says-trader-as-etf-guru-backs-gbtc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GBTC was \u8220\'20\'1Cunlikely\u8221\'20\'1D to be liquidated }}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/8d822321-94c6-42e6-8cc3-466eeca63ada.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360 }}}\par \par \uc2 The negative events of the past few days do not seem to have scared away the small investors who remain on an accumulating spree. According to blockchain analytics company Glassnode, the number of wallets holding at least one Bitcoin or more {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-addresses-holding-at-least-1-btc-close-in-to-a-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared in November }}}\uc2  and reached 950,000.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins extend their recovery in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off $15,476 on Nov. 21, indicating that lower levels are attracting buying by the aggressive bulls. The relative strength index (RSI) has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, suggesting that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/9bff7595-f971-4f89-8dd9-d6fbd70cef4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price above the overhead resistance zone between the 20-day exponential moving average ($17,186) and $17,622. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could indicate a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($18,718) and thereafter challenge the psychological level of $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears remain sellers on relief rallies. The bears will then again attempt to sink the pair below $15,588 and resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $12,200.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support near $1,073 on Nov. 22 and broke above the downtrend line on Nov. 24. This suggests that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/fcdd95fc-a38b-459d-8a57-3cd96266e25f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could next rise to the 20-day EMA ($1,248), which is an important level to watch out for. If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could attempt a rally to the resistance line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then endeavor to pull the price to the support line of the channel. If this support cracks, the pair could plunge to the critical support zone between $1,000 and $881.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB }}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong support of $258 on Nov. 21 but this proved to be a bear trap. The price turned up on Nov. 22 and the momentum picked up further on Nov. 23. This drove the price to the overhead resistance at $300.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/b3c08b9c-6e67-4904-a3c7-143477e705d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are witnessing a tough battle at $300 as seen from the Doji candlestick pattern formed on Nov. 24 and 25. If bulls come out on top, the BNB/USDT pair could climb to $338 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $258 and $300 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP }}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.34 on Nov. 21 and shot up above the symmetrical triangle and the 20-day EMA ($0.40) on Nov. 24. This showed that the uncertainty between the buyers and sellers resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/69453fda-3362-4385-92d2-f619d722169d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are trying to build upon the advantage by pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $0.41. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rise to $0.50 and then to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to stall the recovery at $0.41 and pull the price back into the triangle. If that happens, the aggressive bulls may get trapped and the pair could then plummet to the support line.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong downtrend. The bulls purchased the dip below $0.30 on Nov. 22 but are struggling to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.33).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f648c9d9-3ffa-4382-a2c2-778110fb3cf5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages indicate that bears have the upper hand but the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, which suggests that the selling pressure may be reducing. The first sign of strength will be a break above the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.36) and subsequently to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the pair could extend its downtrend and drop to the support line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support at $0.07 on Nov. 21, indicating that the bulls are trying to establish a higher low at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/a6df3281-8841-435a-bc83-6986b714513a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached $0.09 where the bulls are likely to encounter strong resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from the current level, the DOGE/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $0.07 and $0.09 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers propel the price above the overhead resistance, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may start a rally to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.10 and then to the 50% retracement level of $0.11.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC }}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the uptrend line on Nov. 21 but the relief rally turned down from the moving averages on Nov. 24. This suggests that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/b878101c-1e7d-494d-904e-75dca3c77bdf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers may once again attempt to sink the price below the uptrend line. If they manage to do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could drop to the important support at $0.69. The bulls are expected to vigorously defend this level because if it cracks, the pair could start a new down move and drop to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rises above the moving averages, the short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bulls. The pair could then rally to $0.97 and later to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-bitcoin-hit-110k-in-2023-3-reasons-to-be-bullish-on-btc-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Will Bitcoin hit $110K in 2023? 3 reasons to be \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on BTC now }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT }}}\uc2  ) rebound off $5 is facing resistance near the 20-day EMA ($5.69). This suggests that bears continue to view the rallies as a selling opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6465bd78-82dd-47e6-a646-68db85d356f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the bears will try to pull the DOT/USDT pair to the crucial support at $5. A break and close below this level will indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $4.32.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. If they can pull it off, it will suggest that the downtrend could be ending. The pair could then rally to $7.43.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC }}}\uc2  ) surged and closed above the overhead resistance of $75 on Nov. 23 but the bulls could not build upon the breakout. The bears are attempting to pull the price back below $75 on Nov. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/8da5992a-34f3-4a59-bbdb-761a37e6eba5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the LTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($65). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a strong bounce off it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then strive to push the price above $84 and open the doors for a possible rally to $104.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears pull the price below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that higher levels continue to attract sellers. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($58).\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI }}}\uc2  ) has formed a large symmetrical triangle pattern, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. The price rebounded off the support line of the triangle on Nov. 22, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/1d09b9ec-174c-48fd-90d8-5332f7f9b3f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery attempt could face resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from it, the bears will again try to sink the UNI/USDT pair below the triangle. If that happens, the pair could drop to $3.33.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the pair could climb to the resistance line of the triangle. This level could act as a major hurdle but if bulls overcome it, the pair could rise to $8 and thereafter attempt a rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC }}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvZjBjZjYyY2UtYmZjMC00ODVhLWI5OWEtMzcwZDNkNjUzMjIyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image. }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221125eibp0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Cardano to launch new algorithmic stablecoin in 2023\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Judith BannermanQuist \par \uc2 364 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The algorithmic stablecoin is a result of a collaboration between Cardano and AG-based Layer 1 protocol, COTI.\par \par \uc2 Proof-of-stake blockchain platform, Cardano, has partnered with COTI, a DAG-based Layer 1 protocol, to launch what it refers to as an over-collateralized algorithmic stablecoin. The project said in an announcement provided to Cointelegraph that the stablecoin will be backed by excess collateral in the form of cryptocurrency stored in a reserve.\par \par \uc2 It's official! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24Djed&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $Djed}}}\uc2  will launch on the Cardano Mainnet in January 2023! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24Coti&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $Coti}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24Ada&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22Ada\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Djed?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Djed}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/cu8ryW6Lo7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/cu8ryW6Lo7}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Djed Stablecoin (@DjedStablecoin) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DjedStablecoin/status/1594804397615509506?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the release, Djed is set to go live on the mainnet in Jan. 2023, pending a successful audit and a series of rigorous stress testing. According to the developers, Djed will be pegged to the US Dollar, backed by Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and will use $SHEN as its reserve coin.\par \par \uc2 The algorithmic stablecoin will be integrated with selected partners and Decentralized Exchanges (DEXs), who will reward users for providing liquidity using Djed. In a bid to grow at a sustainably healthy pace, the developers plan to adopt a gradual and slow approach to providing $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  liquidity to the Djed smart contract.\par \par \uc2 Shahaf Bar-Geffen, the CEO of COTI shared at the official announcement at the Cardano Summit:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRecent market events have proven again that we need a safe haven from \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and Djed will serve as this safe haven in the Cardano network. Not only do we need a stablecoin, but we need one that is decentralized, and has on chain proof of reserves.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-chart-paints-burj-khalifa-with-7-month-losing-streak-more-losses-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Related: Cardano price chart paints 'Burj Khalifa' with 7-month losing streak \u8212\'20\'14 More losses ahead?}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s lackluster price action, the blockchain continues to build and innovate within the ecosystem. On Sept. 22, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-cardano-s-vasil-hard-fork-means-for-the-blockchain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s long-awaited Vasil upgrade finally went live}}}\uc2 . The hard fork was designed to help improve the ecosystem\u8217\'20\'19s scalability and general transaction throughput capacity, as well as advance Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/defi-101/what-are-dapps-everything-there-is-to-know-about-decentralized-applications"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized applications (DApps)}}}\uc2  development capacity. At the time of publication, Cardano was trading at $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvNDQ2NTAwZGYtM2M1MC00MmI3LWExNjItMjA0YTdjNGJjNGYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221121eibl000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/21: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,772 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto markets have started the week on a weak note, suggesting that buyers remain skeptical about buying any significant dips.\par \par \uc2 Continued selling in the cryptocurrency markets pulled the total market capitalization below $800 billion on Nov. 21. Traders are increasingly nervous about the extent of damage FTX\u8217\'20\'19s collapse may have on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-next-btc-price-black-swan-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several crypto firms}}}\uc2 . Until the uncertainty clears, it is futile to expect a sustained recovery in cryptocurrency prices.\par \par \uc2 The FTX saga has broken the close correlation between the United States equities markets and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). While Bitcoin is trading close to its 52-week low, the S&P 500 (SPX) has recovered sharply from its low made on Oct. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/3b0291a0-b3e8-435a-a489-a17c45e01d36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) is usually inversely correlated to Bitcoin but its recent drop from the multi-year high did not benefit Bitcoin. This suggests that crypto buyers remain on the sidelines and are not venturing in to buy.\par \par \uc2 However, Billionaire investor and hedge fund manager \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2  said in a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  thread on Nov. 20 that crypto was \u8220\'20\'1Chere to stay with proper oversight and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1DHe also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-investor-bill-ackman-says-crypto-is-here-to-stay"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highlighted the potential of cryptocurrencies}}}\uc2  to \u8220\'20\'1Cgreatly benefit society and grow the global economy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could the cryptocurrency market catch up with the U.S. stock markets? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the S&P 500 index, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) and the major cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index has been in a strong recovery since bottoming out at 3,491 on Oct. 13. Although the 4,000 level has been acting as a resistance in the past few days, a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6e4eccbe-17a5-4b40-9222-7253f0b7d8b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average (3,879) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls push the price above 4,029, the up-move could reach the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The bears have successfully halted previous relief rallies near the downtrend line hence they will try to do the same again.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line but does not slip below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. That could increase the likelihood of a break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. The index could then decline to the 50-day simple moving average (3,786).\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index plunged below the uptrend line on Nov. 10. This is the first indication that the index may have topped out in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f6579e9f-e27b-46d5-873b-efeaa13d1014.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index rebounded off the support near 105, indicating strong buying on dips. The 20-day EMA (108) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears have an edge in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If the relief rally stalls near the 20-day EMA, the bears will make another attempt to pull the index below 105. If they succeed, the next stop could be 103.50 and then 102.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the index could rise to the uptrend line. The bulls will have to push the price back above this level to indicate that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains in a downtrend. The bears pulled the price below the immediate support of $16,229 on Nov. 21, which suggests a lack of demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/654bd8f2-a52a-4ff9-bfa9-379e3673fba4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $16,229, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the vital support at $15,588. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then start its downward journey toward $12,200.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks back above $16,229, it will suggest that the bulls are buying the dips below $16,000. The bulls will then attempt to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $17,190.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) continues to gradually slide toward the support line of the descending channel pattern. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below the channel could intensify selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/d70a7d62-c350-445a-912e-c1230bdba633.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could then drop to the psychological level of $1,000 and thereafter to the vital support at $881. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1,381) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the support line with strength, it will suggest that buyers are defending the level with all their might. They will then try to clear the moving averages and open the doors for a possible rally to the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has declined to the critical support at $258 which could witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/b19d478e-7069-42b3-be3a-5aa8833a4c45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($284) and the RSI below 37 indicate that bears have the upper hand. If bears sink and sustain the price below $258, the selling could pick up momentum and the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $239 and thereafter to $216.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy the dips to $258. The pair could then rise to the moving averages where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on Nov. 20 but could not clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.39). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/227aff4f-52d3-49cc-af2c-f3cf068d582d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could drop to the support line where buyers may step in. A strong rebound off the support line will suggest that the pair has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below the support line, the pair could drop to the $0.32 to $0.30 support zone. A strong rebound off this zone will indicate that the pair may remain stuck between $0.30 and $0.41 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below $0.30 to signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong downtrend. The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $0.31 on Nov. 21 opening the doors for a possible drop to the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/053a498c-4150-45df-ad27-fc5b68cb5bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be waning. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a recovery from the support line, which is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.34).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. That could result in a retest of the support line. If this level cracks, the selling could accelerate and the pair may drop to $0.25. Contrarily, a break above the 20-day EMA could embolden the buyers who may push the pair to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-levels-to-watch-as-traders-bet-on-sub-14k-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price levels to watch as traders bet on sub-$14K BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for several days, Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 50-day SMA ($0.08) on Nov. 20. This indicates that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/0319d5a1-9be5-4ba7-9290-4bd7767bba80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.09) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative area, indicating that the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to the immediate support at $0.07. If this level also gives way, the pair could complete a 100% retracement of the entire rally and drop to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level or $0.07, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above $0.09. A close above this resistance could signal that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then rally to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) dropped to the uptrend line on Nov. 21. This level has acted as a support on two previous occasions, hence the bulls will again try to defend it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/bf436a57-64a0-4e42-aea0-95c0494f2199.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A recovery from the uptrend line could face strong selling near the 20-day EMA ($0.91). If the price turns down from this level, the pair could again retest the uptrend line. A break below this level could pull the pair to the important support at $0.69. This level is likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the 20-day EMA remains the key resistance to keep an eye on. If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $0.97 and later to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.05.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong downtrend. The bears pulled the price below the pennant formation and the Nov. 10 intraday low of $5.32 on Nov. 20. This indicates the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/9bb3398c-428a-4f0d-b3e5-c31be9b8e0d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers may attempt to start a recovery from the psychological level of $5 which could reach the breakdown level from the pennant. If bears flip this level into resistance, the prospects of a decline to $4.08 increase.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.86), it will indicate aggressive buying at lower levels. That may trigger short covering from the aggressive bulls, clearing the path for a possible rally to $6.50.\par \par \uc2 The views, thoughts and opinions expressed here are the authors\u8217\'20\'19 alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvODEzYzc3ZmYtYTcyNC00NGQwLTgwMDItYTMwOTYyYjk2OTFmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221121eibl000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, UNI, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,808 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are struggling to rise above their immediate resistance levels, indicating that the bears remain in full control.\par \par \uc2 The sentiment across the cryptocurrency ecosystem remains fragile as market participants assess the impact of the FTX crisis on various businesses within and outside of the crypto sector. Trading firm QCP Capital said in its latest circular on Telegram that crypto assets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-may-still-drop-40-after-ftx-lehman-moment-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may continue their underperformance}}}\uc2  till the new year. QCP projects Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to plunge to $12,000 and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) to $800.\par \par \uc2 Looking at the brighter side, FTX could be the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-likely-the-last-crypto-giant-to-fall-this-cycle-hedge-fund-co-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 last major player to bite the dust}}}\uc2  during the current bear market cycle, according to CK Zheng, co-founder of crypto hedge fund ZX Squared Capital.\par \par \uc2 Zheng also added that institutional investors who have a long-term horizon may continue to invest in blockchain technology and select cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin and Ethereum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/8d062b51-fbbf-493e-8f6e-8022e4ef4559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 When the sentiment is \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rumors create panic among traders who dump their holdings out of fear. Usually, these occasions form a bottom. Traders may remain cautious and avoid placing large bets until the dust settles and the markets confirm a bottom.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to keep an eye on and which could suggest that the correction may be over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to trade below the breakdown level of $17,622, which is a negative sign. After a period of high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the price has been stuck in the range between $16,229 and $17,190.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/e6a8dd77-9661-4c5d-abbf-f84a9dcb708f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $17,980 is sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that the bears are in control. If the price turns down and breaks below $16,229, the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair could retest the Nov. 9 low of $15,588.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below this support could trigger panic selling, which could pull the pair to $12,200. On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above $17,190, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance zone between $17,622 and the 20-day EMA. A break and close above this zone could indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether has been gradually losing ground in the past few days. The bears may try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the immediate support of $1,171. If they succeed, the pair could decline to the support line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f5001dd9-b114-4cb1-afcb-e103f7722dc1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA of $1,325 and the RSI in the negative zone indicate that sellers have the upper hand. If the bears pull the price below the support line of the channel, the selling could accelerate and the ETH/USDT pair may drop to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. Such a move could open the gates for a possible rally to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) once again dipped close to the strong support of $258 on Nov. 17, but the bulls held their ground. Buyers will now attempt to start a relief rally that could reach the 20-day EMA of $291.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/d0036c03-5678-4638-b4d2-5dab5d8ce860.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears are in control. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to break the support at $258. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could dive to $239 and then to $216.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $300. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to open the doors for a possible rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling near the downtrend line. This suggests that the bears are trying to build upon their advantage and pull the price below the immediate support of $0.36.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/19788bab-c482-4af4-ac2d-f191f06466b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA of $0.41 and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance could be to the downside. If the $0.36 level gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could plunge to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, buyers will have to overcome the stiff challenge in the zone between the downtrend line and $0.41. If that happens, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the 50-day SMA of $0.45.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remains in a strong downtrend and the bears are trying to sink the price below the crucial support at $0.31. However, the bulls are likely to have other plans and they may try to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f3f818ca-056e-4cef-a8cd-2b105d6ba04c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Any relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance in the zone between $0.35 and the 20-day EMA of $0.36. If the price turns down from this zone, the likelihood of a break below $0.31 increases. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then plummet to the support line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the next stop could be $0.25.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the near term if buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line. A break and close above this resistance could suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA of $0.08, and the bears are selling the relief rallies to the 20-day EMA ($0.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/a0c6fa5b-4889-484c-ba74-96b8176963a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to the bears. If the price turns down and slips below the 50-day SMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.07 and later to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans as they will try to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could start a stronger recovery and rally toward $0.12.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for the past few days, Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 50-day SMA of $0.89 on Nov. 17. Buyers tried to push the price back above the 50-day SMA on Nov. 18 but are facing stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6ee95b18-9149-443b-a6db-f00210496417.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price back above the 50-day SMA, the MATIC/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA of $0.95. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level, but if the bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to rise above the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could increase the likelihood of a drop to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-sees-record-138k-btc-inflows-as-opinions-differ-on-what-bitcoin-price-will-do-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance sees record 138K BTC inflows as opinions differ on what Bitcoin price will do next}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a pennant, which generally acts as a continuation pattern. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that sellers have the edge in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f21e5d5a-447e-4f15-838a-f0e44aa2f789.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the pennant, the selling could pick up. The DOT/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend on a break below $5.32. The next support on the downside is at $4.32.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues higher and breaks above the pennant, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA of $6.22. A break and close above this level could suggest that the short-term downturn could be over.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA of $6.43 on Nov. 16, but the bulls are attempting to form a higher low at $5.66.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/947e623b-62c2-4359-ac1e-25c8c1cab3a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA to gain the upper hand. If they manage to do that, the UNI/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $7.36 and thereafter to $7.79.\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Nov. 18 candlestick shows that the bears are defending the moving averages. The downsloping 20-day EMA of $6.20 and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the bears are at an advantage. A break and close below $5.66 may clear the path for a retest of $5.14.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA of $59 on Nov. 17 and the RSI jumped into positive territory, indicating that the bulls have a slight edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/66b11d41-f6e4-48cc-b7e5-1a91b1de39b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to face stiff resistance at $65. If the price turns down from this level, the LTC/USDT pair could again drop toward the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers drive and sustain the price above $65, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $75.\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might. If the price turns down from $75, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $46 to $75 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvYTZmODUzZmUtNDM2Mi00Yzc4LWE0NWQtOGEyNDk5MmIzMDdkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221118eibi000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, DOT, UNI, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,817 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 November 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are selling at the top of each bounce and rally, suggesting that crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  is tilted toward more downside.\par \par \uc2 The collapse of FTX cryptocurrency exchange has created a liquidity crisis in the crypto space, which could extend the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-crisis-could-extend-crypto-winter-to-the-end-of-2023-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto winter through the end of 2023  }}}\uc2 , according to a research report by \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  .\par \par \uc2 According to analysts, the FTX implosion could keep the institutional investors at bay because they are even more likely to tread cautiously for some time.\par \par \uc2 The crisis has negatively impacted several crypto-focused companies who have assets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-bankruptcy-freezes-millions-worth-of-crypto-company-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stuck  }}}\uc2  on FTX following the company's bankruptcy filing on Nov. 11. Investors also fear the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-crypto-lender-genesis-global-halts-withdrawals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 contagion could spread  }}}\uc2 , causing further damage to the cryptocurrency ecosystem.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/7445dc66-d769-4d7d-ba19-6417b34aeed6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360  }}}\par \par \uc2 Although several investors were rattled by the collapse of FTX, billionaire venture capitalist and serial blockchain investor Tim Draper remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC  }}}\uc2  ). In a Nov.15 interview with Cointelegraph, Draper doubled down on his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tim-draper-still-positive-on-250k-bitcoin-price-prediction-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $250,000 target for Bitcoin in 2023  }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, investors should take the price projection with a pinch of salt because it is unlikely that Bitcoin will start a roaring bull market in the near future.\par \par \uc2 What are the key support and resistance levels to watch out for on Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed below the June low of $17,622 on Nov. 9. This marked the resumption of the downtrend. Although bulls tried to stage a strong recovery on Nov. 10, their efforts met with heavy selling above $17,622. This suggests that the bears have flipped the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/fe2bd8e9-fb23-4e1a-acb3-7727f7fb2d38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($18,271) has turned down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory. This suggests that the bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $17,622, it will increase the prospect of a break below $15,588, If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could extend its decline to $12,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then challenge the psychological level at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH  }}}\uc2  ) has been declining inside a descending channel pattern for the past several weeks. The failure to push the price above the channel on Nov. 4 may have led to profit-booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/ddddc02b-0c01-40e5-a2ec-02fc530f3217.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers aggressively bought the dip to the support line on Nov. 10 but the relief rally fizzled out near the 50-day simple moving average ($1,372). This suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The bears will again strive to sink the price below the channel. If that happens, the selling could intensify and the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $1,000. To gain the upper hand, buyers will have to push the price above the moving averages. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB  }}}\uc2  ) soared to $398 on Nov. 8 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The selling continued on Nov. 9 and pulled the price near the strong support at $258.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/2ff5a89f-7b19-4d49-8804-c55721071046.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the drop on Nov. 10 but they could not thrust the price above the 20-day EMA ($295). This suggests that the sentiment turned negative and bears were selling the relief rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to break the support at $258 and if they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $239 and later to $216. This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if bulls push and sustain the price above $313.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP  }}}\uc2  ) re-entered the $0.41 to $0.30 range on Nov. 8, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels. The selling continued on Nov. 9 and the price dropped to $0.32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/02359284-fa5d-4b5b-a731-f4da81e5d029.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip and tried to push the price back above $0.41 but the bears did not relent. This suggests that the bears have flipped the $0.41 level into resistance. The bears will again try to pull the pair to the critical support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. On the upside, the first sign of strength will be a break and close above $0.41. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.45).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is in a strong downtrend. Although both moving averages are sloping down, the RSI is attempting to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/6cbeabd7-9b14-403c-b12b-df600679a8fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. Such a move will suggest a potential trend change. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.31, the pair could drop to the support line. This line has arrested the decline on three previous occasions, hence the bulls may again buy the dip to this level. If buyers fail to defend the level, the pair could extend its downtrend to $0.25.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE  }}}\uc2  ) witnessed a sharp rally from $0.06 on Oct. 25 to $0.16 on Nov. 1. That pushed the RSI into extremely overbought levels, which may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/db9b6ed2-87e0-4394-b484-6b4e4e181bc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum after bulls failed to defend the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.11. Buyers defended the 50-day SMA ($0.08) on Nov. 9 but the bears halted the recovery at the 20-day EMA ($0.09).\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could complete a 100% retracement and drop to $0.06. Contrarily, a break above $0.10 will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The pair could then rise to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC  }}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance of $1.05 on Nov. 4 but the rally met with stiff resistance at $1.30 on Nov. 5. Buyers tried to resume the up-move on Nov. 7 but could not clear the overhead hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/19d1701a-96e5-4f14-a2a7-ee36a1e2615d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sold aggressively on Nov. 8 and 9 and pulled the price below the moving averages but the buyers held the uptrend line. The MATIC/USDT pair rebounded sharply on Nov. 10 but the bears sold at higher levels and pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.96) on Nov. 12.\par \par \uc2 If the price slides below the 50-day SMA ($0.89), the pair could drop to the uptrend line. A break below this support could open the doors for a retest of the crucial support at $0.69. On the contrary, if buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dips-to-16-4k-over-genesis-woes-as-execs-defend-gbtc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price dips to $16.4K over Genesis woes as execs defend GBTC  }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT  }}}\uc2  ) plunged below the strong support zone of $6 to $5.68 on Nov. 9. This indicates the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/55489e45-5c85-45a2-a926-e99d594cb85a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push the price back above $6 and trap the aggressive bears but the sellers held their ground. This indicates that the bears are trying to flip the $6 level into resistance.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($6.12) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to the bears. The sellers will make one more attempt to pull the DOT/USDT pair below $5.32. If they succeed, the pair could extend its decline to $4.32. To invalidate this negative view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI  }}}\uc2  ) had been trading between $5.14 and $7.36 for the past several days. Buyers drove the price above the resistance on Nov. 4 but could not build upon this advantage. The bears pulled the price back into the range on Nov. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/f805ed3a-a8d7-435a-b31f-62bf5645ee59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This may have trapped the aggressive bulls who then rushed to the exit. Long liquidation and selling by the bears pulled the price below the support of $5.14 on Nov. 8 but this proved to be a bear trap. The bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back into the range on Nov. 10.\par \par \uc2 The recovery is facing stiff resistance at the moving averages, indicating selling at higher levels. The bears may again attempt to sink and sustain the price below the range but the bulls are expected to defend the support aggressively.\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the UNI/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $4.71 and $7.79 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC  }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $46 and $75 for the past several weeks. The failure of the bulls to push the price above $75 on Nov. 7 may have attracted profit-booking by short-term traders. That pulled the price near the support of $46 on Nov. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-11/2957a216-41a8-4199-bd3a-e824d40f43d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 When the price is stuck inside a range, traders generally buy the dips to the support level and that is what happened on Nov. 10. The LTC/USDT pair continued its rise on Nov. 11 but met with strong selling near $65. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. This indicates that the pair could trade in a tight range between $53 and $65 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvOTU3ZTA2YTctMDFkNy00MmJhLThlZTgtNTQ2YmQ5MDU4NmMyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221116eibg000b6\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market reaction" OR "price drop" OR "price rise" OR "volatility" OR "bullish" OR "bearish" OR "investor sentiment" OR "regulation" OR "ETF approval" OR "crypto ban" OR "crypto adoption" OR "digital\u160\'00\'A0asset")\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx907